1
00:00:01,333 --> 00:00:04,133
♪ IN THE NOT-TOO-DISTANT
FUTURE ♪

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,467
♪ NEXT SUNDAY A.D. ♪

3
00:00:07,533 --> 00:00:10,400
♪ THERE WAS A GUY
NAMED JOEL ♪

4
00:00:10,467 --> 00:00:13,867
♪ NOT TOO DIFFERENT
FROM YOU OR ME ♪

5
00:00:13,933 --> 00:00:16,667
♪ HE WORKED AT
GIZMONIC INSTITUTE ♪

6
00:00:16,733 --> 00:00:19,633
♪ JUST ANOTHER FACE
IN A RED JUMPSUIT ♪

7
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,667
♪ HE DID A GOOD JOB
CLEANING UP THE PLACE ♪

8
00:00:22,733 --> 00:00:24,467
♪ BUT HIS BOSSES
DIDN'T LIKE HIM ♪

9
00:00:24,533 --> 00:00:27,000
♪ SO THEY SHOT HIM
INTO SPACE ♪

10
00:00:29,233 --> 00:00:32,500
♪ WE'LL SEND HIM
CHEESY MOVIES ♪

11
00:00:32,567 --> 00:00:35,533
- ♪ THE WORST WE CAN FIND ♪
- ♪ LA LA LA ♪

12
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,433
♪ HE'LL HAVE TO SIT
AND WATCH THEM ALL ♪

13
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:41,667
- ♪ AND WE'LL MONITOR HIS MIND ♪
- ♪ LA LA LA ♪

14
00:00:41,733 --> 00:00:44,633
♪ NOW KEEP IN MIND
JOEL CAN'T CONTROL ♪

15
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,900
- ♪ WHERE THE MOVIES
BEGIN OR END ♪
- ♪ LA LA LA ♪

16
00:00:47,967 --> 00:00:51,100
♪ BECAUSE HE USED
THOSE SPECIAL PARTS ♪

17
00:00:51,167 --> 00:00:54,233
♪ TO MAKE HIS ROBOT FRIENDS ♪

18
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:57,633
♪ ROBOT ROLL CALL ♪

19
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:58,933
- ♪ CAMBOT ♪
- CAMBOT.

20
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,233
- ♪ GYPSY ♪
- HI, GIRL.

21
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:02,100
- ♪ TOM SERVO ♪
- WHAT A COOL GUY.

22
00:01:02,167 --> 00:01:03,667
- ♪ CROW ♪
- OH, A WISECRACKER.

23
00:01:03,733 --> 00:01:06,800
♪ IF YOU'RE WONDERING
HOW HE EATS AND BREATHES ♪

24
00:01:06,867 --> 00:01:09,733
- ♪ AND OTHER SCIENCE FACTS ♪
- ♪ LA LA LA ♪

25
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:13,000
♪ THEN REPEAT TO YOURSELF
IT'S JUST A SHOW ♪

26
00:01:13,067 --> 00:01:15,900
♪ I SHOULD REALLY JUST RELAX ♪

27
00:01:15,967 --> 00:01:21,200
♪ FOR "MYSTERY SCIENCE
THEATER 3000" ♪♪

28
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:33,433
- ANY MORE RAISINS?
- ALL RIGHT, IT'S SNACK TIME.

29
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:36,000
OH, HI, EVERYBODY, WELCOME
TO THE SATELLITE OF LOVE.

30
00:01:36,067 --> 00:01:37,200
I'M JOEL ROBINSON.

31
00:01:37,267 --> 00:01:38,767
WE'RE JUST WAITING FOR
THIS WEEK'S EXPERIMENT.

32
00:01:38,833 --> 00:01:40,500
- THIS IS CROW T. ROBOT...
- BOOGIE OOGIE!

33
00:01:40,567 --> 00:01:41,800
...AND THIS IS TOM SERVO.

34
00:01:41,867 --> 00:01:43,300
THEY GOT BUGLES?
I LOVE BUGLES.

35
00:01:43,367 --> 00:01:45,400
YOU KNOW, YOU GUYS, I WAS
JUST TALKING TO TV'S FRANK

36
00:01:45,467 --> 00:01:47,233
AND HE WAS SAYING
HOW THIS WEEK'S MOVIE

37
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:48,767
IS IN BLACK AND WHITE,
PRETTY COOL, HUH?

38
00:01:48,833 --> 00:01:51,167
OH, NO, NOT ANOTHER
BLACK AND WHITE!

39
00:01:51,233 --> 00:01:53,633
OH, COME ON, CROW,
BLACK AND WHITE'S GRITTY.

40
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:56,100
IT HELPS GET ACROSS
THE HARSH REALISM

41
00:01:56,167 --> 00:01:57,367
THAT IS EVERYDAY LIFE.

42
00:01:57,433 --> 00:01:59,067
OH, GEE, SOUNDS LIKE FUN.

43
00:01:59,133 --> 00:02:00,567
THE WAY I SEE IT,
ROBINSON,

44
00:02:00,633 --> 00:02:02,967
THE JOADS HAD A DEPRESSING
ENOUGH LIFE AS IT WAS,

45
00:02:03,033 --> 00:02:05,167
AND THEN THEY FILMED IT
IN BLACK AND WHITE.

46
00:02:05,233 --> 00:02:07,433
GIVE ME COLOR!
GIVE ME SOME PIZZAZZ!

47
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:09,300
HEY, WHAT DO YOU THINK,
TOM SERVO?

48
00:02:09,367 --> 00:02:10,767
UH, ABOUT WHAT?

49
00:02:10,833 --> 00:02:12,700
WELL, YOU KNOW, THAT
HOW SOME OF OUR MOVIES

50
00:02:12,767 --> 00:02:13,767
ARE IN BLACK AND WHITE

51
00:02:13,833 --> 00:02:15,533
AND SOME OF OUR MOVIES
ARE IN COLOR.

52
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:18,000
UH, I'M NOT SURE
I UNDERSTAND THE QUESTION.

53
00:02:18,067 --> 00:02:19,100
OH, COME ON!

54
00:02:19,167 --> 00:02:22,033
MOVIE A: COLOR,
MOVIE B: BLACK AND WHITE.

55
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:24,433
WELL, LOOK, WE CAN'T ALL NOTICE
THE SAME SUBTLETIES.

56
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:26,367
SUBTLETIES? WHY,
THAT'S NOT EVEN THE POINT.

57
00:02:26,433 --> 00:02:29,600
- JUST A SECOND, CROW.
- UM, WHAT, WHAT?

58
00:02:29,667 --> 00:02:32,867
TOM, WHAT COLOR
IS MY JUMPSUIT?

59
00:02:32,933 --> 00:02:36,500
- RED.
- OKAY, AND WHAT COLOR IS CROW?

60
00:02:36,567 --> 00:02:38,667
- RED.
- COMMERCIAL SIGN IN FIVE,

61
00:02:38,733 --> 00:02:41,800
FOUR, THREE, TWO...
WHAT COLOR IS DR. FORRESTER?

62
00:02:41,867 --> 00:02:43,267
RED. WHAT ABOUT IT?

63
00:02:43,333 --> 00:02:44,933
OKAY, I THINK I KNOW
WHAT'S WRONG.

64
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:45,933
WE'LL BE RIGHT BACK.

65
00:02:52,333 --> 00:02:54,533
YOU HAVE A VERY KIND FACE.

66
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:56,267
TOM, NOW CUT IT OUT!

67
00:02:56,333 --> 00:02:59,167
I SAID YOU WERE COLOR-BLIND,
NOT BLIND.

68
00:02:59,233 --> 00:03:00,533
I MIGHT AS WELL BE,

69
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:02,600
FOR ALL THE AZURE SKIES
I'VE MISSED,

70
00:03:02,667 --> 00:03:04,800
ALL THE GREEN FIELDS
AND APPLE BLOSSOMS

71
00:03:04,867 --> 00:03:06,600
I'VE NEVER TRULY SEEN.

72
00:03:06,667 --> 00:03:09,767
WHEN I THINK OF
THE ELABORATE STORIES
YOU'VE HAD TO INVENT

73
00:03:09,833 --> 00:03:12,167
TO COVER FOR THE HIDEOUS LIE
YOU'VE BEEN LIVING.

74
00:03:12,233 --> 00:03:13,300
[SOBBING]

75
00:03:13,367 --> 00:03:15,267
OH, TOM, IT WOULDN'T
HAVE MATTERED TO ME.

76
00:03:15,333 --> 00:03:17,000
- [BOTH SOBBING]
- YOU GUYS, YOU GUYS, YOU--

77
00:03:17,067 --> 00:03:18,533
YOU GUYS,
LISTEN TO ME,

78
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:20,733
YOU'RE TAKING THIS
ALL TOO SERIOUSLY.

79
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:24,867
I-- I THINK TOM JUST HAS
A SIMPLE RED-GREEN
COLOR DEFICIENCY.

80
00:03:24,933 --> 00:03:27,267
OH, UH, JOEL,
BAUSCH & LOMB ARE CALLING.

81
00:03:27,333 --> 00:03:29,800
OH, YOU'RE COLOR-BLIND?

82
00:03:29,867 --> 00:03:33,233
- UH, WHAT COLOR IS THIS?
- [BOTH CHUCKLING]

83
00:03:33,300 --> 00:03:37,367
NOW WHAT COLOR IS THIS?
[LAUGHING]

84
00:03:37,433 --> 00:03:38,600
SORRY.

85
00:03:38,667 --> 00:03:41,667
WELL, JOEL, YOU MAY NOT KNOW
THAT FRANK AND I,

86
00:03:41,733 --> 00:03:43,733
WITH A LITTLE PROMPTING
FROM "THE UTNE READER,"

87
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:46,700
HAVE BEEN HOSTING A WEEKLY
DISCUSSION SALON.

88
00:03:46,767 --> 00:03:48,333
YET WITH OUR HECTIC SCHEDULES

89
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:50,033
OFTENTIMES OUR GUESTS
WILL ARRIVE

90
00:03:50,100 --> 00:03:52,500
BEFORE WE'VE HAD TIME
TO PROPERLY REVIEW

91
00:03:52,567 --> 00:03:54,200
SUSAN FALUDI'S "BACKLASH,"

92
00:03:54,267 --> 00:03:57,467
MUCH LESS GIVE THE APARTMENT
THAT SUITABLE BOHEMIAN LOOK.

93
00:03:57,533 --> 00:04:01,500
THAT'S WHY WE'VE DEVELOPED
THESE NEW BEAN BAG PANTS.

94
00:04:01,567 --> 00:04:05,000
NOW THESE PANTS ALLOW YOU
TO RELAX ANYWHERE

95
00:04:05,067 --> 00:04:09,233
AND TO SIT DOWN AND HAVE
A NICE HOT CUP OF TALK.

96
00:04:09,300 --> 00:04:11,467
FRANK, WHY HAVEN'T YOU
PUT YOUR PANTS ON YET?

97
00:04:11,533 --> 00:04:13,733
- [BOTH LAUGH]
- I'M JOKING, OF COURSE.

98
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:16,267
- I KID.
- ♪ BABY GOT BACK, UHH! ♪

99
00:04:16,333 --> 00:04:17,467
ACTUALLY, YOU KNOW WHAT?

100
00:04:17,533 --> 00:04:18,967
THEY'RE PERFECT
FOR SIT-INS.

101
00:04:19,033 --> 00:04:22,167
IMAGINE JUST ONCE INTEGRATING
A SOUTHERN LUNCH COUNTER

102
00:04:22,233 --> 00:04:23,800
IN CUSHY COMFORT.

103
00:04:23,867 --> 00:04:25,433
YES, INDEED,
AND THEY'RE PERFECT

104
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:28,833
FOR THOSE WHISPERY
DISCUSSIONS OF WHITE GUILT
WITH GOOD FRIENDS.

105
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:30,000
FRANK?

106
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:35,733
YOU KNOW, I THOUGHT
THAT THE INVENTION

107
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:38,400
LACKED A CERTAIN
JE NE SAIS QUOI,

108
00:04:38,467 --> 00:04:41,167
- A CERTAIN DEPTH.
- UH, I DISAGREE.

109
00:04:41,233 --> 00:04:43,700
AND YET IT'S SO REFRESHING
TO MEET SOMEONE

110
00:04:43,767 --> 00:04:45,700
WITH A FRESH
OPINION LIKE YOURS.

111
00:04:45,767 --> 00:04:48,867
GOSH, SIRS, THAT ACTUALLY SEEMS
LIKE A REALLY NICE IDEA:

112
00:04:48,933 --> 00:04:51,800
PROMOTING OPEN DIALOG
AND SOCIAL CHANGE.

113
00:04:51,867 --> 00:04:54,400
TODAY'S INVENTION EXCHANGE
FROM THE SATELLITE OF LOVE

114
00:04:54,467 --> 00:04:56,600
IS BASED ON THE PREMISE
THAT IT'S A REALLY GOOD IDEA

115
00:04:56,667 --> 00:04:58,800
TO WEAR RECYCLED PAPER
AS CLOTHING,

116
00:04:58,867 --> 00:05:02,467
AND WE'VE GOT A PERSUASIVE
PRESENTATION TO PROVE IT.

117
00:05:02,533 --> 00:05:05,200
I'M GYPSY, AND
YESTERDAY'S NEWS

118
00:05:05,267 --> 00:05:07,300
IS TOMORROW'S
FISH AND CHIP PAPER.

119
00:05:07,367 --> 00:05:10,233
- REMEMBER TO PITCH IN.
- THAT'S RIGHT, GYPSY.

120
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:13,667
HER DRESS WAS A TREE, THEN
IT WAS A PILE OF NEWSPAPERS.

121
00:05:13,733 --> 00:05:15,533
NOW IT'S A DRESS AND SOON
IT WILL BE

122
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,900
A PITHY GREETING CARD.

123
00:05:16,967 --> 00:05:18,500
PRETTY RESPONSIBLE, EH?

124
00:05:18,567 --> 00:05:21,167
I'M CROW, AND MY SUIT
IS MADE ENTIRELY

125
00:05:21,233 --> 00:05:23,367
OUT OF USED
VIVA PAPER TOWELS.

126
00:05:23,433 --> 00:05:25,800
I WEAR IT TO THE DISCOS 'CAUSE
I'M THE QUICKER PICKER-UPPER.

127
00:05:25,867 --> 00:05:28,200
[CHUCKLES]
HOW TRUE, CROW.

128
00:05:28,267 --> 00:05:29,433
IT'S SO ABSORBENT.

129
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:31,667
YOU KNOW, YOU COULD
SPILL SOUP, DROOL,

130
00:05:31,733 --> 00:05:33,833
OR EVEN DROP A PITCHER
OF MARGARITAS ON HIM

131
00:05:33,900 --> 00:05:36,500
AND HE'LL REMAIN
WARM AND DRY.

132
00:05:36,567 --> 00:05:38,700
AND I'M TOM SERVO,
AND I MAY BE COLOR-BLIND

133
00:05:38,767 --> 00:05:40,167
BUT IT'S PLAIN TO SEE
I'M WEARING A DRESS.

134
00:05:40,233 --> 00:05:42,167
- WHAT AM I, "THAT GIRL?"
- MAYBE SO.

135
00:05:42,233 --> 00:05:46,333
IN THAT CASE, YOU
CAN'T AFFORD TO BE SEEN
IN THE SAME THING TWICE.

136
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:49,167
CHANGE IN A FLASH WITH
OUR FLASH PAPER CLOTHING.

137
00:05:49,233 --> 00:05:51,467
- JUST ONE FLICK
OF THE BIC AND--
- UH-OH.

138
00:05:51,533 --> 00:05:53,800
WHOA! AAH! OHH, OHH!

139
00:05:53,867 --> 00:05:55,800
[EXHALES]
OH, FOR CRYING OUT LOUD,

140
00:05:55,867 --> 00:05:58,667
NOT ONLY AM I COLOR-BLIND,
I'M FLASH-BLIND NOW TOO.

141
00:05:58,733 --> 00:06:00,333
OH, JEEZ,
I'M GONNA GO LAY DOWN.

142
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:02,000
- [CLATTER]
- [GROANS] OW! GEE!

143
00:06:02,067 --> 00:06:03,133
- [CLOTH RIPPING]
- THERE GO THE DRAPES.

144
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,167
WHAT DO YOU THINK, SIRS?

145
00:06:04,233 --> 00:06:06,333
SORRY,
WE MISSED THAT, JOEL.

146
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:10,567
UH, ANYWAY, YOUR MOVIE THIS WEEK
IS CALLED "MANHUNT IN SPACE."

147
00:06:10,633 --> 00:06:14,000
BUT FIRST, A LITTLE
KINESCOPE SUPPOSITORY

148
00:06:14,067 --> 00:06:15,933
FROM OUR VIDEO DEPOSITORY.

149
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,000
IT'S AN OLD
"GENERAL HOSPITAL."

150
00:06:18,067 --> 00:06:19,433
[GROANING]

151
00:06:19,500 --> 00:06:20,800
OH, WE-- OW!

152
00:06:20,867 --> 00:06:23,533
WE'VE GOT MOVIE SIGN!

153
00:06:31,733 --> 00:06:34,867
- PHIL?
- OH, DON'T MAKE ME WALK
ALL THE WAY OVER THERE, PHIL.

154
00:06:36,467 --> 00:06:37,900
IF THIS WILL
CHEER YOU UP ANY,

155
00:06:37,967 --> 00:06:40,333
I CALLED CYNTHIA AND ASKED HER
TO DINNER, AND SHE ACCEPTED,

156
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:43,233
- TO CELEBRATE THE ENGAGEMENT.
- THANKS, NURSE RATCHED.

157
00:06:44,367 --> 00:06:45,400
WELL, THAT'S GREAT.

158
00:06:45,467 --> 00:06:46,733
WELL, WAIT A MINUTE,
IT WAS YOUR IDEA--

159
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:49,467
ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT, I SAID
IT WAS GREAT, DIDN'T I?

160
00:06:49,533 --> 00:06:51,100
WE'LL HAVE A BALL.

161
00:06:51,167 --> 00:06:52,867
IT REALLY CHEERED YOU UP,
EH, PHIL?

162
00:06:52,933 --> 00:06:53,933
JEEPERS.

163
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,067
SORRY, DEAR.

164
00:06:55,133 --> 00:06:56,533
I WILL NOW PERFORM
A MODERN DANCE

165
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,600
TO EXPRESS
MY TRUE FEELINGS.

166
00:06:58,667 --> 00:07:00,833
OH, THIS IS ABOUT
GENERAL HOSPITAL STUFF.

167
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:02,733
YOU KNOW, THOSE LITTLE
WRIST TAGS, BILLING,

168
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:03,967
THAT KIND OF THING.

169
00:07:04,033 --> 00:07:05,633
"GENERAL HOSPITAL"
IS BROUGHT TO YOU BY

170
00:07:05,700 --> 00:07:08,833
- KEN-L RATION.
- [ALL BARKING]

171
00:07:08,900 --> 00:07:11,333
GOING UP, MR. TYLER?

172
00:07:13,900 --> 00:07:15,800
UH, EXCUSE ME, UH,
COULD I GET A--

173
00:07:15,867 --> 00:07:17,267
EXCUSE-- SORRY, OHH.

174
00:07:17,333 --> 00:07:20,333
SOUNDS LIKE
"GENERAL HOSPITAL ON ICE."

175
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:22,400
- GOOD MORNING, LUCY.
- GOOD MORNING, JESSE.

176
00:07:22,467 --> 00:07:23,433
- [PHONE BUZZES]
- I'LL GET IT.

177
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:25,400
SHE'S THE DARK NURSE
OF THE SOUL.

178
00:07:25,467 --> 00:07:26,933
YES, DR. HARDY.

179
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,867
THE NEW X-RAYS
ON MRS. LYONS?

180
00:07:28,933 --> 00:07:30,233
I WOULDN'T KNOW,
I JUST CAME ON DUTY.

181
00:07:30,300 --> 00:07:32,100
- HMM.
- I THINK SHE'S BEEN
INTO THE PERCODAN.

182
00:07:32,167 --> 00:07:33,933
YES, I'LL BRING THEM IN
IF THEY'RE HERE.

183
00:07:35,567 --> 00:07:36,733
- LUCILLE?
- HMM?

184
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,833
A TILT FILM ON MRS. LYONS.
HAS IT COME UP ON X-RAY?

185
00:07:38,900 --> 00:07:40,600
OH, YES.
HERE YOU GO.

186
00:07:40,667 --> 00:07:44,533
HERE ARE YOUR HEADSHOTS
FOR "THE YOUNG AND
THE RESTLESS" AUDITION.

187
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,533
[ORGAN PLAYING]

188
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,700
IT'S A NEW CAR-- OHH.

189
00:07:48,767 --> 00:07:51,100
[AS DRACULA]
I'VE BEEN IN THE BELL
TOWER ALL MORNING.

190
00:07:51,167 --> 00:07:52,900
- GOOD MORNING, DR. BREWER.
- GOOD MORNING, SAM.

191
00:07:52,967 --> 00:07:55,633
- IS JESSE HERE?
- YES, SHE JUST CAME ON DUTY.

192
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:57,267
[MIMICKING]
YES, SHE JUST CAME ON DUTY.

193
00:07:57,333 --> 00:07:59,967
DIDN'T YOU COME TO
THE HOSPITAL TOGETHER?

194
00:08:00,033 --> 00:08:03,100
NO, I LEFT THE APARTMENT
BEFORE SHE DID.

195
00:08:03,167 --> 00:08:04,467
TOOK A WALK.

196
00:08:04,533 --> 00:08:06,467
SEE WHAT YOU CAN DO ABOUT
MAKING THIS LOBBY SPOOKIER.

197
00:08:06,533 --> 00:08:07,733
MM-HMM.

198
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:11,467
JEEZ, HE REALLY SUCKED
THE AIR OUT OF THIS ROOM.

199
00:08:11,533 --> 00:08:13,400
MARRIAGE.

200
00:08:13,467 --> 00:08:16,633
I GUESS IT'S A WONDERFUL BUT
WEIRD INSTITUTION, EH, CLAMPETT?

201
00:08:16,700 --> 00:08:19,000
- I WOULDN'T KNOW, MS. MARR.
- I'M NOT VERY BRIGHT.

202
00:08:19,067 --> 00:08:21,133
...LOOKING AT IT FROM THE OTHER
END OF THE STETHOSCOPE,

203
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:22,433
NEITHER WOULD I.

204
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:25,167
UH, SWISS MISS, WILL YOU
GET ME ANOTHER CUP OF COCOA?

205
00:08:25,233 --> 00:08:27,633
♪♪

206
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:30,300
MORE LETTERS ON HOW
UNAPPEALING YOU ARE, SIR.

207
00:08:32,733 --> 00:08:34,733
SHE KIND OF LOOKS LIKE
UNCLE MILTIE.

208
00:08:34,800 --> 00:08:36,200
YEAH.

209
00:08:36,267 --> 00:08:38,800
AH, HERE COMES NURSE-FERATU.

210
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,133
[GROANS]

211
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:45,533
YOU KNOW, I THINK EVERYBODY
ADMITTED INTO THIS HOSPITAL

212
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:48,300
- COMMITS SUICIDE.
- HMM, MM.

213
00:08:48,367 --> 00:08:49,967
- JESSIE...
- [ALL GASP]

214
00:08:50,033 --> 00:08:51,700
DID YOU DECIDE TO INVITE
CYNTHIA...

215
00:08:51,767 --> 00:08:54,500
- MY GOD, YOU'RE UGLY.
- ...MARTIN TO DINNER TO
CELEBRATE THE ENGAGEMENT?

216
00:08:54,567 --> 00:08:56,867
[MIMICKING]
"DID YOU DECIDE TO INVITE
CYNTHIA AND KEN MARTIN

217
00:08:56,933 --> 00:08:58,700
TO DINNER TO CELEBRATE
THE ENGAGEMENT?"

218
00:08:58,767 --> 00:09:00,733
- IT WILL HELP CLEAR THE AIR.
- [MIMICS AIR GUN]

219
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:03,700
I DON'T KNOW, I'M HAVING MY
DOUBTS THAT IT'S VERY SMART.

220
00:09:03,767 --> 00:09:06,300
WELL, IT'S WHAT PHIL
SUGGESTED, ISN'T IT?

221
00:09:06,367 --> 00:09:08,067
- PHIL?
- IT'S WHAT PHIL SUGGESTED,

222
00:09:08,133 --> 00:09:09,633
BUT I'M NOT VERY SURE
THAT HE REALLY WANTS IT.

223
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:10,867
OH, PHIL THIS,
PHIL THAT.

224
00:09:10,933 --> 00:09:12,200
EVERYTHING'S
PHIL, PHIL, PHIL.

225
00:09:12,267 --> 00:09:13,533
WHAT GOOD IS IT GONNA DO?

226
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,633
I DON'T KNOW, SORT OF MAKE
THE ENGAGEMENT OFFICIAL.

227
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:17,733
[MUMBLING, MIMICKING]

228
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:20,167
...IS GOING TO MARRY KEN MARTIN,
THAT'S WHAT IT'LL DO.

229
00:09:20,233 --> 00:09:21,633
[MIMICS]
THAT'S WHAT IT'LL DO.

230
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:23,133
AT LEAST I HOPE
YOU'RE RIGHT.

231
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,900
WOULD YOU PLEASE
TAKE A BREATH MINT?

232
00:09:24,967 --> 00:09:27,233
OH, EXCUSE ME.

233
00:09:27,300 --> 00:09:28,433
- HI, DOCTOR.
- [BELL CHIMES]

234
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:30,133
SO, UH, WHAT'S THE BARBER
DOING HERE?

235
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:32,800
OH, I'D LIKE TO COUNTERSIGN
THE MEDICATION FOR MR. TURNER.

236
00:09:32,867 --> 00:09:33,933
- OH, YES.
- SAY.

237
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,867
JEEZ, HE WAS OLD
EVEN THEN.

238
00:09:42,467 --> 00:09:44,600
OH, UH, I'LL BE IN
MARTHA LYONS' ROOM.

239
00:09:44,667 --> 00:09:46,500
YES, DR. HARDY.

240
00:09:46,567 --> 00:09:47,833
GOOD MORNING, JESSIE.

241
00:09:47,900 --> 00:09:49,933
MORNING, DR. HARDY.

242
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:52,033
MAN, I STILL GOT IT,
DON'T I?

243
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:53,767
DAMN, I'M GOOD.
"GOOD MORNING, JESSIE"

244
00:09:53,833 --> 00:09:56,533
WAS A STROKE OF GENIUS.

245
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,400
OH, DOCTOR!
DO YOU MIND?

246
00:09:58,467 --> 00:10:00,933
I THINK YOU'RE BEING
A LITTLE UNFAIR.

247
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,633
- WELL, OF COURSE...
- SHE'S NUDE.

248
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:05,200
...I KNOW THAT
YOU'RE A DOCTOR,

249
00:10:05,267 --> 00:10:07,967
AND MAYBE IT IS A SIMPLE
CASE OF INDIGESTION

250
00:10:08,033 --> 00:10:09,933
BUT I'M WORRIED.

251
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,467
I WANT TO BE ABSOLUTELY SURE
THAT THERE'S NOTHING WRONG.

252
00:10:12,533 --> 00:10:14,433
OH, MY BARBER'S HERE.
I GOTTA GO.

253
00:10:14,500 --> 00:10:17,300
GEORGE, DR. HARDY
JUST CAME INTO THE ROOM.

254
00:10:17,367 --> 00:10:19,833
HE LOOKS AS THOUGH HE MIGHT
HAVE SOME NEWS FOR ME.

255
00:10:19,900 --> 00:10:22,967
OH, IT'S JUST ABOUT THAT
CYST WITH TEETH AND HAIR.

256
00:10:23,033 --> 00:10:26,000
YES, I'LL CALL YOU BACK,
DEAR. GOODBYE.

257
00:10:27,867 --> 00:10:29,367
ALL RIGHT, THAT WAS,
UH, VINCE EDWARDS.

258
00:10:29,433 --> 00:10:31,867
HE GAVE ME
A SECOND OPINION.

259
00:10:31,933 --> 00:10:33,867
THERE IS SOMETHING
WRONG WITH ME?

260
00:10:33,933 --> 00:10:36,233
YES, YOU'VE BEEN HOSPITALIZED.

261
00:10:39,733 --> 00:10:42,733
YOU HAVE WHAT'S KNOWN
AS A HIATUS HERNIA.

262
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:44,400
- [GASPS]
- WHICH MEANS I WIN THE POOL,

263
00:10:44,467 --> 00:10:46,367
- BUT THAT'S BESIDE THE POINT.
- WHAT IS THAT?

264
00:10:46,433 --> 00:10:48,233
WELL, IT'S NOTHING
TO BE TOO ALARMED ABOUT,

265
00:10:48,300 --> 00:10:51,033
BUT IT IS TO BE TAKEN SERIOUSLY
AND IT'S QUITE RARE.

266
00:10:51,100 --> 00:10:53,367
NOTHING AN EXPENSIVE
OPERATION CAN'T COMPLICATE.

267
00:10:53,433 --> 00:10:55,033
HOW WERE YOU ABLE
TO DIAGNOSE THAT?

268
00:10:55,100 --> 00:10:57,667
THOSE, UH, LAST X-RAYS,
WE TOOK THE TILT X-RAYS.

269
00:10:57,733 --> 00:10:59,467
- THEY REVEALED IT.
- AND YOU MIGHT HAVE NOTICED

270
00:10:59,533 --> 00:11:01,000
YOU'VE BEEN VOMITING
A LOT LATELY.

271
00:11:01,067 --> 00:11:02,633
WHAT IS IT?
I'VE NEVER HEARD OF IT.

272
00:11:02,700 --> 00:11:04,133
A HIATUS HERNIA?

273
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:06,600
YOU CALLING ME A LIAR?
GET OUT, GET OUT!

274
00:11:08,867 --> 00:11:10,867
- WELL...
- THE BODY SEES A HERNIA

275
00:11:10,933 --> 00:11:12,833
AS A SERIES
OF ONES AND ZEROS.

276
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:15,233
...WHERE THE ESOPHAGUS
GOES INTO THE STOMACH.

277
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:17,833
THE CONSTRICTION
IS MOST LIKELY TO HAPPEN

278
00:11:17,900 --> 00:11:19,367
WHEN THE STOMACH IS FULL,

279
00:11:19,433 --> 00:11:21,667
AFTER YOU'VE HAD SOMETHING
TO EAT OR DRINK.

280
00:11:21,733 --> 00:11:23,333
UH, IS THIS GONNA BE
ON THE FINAL?

281
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:24,867
...WHEN THE STOMACH
ENLARGES

282
00:11:24,933 --> 00:11:27,467
IT GETS PINCHED
AT THIS OPENING.

283
00:11:27,533 --> 00:11:30,033
TO PUT IT EVEN MORE SIMPLY,
YOU EAT LIKE A PIG.

284
00:11:30,100 --> 00:11:33,100
- AFTER ALL MY DOUBTS...
- I'M ERIC STOLTZ IN "MASK."

285
00:11:33,167 --> 00:11:37,333
...AND ALL OF GEORGE'S
INSISTING THAT THERE WAS
NOTHING WRONG WITH ME...

286
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,667
THAT BASTARD.

287
00:11:38,733 --> 00:11:40,500
...THERE IS SOMETHING
WRONG WITH ME.

288
00:11:40,567 --> 00:11:43,467
- YES.
- YES, YOU'RE A SPOOKY
NEW YORK ACTRESS.

289
00:11:43,533 --> 00:11:46,667
I WAS PRETTY SURE YOUR PAIN
WASN'T IMAGINARY.

290
00:11:46,733 --> 00:11:48,467
IN FACT,
THE PAIN ASSOCIATED

291
00:11:48,533 --> 00:11:51,067
WITH A HIATUS HERNIA
IS VERY INTENSE.

292
00:11:51,133 --> 00:11:54,067
AND IT'S ALMOST IDENTICAL
TO A CORONARY OCCLUSION

293
00:11:54,133 --> 00:11:55,733
- OR A HEART ATTACK.
- HERE, LET ME PUNCH YOU
IN THE STERNUM

294
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:57,567
- TO SIMULATE THE PAIN.
- WHY DOES THE PAIN GO AWAY

295
00:11:57,633 --> 00:11:59,233
AFTER A FEW MINUTES?

296
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:00,467
WELL, IT USUALLY DISAPPEARS

297
00:12:00,533 --> 00:12:02,400
WHEN YOU GET UP AND
WALK AROUND, DOESN'T IT?

298
00:12:02,467 --> 00:12:03,633
- HINT, HINT.
- YES.

299
00:12:03,700 --> 00:12:06,133
WELL, THEN, YOU SEE?
THE STOMACH HAS MORE ROOM.

300
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:08,700
WELL, I COULD SEE HOW
THAT WOULD-- HUH?

301
00:12:08,767 --> 00:12:11,600
CAN SOMETHING
BE DONE FOR THIS?

302
00:12:11,667 --> 00:12:12,767
- NOPE.
- OF COURSE.

303
00:12:12,833 --> 00:12:14,300
- [STIFLED COUGHS]
- MY FIRST SUGGESTION

304
00:12:14,367 --> 00:12:17,067
IS THAT YOU TRY A COUPLE
OF WEEKS OF HOSPITAL CARE

305
00:12:17,133 --> 00:12:19,033
WITH SPECIAL ATTENTION
TO DIET.

306
00:12:19,100 --> 00:12:21,033
AND THEN I'LL DO MY
GREGORY PECK IMPRESSION.

307
00:12:21,100 --> 00:12:22,933
...CAN CURE THE CONDITION
THAT WAY OR--

308
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:24,400
OR COME CLOSE TO IT,

309
00:12:24,467 --> 00:12:26,667
WE MAY HAVE TO CONSIDER
SURGERY.

310
00:12:26,733 --> 00:12:29,133
- [GASPS] SURGERY?
- NOW LET ME ASSURE YOU,
MARTHA,

311
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:30,867
THERE'S NO GREAT CAUSE
FOR ALARM.

312
00:12:30,933 --> 00:12:33,533
OH, IT'S DANGEROUS AND
PAINFUL, BUT DON'T WORRY.

313
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:35,533
AND I'M VERY HOPEFUL THAT
WE CAN GET RID OF IT

314
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,567
WITHOUT SURGERY.

315
00:12:36,633 --> 00:12:38,333
I HAVE PERFORMED SURGERY
ONCE BEFORE.

316
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:40,533
ALTHOUGH THE PERSON DIDN'T
SURVIVE, I FEEL CONFIDENT.

317
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:42,467
WHO'S GOING TO TELL
MY HUSBAND ALL ABOUT THIS?

318
00:12:42,533 --> 00:12:44,067
HMM, HOW ABOUT HIS WIFE?

319
00:12:44,133 --> 00:12:45,867
I WILL, IF YOU LIKE.

320
00:12:45,933 --> 00:12:47,700
BUT I THINK IT MIGHT BE
A BETTER IDEA

321
00:12:47,767 --> 00:12:49,233
IF YOU TOLD
DR. LYONS YOURSELF.

322
00:12:49,300 --> 00:12:51,267
- MAYBE YOU COULD USE A PUPPET.
- OF COURSE I'LL BE HAPPY

323
00:12:51,333 --> 00:12:53,233
TO ANSWER
ANY QUESTIONS HE MIGHT ASK

324
00:12:53,300 --> 00:12:55,933
OR-- OR HAVE A CONSULTATION
WITH HIM ABOUT IT.

325
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:58,067
GEORGE IS GOING
TO BE VERY UPSET.

326
00:12:58,133 --> 00:12:59,800
HE HATES HIATUS HERNIAS.

327
00:12:59,867 --> 00:13:02,267
BECAUSE YOU REALLY HAVE
SOMETHING WRONG?

328
00:13:02,333 --> 00:13:04,733
WELL, NOT ONLY THAT,

329
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:08,133
IT'S-- IT'S YOU.

330
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:10,467
YOU PROVED
THAT HE WAS WRONG

331
00:13:10,533 --> 00:13:12,233
WHEN HE SAID THAT
IT WAS INDIGESTION

332
00:13:12,300 --> 00:13:14,267
- OR JUST MY IMAGINATION.
- RUNNING AWAY WITH ME.

333
00:13:14,333 --> 00:13:17,933
MARTHA, A HIATUS HERNIA IS
A DIFFICULT THING TO DIAGNOSE.

334
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,667
IN FACT, IT'S VERY DIFFICULT.

335
00:13:19,733 --> 00:13:21,567
WHY, LOOK AT THE TROUBLE
I HAD.

336
00:13:21,633 --> 00:13:25,500
- AND I'M BRILLIANT!
- WELL, YES, BUT YOU
DID DIAGNOSE IT.

337
00:13:25,567 --> 00:13:27,933
HMM.

338
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:30,200
OKAY, SO YOUR
HUSBAND'S A PUTZ.

339
00:13:33,333 --> 00:13:34,700
ANYWAY,
FOR A COUPLE OF WEEKS,

340
00:13:34,767 --> 00:13:36,767
WE'LL GIVE YOU PLENTY OF REST
AND A SPECIAL DIET.

341
00:13:36,833 --> 00:13:39,967
SO DON'T WORRY, WE'LL
TAKE GOOD CARE OF YOU.

342
00:13:40,033 --> 00:13:41,633
NOW, ABOUT THAT HAIR.

343
00:13:41,700 --> 00:13:43,333
WILL YOU COME IN
TO SEE ME?

344
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:44,867
[KISSING]

345
00:13:44,933 --> 00:13:46,733
YOU'RE MY PATIENT,
REMEMBER?

346
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:49,733
AND DON'T FORGET WE'VE
SCHEDULED THAT LOBOTOMY
FIRST THING MONDAY MORNING.

347
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:53,067
[ORGAN PLAYING]

348
00:13:53,133 --> 00:13:55,900
AND NOW TAKING THE ICE,
YOUR MINNESOTA NORTH STARS!

349
00:13:55,967 --> 00:13:57,400
[CHEERING]

350
00:13:57,467 --> 00:13:59,633
[MIMICS ORGAN]

351
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:12,467
♪♪

352
00:14:12,533 --> 00:14:14,100
WOW, LOOK AT ALL
THE JUJYFRUITS.

353
00:14:14,167 --> 00:14:15,367
MMM.

354
00:14:15,433 --> 00:14:17,267
WELL, I SAW
HOWARD HUNT IN SPACE.

355
00:14:17,333 --> 00:14:18,500
I SAW LINDA HUNT IN SPACE.

356
00:14:18,567 --> 00:14:21,200
I SAW HUNTZ HALL
IN SPACE.

357
00:14:21,267 --> 00:14:24,933
AN ADVENTURE OF TOMORROW
FOR TODAY'S TROUBLED TEENS.

358
00:14:26,867 --> 00:14:28,500
TRACY AND HEPBURN,
BOGART/BACALL,

359
00:14:28,567 --> 00:14:30,267
MANSFIELD AND LYDEN.

360
00:14:30,333 --> 00:14:33,267
- MAMA MAURICE CASS.
- HMM.

361
00:14:36,300 --> 00:14:39,233
WELL, THIS REALLY IS
A L'ESTRANGE MOVIE,

362
00:14:39,300 --> 00:14:40,700
OR A STRENGE MOVIE.

363
00:14:40,767 --> 00:14:42,600
- COUGH UP A ROY LUBY.
- OOH.

364
00:14:44,033 --> 00:14:47,600
♪˯ OZ NEVER DID GIVE
NOTHING TO BILL TINSMAN ♪

365
00:14:47,667 --> 00:14:51,067
♪ THAT HE DIDN'T,
DIDN'T ALREADY... ♪

366
00:14:51,133 --> 00:14:53,867
I WANTED TO "HOERL" AFTER
I READ THE SCREENPLAY.

367
00:14:53,933 --> 00:14:55,633
HURL!

368
00:14:55,700 --> 00:14:57,633
- HI, GUY.
- HMM.

369
00:14:59,833 --> 00:15:02,767
ARTHUR PIERSON, THE INVENTOR
OF THE SALTED NUT ROLL.

370
00:15:04,933 --> 00:15:08,133
OH, IS THE GREAT HOLLINGSWORTH
MORSE GOING TO DIRECT?

371
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:09,633
[CHORTLING]

372
00:15:11,633 --> 00:15:13,567
THIS IS THE PART
WHERE THE, UM,

373
00:15:13,633 --> 00:15:16,767
ZAG NUT IS FERTILIZED
BY THE SALTED NUT ROLL.

374
00:15:18,833 --> 00:15:20,600
LOOK, IT'S THE MST3K LOGO.

375
00:15:20,667 --> 00:15:22,000
YOU'RE NOT SUPPOSED
TO KNOW ABOUT THAT.

376
00:15:22,067 --> 00:15:24,433
OH-- AHEM.
[WHISTLING]

377
00:15:25,733 --> 00:15:26,833
VENA.

378
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:29,333
♪ OHH, VENA ♪

379
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:33,033
- REGGIE.
- BAD DOG, BAD DOG.

380
00:15:33,100 --> 00:15:35,000
YOU KNOW I'M EXPECTING
TO HEAR FROM ROCKY.

381
00:15:35,067 --> 00:15:37,100
I WANTED TO BRING IN
CASSA 7,

382
00:15:37,167 --> 00:15:38,467
AND THERE IT IS.

383
00:15:38,533 --> 00:15:40,400
IT'S A CRUNCHBERRY.

384
00:15:42,567 --> 00:15:45,833
- TIME'S UP.
- I CONTACTED CASSA
CENTRAL CONTROL STATION

385
00:15:45,900 --> 00:15:47,667
AND THEY'RE HOLDING
COMMUNICATIONS OPEN.

386
00:15:47,733 --> 00:15:49,533
CAN I SPEAK
TO MY BROTHER PAUL?

387
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:50,533
WELL, I ASKED FOR HIM.

388
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:51,800
THEY SAID HE'S
AT THE LAND FIELD

389
00:15:51,867 --> 00:15:53,967
INSPECTING CONSTRUCTION
ON THE NEW LANDING PLATFORM.

390
00:15:54,033 --> 00:15:56,233
- I'LL SOON SEE HIM.
- IN HELL.

391
00:15:56,300 --> 00:15:57,500
IT WILL BE WONDERFUL.

392
00:15:57,567 --> 00:15:59,533
HOW LONG SINCE YOU'VE
SEEN YOUR BROTHER, VENA?

393
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:01,400
- AN HOUR.
- ALMOST THREE YEARS.

394
00:16:01,467 --> 00:16:04,433
HE'LL BE ON THE CASSA 7
PROJECT ANOTHER FIVE YEARS.

395
00:16:04,500 --> 00:16:07,200
[STATIC]

396
00:16:07,267 --> 00:16:08,533
WHAT HAPPENED, REGGIE?

397
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:11,333
AH, THE PLAYBOY CHANNEL'S
SCRAMBLED AGAIN.

398
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:13,433
- ALL THE INSTRUMENTS ARE DEAD.
- SO AM I.

399
00:16:13,500 --> 00:16:15,167
THE FLIGHT SEEMS NORMAL.

400
00:16:15,233 --> 00:16:16,733
- THIS IS WEIRD.
- SO AM I.

401
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:19,767
I'LL CHECK THE ROCKETS.

402
00:16:19,833 --> 00:16:21,400
THE ROCKET THRUST
IS ZERO.

403
00:16:21,467 --> 00:16:23,600
GEE, THAT MAKES ME BITTER.

404
00:16:23,667 --> 00:16:25,633
OH, AND THE ANIMATION
SUCKS, TOO.

405
00:16:25,700 --> 00:16:27,433
OH, BROTHER.

406
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:32,033
- MC7, ARE THEY ANY
RELATION TO THE MC5?
- MAYBE.

407
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:34,900
THIS THING HAS NEUTRALIZED
EVERY BIT OF OUR EQUIPMENT...

408
00:16:34,967 --> 00:16:37,733
- EVEN MY ACTING.
- ...AND THERE'S NOT A THING
WE CAN DO ABOUT IT.

409
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:39,633
NO WAY TO CHECK
SPEED OR POSITION

410
00:16:39,700 --> 00:16:41,667
AND NOT A CHANCE TO MAKE
CONTACT WITH ANYONE.

411
00:16:41,733 --> 00:16:44,600
- IT'S NOT FAIR.
- THEY MAY HAVE US
UNDER ROBOT CONTROL.

412
00:16:44,667 --> 00:16:47,300
- I DON'T KNOW, VENA.
- I JUST DON'T KNOW.

413
00:16:47,367 --> 00:16:49,400
I DON'T KNOW OF ANY WAY
OF FINDING OUT.

414
00:16:49,467 --> 00:16:52,533
MIGHT AS WELL JUST
FADE THIS SCENE OUT.

415
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:55,000
♪♪

416
00:16:55,067 --> 00:16:56,867
AND THIS IS WHAT
THE HERITAGE FOUNDATION

417
00:16:56,933 --> 00:16:59,200
WILL LOOK LIKE
IF YOU CONTRIBUTE.

418
00:17:00,867 --> 00:17:03,867
- [BUZZING]
- EXTERMINATE, EXTERMINATE.

419
00:17:03,933 --> 00:17:06,267
EXTERMINATE!

420
00:17:06,333 --> 00:17:08,267
SURE HOPE MY SUPPORT BELT
HOLDS UP.

421
00:17:08,333 --> 00:17:11,867
I JUST KEPT THAT SPACESHIP
VISIOGRAPH BUSY FOR AN HOUR.

422
00:17:11,933 --> 00:17:13,600
SHE KNEW
I WAS GOING TO CALL.

423
00:17:13,667 --> 00:17:15,767
WELL, SHE'S HAVING
A VACATION, ROCKY.

424
00:17:15,833 --> 00:17:18,000
NOW FOR ME, LET ME RELAX

425
00:17:18,067 --> 00:17:20,067
WITH A LITTLE BLACK BOOK
AND THE GAY NIGHTLIFE.

426
00:17:20,133 --> 00:17:23,367
- [GASPS]
- UH, INSERT JOKE HERE.

427
00:17:23,433 --> 00:17:25,633
WELL, HERE, RELAX, ROCKY.

428
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:27,233
I'LL GIVE YOU A COUPLE
OF CHOICE PAGES.

429
00:17:27,300 --> 00:17:29,267
- [BUZZING]
- HERE'S CHRISTOPHER, TREVOR,

430
00:17:29,333 --> 00:17:31,667
- TODD, KYLE--
- HUH? OH.

431
00:17:31,733 --> 00:17:33,267
[BUZZ BUZZ]

432
00:17:33,333 --> 00:17:36,033
♪ YOU'RE IN THE ARMY NOW ♪

433
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:38,000
WELL, MR. SECRETARY.

434
00:17:38,067 --> 00:17:39,700
I'M GLAD
I FOUND YOU IN, ROCKY.

435
00:17:39,767 --> 00:17:42,267
- BUT I'M NOT IN "ROCKY."
- THERE'S SOMETHING
I'D LIKE TO DISCUSS,

436
00:17:42,333 --> 00:17:44,000
IF IT DOESN'T
UPSET YOUR PLANS.

437
00:17:44,067 --> 00:17:45,633
IT WON'T, SIR.

438
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:47,633
AFTER ALL, THIS IS YOUR
OFF-DUTY PERIOD.

439
00:17:47,700 --> 00:17:51,067
UH, MY BLACK BOOK,
NOW I WON'T BE ABLE TO...

440
00:17:51,133 --> 00:17:53,200
OHH. OH.

441
00:17:55,067 --> 00:17:58,000
YOU KNOW, BY 1980 EVERYONE
WANTED PHONES LIKE THIS.

442
00:17:58,067 --> 00:17:59,133
...KISS THE BEAUTIFUL
GIRLS GOODBYE.

443
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:01,000
MMM, AND THE GAY NIGHTLIFE.

444
00:18:01,067 --> 00:18:03,833
- AND THE GAY NIGHTLIFE.
- SO HE'S TALKING ABOUT--

445
00:18:03,900 --> 00:18:05,667
WELL, OH, NEVER MIND.

446
00:18:14,133 --> 00:18:18,100
- ROCKY...
- "THE JACK BENNY PROGRAM."

447
00:18:18,167 --> 00:18:19,800
WELL, THAT'S
ALL RIGHT, SIR.

448
00:18:19,867 --> 00:18:23,200
I CAN TAKE CARE OF CANCELING
OUR VACATION PLANS, I GUESS.

449
00:18:23,267 --> 00:18:25,400
- PANTSING YOUR VACATION?
- PERHAPS I SHOULD ASSIGN

450
00:18:25,467 --> 00:18:26,933
SOMEONE ELSE
TO THE MISSION?

451
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:29,267
HOW ABOUT MAITRE 'D?

452
00:18:29,333 --> 00:18:31,233
THAT'S RIGHT, WE'D RATHER
RIDE THE ROCKET, SIR.

453
00:18:31,300 --> 00:18:33,167
- [GASPS] WHAT DOES HE--
- SHHH!

454
00:18:33,233 --> 00:18:34,833
THANK YOU.

455
00:18:34,900 --> 00:18:37,467
I DON'T KNOW WHERE THIS PROBLEM
IS GOING TO LEAD.

456
00:18:37,533 --> 00:18:39,633
♪ I DON'T KNOW
HOW TO LOVE HIM ♪

457
00:18:39,700 --> 00:18:41,867
[MIMICS FLATULENCE]

458
00:18:41,933 --> 00:18:43,267
WELL, SIR, YOU KNOW US.

459
00:18:43,333 --> 00:18:45,867
WE'RE NOT HAPPY
UNLESS WE'RE IN TROUBLE.

460
00:18:45,933 --> 00:18:47,167
UH, I MEAN--

461
00:18:47,233 --> 00:18:49,667
[CHUCKLES]
GET OUT, GET OUT!

462
00:18:49,733 --> 00:18:52,400
FIRST, I'LL FILL YOU IN
ON SOME OF THE DETAILS.

463
00:18:52,467 --> 00:18:53,867
I'VE PREPARED A SONG.

464
00:18:53,933 --> 00:18:55,733
THE UNITED WORLDS,
AS YOU KNOW,

465
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:58,400
ARE FORTIFYING
THE PLANETOID CASSA 7

466
00:18:58,467 --> 00:19:02,233
AS A JOINT-CONTROL STATION
FOR OUR ENTIRE SOLAR SYSTEM.

467
00:19:02,300 --> 00:19:03,467
[AS JOHNNY CARSON]
I DID NOT KNOW THAT.

468
00:19:03,533 --> 00:19:04,533
OH, YES,
PROFESSOR NEWTON TOLD US

469
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:05,933
SOMETHING ABOUT
THE PROJECT.

470
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:08,300
IN PREPARING CASSA 7,
EACH OF THE UNITED WORLDS

471
00:19:08,367 --> 00:19:11,233
IS FURNISHING STRATEGIC
AND, IN MOST CASES,

472
00:19:11,300 --> 00:19:12,733
RESTRICTED MATERIALS.

473
00:19:12,800 --> 00:19:14,100
AND THEY'RE RELEASING
IT TO TEENS.

474
00:19:14,167 --> 00:19:16,067
BUT LATELY THERE HAVE
BEEN DISTURBING REPORTS

475
00:19:16,133 --> 00:19:20,133
OF CARGO SPACESHIPS VANISHING
ON THE WAY TO CASSA 7.

476
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,267
- HMM.
- [BUZZING]

477
00:19:21,333 --> 00:19:23,267
♪ AT BENEFICIAL ♪

478
00:19:23,333 --> 00:19:26,133
WE'RE IN CONTACT BY VISIOGRAPH
WITH MARS, SIR.

479
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:28,100
THEY REQUEST
SECRETARY DRAKE.

480
00:19:28,167 --> 00:19:29,900
I'LL TAKE IT ON MY RECEIVER.

481
00:19:29,967 --> 00:19:31,700
EXCUSE ME, BOYS,
I HAVE TO TAKE THIS.

482
00:19:31,767 --> 00:19:33,633
- YOU UNDERSTAND.
- [HUMMING]

483
00:19:33,700 --> 00:19:35,767
THERE'S MY LICHTENSTEIN.

484
00:19:37,433 --> 00:19:40,133
MORK CALLING ORSON,
MORK CALLING ORSON.

485
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:42,400
- ...SPEAKING FROM EARTH.
- SPEAKING FROM MARS,

486
00:19:42,467 --> 00:19:43,867
RUNIS HERE.

487
00:19:43,933 --> 00:19:45,867
THIS IS THE FINAL REPORT

488
00:19:45,933 --> 00:19:49,067
ON OUR SUPPLY SPACESHIP
DOUBLE-M EN ROUTE TO CASSA 7.

489
00:19:49,133 --> 00:19:51,467
IT IS NOW TWO MOON CYCLES
OVERDUE.

490
00:19:51,533 --> 00:19:55,133
- I AM SO ASHAMED.
- WE MUST PRESUME IT TO BE LOST.

491
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:57,333
SPACE RANGERS ARE BEING
ASSIGNED IMMEDIATELY

492
00:19:57,400 --> 00:20:00,633
TO INVESTIGATE
THE ENTIRE SITUATION
OF MISSING CARGO SHIPS.

493
00:20:00,700 --> 00:20:03,400
I KNOW YOU'LL KEEP US
INFORMED, MR. SECRETARY.

494
00:20:03,467 --> 00:20:05,667
YOU'LL HAVE A REPORT
WITHIN A SOLAR MONTH.

495
00:20:05,733 --> 00:20:07,567
GREETINGS FROM EARTH,
RUNIS.

496
00:20:07,633 --> 00:20:11,067
- GREETINGS FROM MARS.
- CIAO, BABY, RIGHT BACK AT YA.

497
00:20:12,467 --> 00:20:14,733
WHAT A JERK, SORRY
YOU HAD TO SEE THAT.

498
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:18,000
YOU HEARD.

499
00:20:18,067 --> 00:20:20,800
THAT'S THE THIRD SPACESHIP
VANISHED WITHIN A WEEK.

500
00:20:20,867 --> 00:20:21,867
YOU KNOW, OF COURSE, SIR,

501
00:20:21,933 --> 00:20:23,433
THAT VENA'S ON HER WAY
TO CASSA 7

502
00:20:23,500 --> 00:20:25,433
- ON A CARGO SHIP.
- THAT'S RIGHT, SIR.

503
00:20:25,500 --> 00:20:26,867
ROCKY'S BEEN TRYING
TO CALL VENA.

504
00:20:26,933 --> 00:20:28,733
I'VE BEEN UNABLE
TO MAKE CONTACT,

505
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:30,533
AND FRANKLY, SIR,
I'M A BIT WORRIED.

506
00:20:30,600 --> 00:20:32,067
WE'LL PUT YOUR MIND
AT EASE.

507
00:20:32,133 --> 00:20:35,533
I'VE GOT SOMETHING THAT'LL
PUT YOU THROUGH THE FLOOR, BOYS.

508
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:37,367
- BIGGINS...
- SEND IN THE CLOWNS.

509
00:20:37,433 --> 00:20:40,133
- DON'T BOTHER, THEY'RE HERE.
- GET A REPORT FROM CASSA 7.

510
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:43,800
I WANT TO KNOW IF CARGO
SPACESHIP CM-7 HAS LANDED.

511
00:20:43,867 --> 00:20:46,400
AND BRING ME SOME
SLEEPY TIME TEA.

512
00:20:46,467 --> 00:20:49,533
WE WANT TO FIND OUT WHAT'S
HAPPENING TO THE CARGO SHIPS.

513
00:20:49,600 --> 00:20:51,233
OH, I'M SURE
IT CAN BE DONE, SIR,

514
00:20:51,300 --> 00:20:53,467
- BY USING OUR SPACE STATIONS.
- SCOTT TRACY.

515
00:20:53,533 --> 00:20:54,633
YOU'RE THE TROUBLESHOOTER,
ROCKY.

516
00:20:54,700 --> 00:20:57,133
RUN DOWN EVERY POSSIBILITY.

517
00:20:57,200 --> 00:20:58,767
WE'VE GOT TO FIND
THE ANSWER,

518
00:20:58,833 --> 00:21:01,400
BUT THERE WILL BE REPERCUSSIONS
THROUGHOUT OUR ENTIRE SYSTEM.

519
00:21:01,467 --> 00:21:03,733
JIM, GET DANNO, ROUND UP
EVERY KNOWN HOOD ON THE ISLAND.

520
00:21:03,800 --> 00:21:05,367
THE REPORT
FROM CASSA 7, SIR.

521
00:21:05,433 --> 00:21:09,333
- LET'S HAVE IT.
- IT SAYS, "HEEEELLLP!"

522
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:11,833
...AS IT WAS ABOUT TO ENTER
THE GRAVITY FIELD
FOR THE APPROACH.

523
00:21:11,900 --> 00:21:13,167
SINCE THEN
THERE'S BEEN NO WORD...

524
00:21:13,233 --> 00:21:15,533
MAN, DOES THIS EVER BITE.
I NEED A CAREER CHANGE.

525
00:21:15,600 --> 00:21:17,000
[GROANS]

526
00:21:17,067 --> 00:21:19,667
CM-7 HAS DISAPPEARED
INTO SPACE.

527
00:21:19,733 --> 00:21:21,800
IT WAS VERY GOOD,
VERY GOOD INDEED.

528
00:21:21,867 --> 00:21:23,000
THANK YOU,
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

529
00:21:23,067 --> 00:21:24,667
WITH YOUR PERMISSION, SIR,
I'D LIKE TO START

530
00:21:24,733 --> 00:21:26,767
- BY TRACING SPACESHIP CM-7.
- OF COURSE.

531
00:21:26,833 --> 00:21:28,133
THIS MISSION
IS IN YOUR HANDS.

532
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:29,767
GOOD, WE CAN BLAST OFF
WITHIN THE HOUR.

533
00:21:29,833 --> 00:21:31,767
WINKY.

534
00:21:31,833 --> 00:21:34,100
WONDER IF WINKY
HAS A NICKNAME.

535
00:21:34,167 --> 00:21:36,867
- HA!
- [CHUCKLING]

536
00:21:36,933 --> 00:21:39,033
GET THE ORBIT JET
READY FOR BLASTOFF, WINKY.

537
00:21:39,100 --> 00:21:41,133
I'M GOING TO SEE PROFESSOR
NEWTON FOR A MOMENT.

538
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:43,133
THE ROCKETS
WILL BE READY TO ROAR.

539
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:46,000
OH, I'D LIKE TO
SLAP HIM SO HARD.

540
00:21:48,133 --> 00:21:49,767
KIDS, CLOSE THAT DOOR.

541
00:21:49,833 --> 00:21:51,367
WE'RE NOT TRYING
TO HEAT THE OUTSIDE.

542
00:21:51,433 --> 00:21:53,267
COME ON!

543
00:21:53,333 --> 00:21:55,567
AND THAT'S HOW CATTLE
ARE INSEMINATED.

544
00:21:55,633 --> 00:21:57,100
NOW WE'LL MOVE ON.

545
00:21:57,167 --> 00:21:58,867
NOW WE'LL HAVE TO GIVE THIS

546
00:21:58,933 --> 00:22:01,833
AT LEAST A FOUR HOUR
EXPOSURE, BOBBY.

547
00:22:01,900 --> 00:22:04,200
WELL, THAT'S
THE LONGEST ONE YET.

548
00:22:04,267 --> 00:22:07,533
HOW COME YOU DON'T HAVE TO
WEAR STRETCH PANTS, GRANDPA?

549
00:22:07,600 --> 00:22:11,100
OH, ROCKY, WE'RE MAKING SOME
WONDERFUL PICTURES OF SCORPIS

550
00:22:11,167 --> 00:22:12,967
- WITH HYDROGEN LIGHT.
- YEAH, THAT'S GREAT.

551
00:22:13,033 --> 00:22:16,033
WHAT WE NEED ARE SOME TRICK
SNAPSHOTS OF CASSA 7.

552
00:22:16,100 --> 00:22:18,867
YOUR TONE TELLS ME
THERE'S TROUBLE.

553
00:22:18,933 --> 00:22:22,367
PERHAPS, BUT I DON'T KNOW
WHAT IT IS, PROFESSOR.

554
00:22:22,433 --> 00:22:24,933
EXCEPT THAT
IT CONCERNS CASSA 7.

555
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:28,100
- VLADIMIR HOROWITZ.
- SECRETARY DRAKE WILL
TELL YOU THE WHOLE STORY.

556
00:22:28,167 --> 00:22:30,133
BUT THIS MUCH
I WANTED YOU TO KNOW.

557
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:33,933
- [MUMBLING, INDISTINCT]
- THE SHIP VENA'S ON HAS
VANISHED INTO SPACE.

558
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:35,467
I WANT TO HELP, ROCKY.

559
00:22:35,533 --> 00:22:37,333
PLEASE LET ME HELP.

560
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:40,000
THIS IS ONE TIME I'D LIKE
TO SAY NO, BOBBY,

561
00:22:40,067 --> 00:22:43,133
- BUT I CAN'T.
- YOU OUTRANK ME.

562
00:22:43,200 --> 00:22:44,367
THANKS A MILLION.

563
00:22:44,433 --> 00:22:46,933
YOU WON'T BE SORRY,
WE'LL FIND VENA.

564
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:49,667
- I'M ALREADY SORRY, BOBBY.
- NOW RUN ALONG AND GET PACKED.

565
00:22:49,733 --> 00:22:51,733
MEET US AT
THE BLASTOFF PLATFORM.

566
00:22:51,800 --> 00:22:53,600
NOT A WORD OF OUR
MEETINGS, BOBBY.

567
00:22:55,867 --> 00:22:58,867
- PROFESSOR NEWTON...
- HOW ARE THE FIG COOKIES
COMING ALONG?

568
00:22:58,933 --> 00:23:00,733
...I DON'T KNOW WHERE THIS
FLIGHT IS GOING TO TAKE US.

569
00:23:00,800 --> 00:23:03,000
MAYBE TO THE FAR LIMITS
OF OUR SOLAR SYSTEM.

570
00:23:03,067 --> 00:23:04,833
MAYBE TO THE DARKEST
REACHES OF OUR SOULS.

571
00:23:04,900 --> 00:23:07,000
- SOMETHING YOU WISH
TO ASK ME, ROCKY?
- YES, PROFESSOR.

572
00:23:07,067 --> 00:23:09,133
DID YOU EVER DANCE
WITH THE DEVIL IN
THE PALE MOONLIGHT?

573
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:12,267
ANY NEW DISCOVERIES STILL HELD
SECRET THAT MIGHT HELP US?

574
00:23:13,733 --> 00:23:15,600
YES, THERE IS,

575
00:23:15,667 --> 00:23:18,800
BUT I'VE BEEN FEARFUL
OF EVEN DISCUSSING IT.

576
00:23:18,867 --> 00:23:20,867
- EXCEPT WITH BOBBY.
- WRONGLY USED,

577
00:23:20,933 --> 00:23:23,433
IT COULD HAVE
CATACLYSMIC RESULTS.

578
00:23:23,500 --> 00:23:26,100
VENA'S LIFE MAY BE
AT STAKE.

579
00:23:26,167 --> 00:23:27,100
TIME TO GO.

580
00:23:27,167 --> 00:23:28,633
- WHAT?
- LET'S GO, LET'S GO.

581
00:23:28,700 --> 00:23:30,167
- OKAY.
- I'LL SHOW YOU.

582
00:23:30,233 --> 00:23:33,600
I'LL SHOW YOU THE POWER
OF COLD LIGHT.

583
00:23:33,667 --> 00:23:35,067
COLD LIGHT?

584
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:50,067
PEGGY, I'M AFRAID I HAVE
SOME BAD NEWS FOR YOU.

585
00:23:50,133 --> 00:23:51,200
[ORGAN STING]

586
00:23:51,267 --> 00:23:53,033
OH, MY GOD, WHAT IS IT?

587
00:23:53,100 --> 00:23:55,233
IS IT A HIATUS HERNIA?

588
00:23:55,300 --> 00:23:57,233
- [ORGAN STING]
- NO, IT'S NOT THAT.

589
00:23:57,300 --> 00:23:59,700
IS IT THE HEARTBREAK
OF PSORIASIS?

590
00:23:59,767 --> 00:24:01,867
- [ORGAN STING]
- NO, IT'S NOT THAT.

591
00:24:01,933 --> 00:24:04,200
IS IT MOGO
ON THE GO-GO GO?

592
00:24:04,267 --> 00:24:06,700
- [ORGAN STING]
- NO, I'M AFRAID IT'S
MUCH WORSE THAN THAT.

593
00:24:06,767 --> 00:24:08,933
OH, PLEASE, DOC, TELL ME
WHAT IT IS.

594
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:11,867
WELL, IT SEEMS THAT
WHEN YOU WERE WALKING
DOWN THE HALL EARLIER,

595
00:24:11,933 --> 00:24:13,633
THE BACK OF YOUR
HOSPITAL GOWN WAS OPEN

596
00:24:13,700 --> 00:24:15,867
AND EVERYONE COULD SEE
YOUR BUTT.

597
00:24:15,933 --> 00:24:18,567
I'LL NEVER LIVE DOWN
THE SHAME! [SOBBING]

598
00:24:18,633 --> 00:24:20,500
YOU KNOW, MY DEAR--
[SPITS]

599
00:24:20,567 --> 00:24:23,100
IN TOUGH SITUATIONS LIKE
THIS I'VE FOUND IN THE PAST

600
00:24:23,167 --> 00:24:24,900
THAT THE BEST THING
A PATIENT CAN DO

601
00:24:24,967 --> 00:24:26,533
IS BE COMFORTED BY ME,

602
00:24:26,600 --> 00:24:29,200
- DR. CHAD FEELGOOD.
- OHH.

603
00:24:29,267 --> 00:24:31,200
- YOU CAD!
- [GASPS]

604
00:24:31,267 --> 00:24:33,133
I KNEW YOU WERE
CHEATING ON ME!

605
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:34,500
- I CAN EXPLAIN--
- I HATE YOU, I HATE YOU,

606
00:24:34,567 --> 00:24:35,667
- I HATE YOU, I HATE YOU!
- I CAN EXPLAIN, DARLING.

607
00:24:35,733 --> 00:24:38,167
- IT-- THAT WASN'T--
- HEY, NICE BUTT.

608
00:24:38,233 --> 00:24:41,033
OH, HEY-- [SOBS] I'LL
NEVER LIVE DOWN THIS!

609
00:24:41,100 --> 00:24:42,667
[BOTH SOBBING]

610
00:24:42,733 --> 00:24:43,867
OH, PEGGY,
I CAN COMFORT YOU.

611
00:24:43,933 --> 00:24:46,067
HEY, WAIT-- SAY, WHAT'S
GOING ON HERE?

612
00:24:46,133 --> 00:24:48,700
- [ORGAN STING]
- OH, NO, IT'S
DR. JOEL ROBINSON,

613
00:24:48,767 --> 00:24:50,667
THE HARD-DRINKING,
TWO-FISTED, CANTAKEROUS

614
00:24:50,733 --> 00:24:52,733
YET LOVABLE HOSPITAL
ADMINISTRATOR.

615
00:24:52,800 --> 00:24:54,533
- I AM NOT.
- [ORGAN STING]

616
00:24:54,600 --> 00:24:56,733
OH, NO, AND HE'S SUFFERING
FROM AMNESIA.

617
00:24:56,800 --> 00:24:58,067
OH, THE PAIN OF IT.

618
00:24:58,133 --> 00:25:00,867
YOU GUYS, I'M NOT GONNA
PLAY SOAP OPERA WITH YOU.

619
00:25:00,933 --> 00:25:03,833
WHEN I WAS NINE YEARS OLD
MY SISTER MADE ME PLAY
SOAP OPERA.

620
00:25:03,900 --> 00:25:06,300
I'M NOT GONNA PLAY SOAP OPERA,
I WON'T PLAY SOAP OPERA.

621
00:25:06,367 --> 00:25:07,533
[ORGAN STING]

622
00:25:07,600 --> 00:25:09,633
OKAY, CAMBOT--
THAT'S IT, THAT'S IT.

623
00:25:09,700 --> 00:25:12,433
- ALL RIGHT, THAT'S IT.
- [ORGAN MUSIC STOPS]

624
00:25:12,500 --> 00:25:13,667
WHO'S NEXT?

625
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:23,400
- THEY MUST HAVE SEEN US.
- THANKS A LOT, JOEL.

626
00:25:23,467 --> 00:25:25,800
- YEAH.
- IT DIDN'T HAVE
ANY MARKINGS.

627
00:25:25,867 --> 00:25:27,833
IT MAY HAVE COME
FROM CASSA 7.

628
00:25:27,900 --> 00:25:30,633
WE'LL SOON FIND OUT.

629
00:25:32,567 --> 00:25:35,733
- [VOCALIZES MUSICAL STING]
- [MIMICS BEEPING]

630
00:25:40,333 --> 00:25:41,900
CAN THEY COME
ALONGSIDE US?

631
00:25:41,967 --> 00:25:44,600
YES, I'M SURE THE MAGNETIC
LOCK'S IN OPERATION.

632
00:25:44,667 --> 00:25:47,867
- [RATTLES]
- WOW, THAT WAS BETTER
THAN I THOUGHT.

633
00:25:49,333 --> 00:25:51,567
PROBABLY ALIGNING
THE AIR LOCK HATCH.

634
00:25:51,633 --> 00:25:54,333
IT'S AN OLD LADY,
SHE REAR-ENDED HIM.

635
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:56,500
- WHAT ARE THEY DOING, JOEL?
- THEY'RE TELLING SECRETS.

636
00:25:56,567 --> 00:25:58,300
- AH-- HUH?
- YEAH, YEAH.

637
00:25:58,367 --> 00:26:00,600
THEY'VE REACHED THE HATCH.
WE'RE CONNECTED NOW.

638
00:26:02,300 --> 00:26:04,500
HANG ON A MINUTE, GOTTA PUT
MY HEAD IN THE SALAD SPINNER.

639
00:26:04,567 --> 00:26:05,900
THERE.

640
00:26:07,033 --> 00:26:08,967
OH, HE DIDN'T EVEN
TURN THE HANDLE.

641
00:26:10,433 --> 00:26:13,267
MY, WHAT A CHEAP,
CRUMMY SPECIAL EFFECT.

642
00:26:16,433 --> 00:26:17,667
BLONDIE, I'M HOME.

643
00:26:17,733 --> 00:26:20,467
I BROUGHT
MR. DITHERS ALONG.

644
00:26:20,533 --> 00:26:21,800
[SIGHS]

645
00:26:21,867 --> 00:26:23,367
BOY, I TOLD YOU
TO FIND ADVENTURE,

646
00:26:23,433 --> 00:26:25,300
NOT BRING IT HOME
WITH YOU.

647
00:26:25,367 --> 00:26:29,267
HI, CAN I BE
SUBMISSIVE FOR ANYONE?

648
00:26:29,333 --> 00:26:30,867
ARE YOU FROM CASSA 7?

649
00:26:30,933 --> 00:26:32,533
I CAN
IF YOU WANT ME TO BE.

650
00:26:32,600 --> 00:26:35,133
ON CASSA 7 THEY DON'T EVEN
KNOW YOU'RE ALIVE.

651
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:37,833
THEN YOU'RE THE ONES WHO
NEUTRALIZED OUR EQUIPMENT.

652
00:26:37,900 --> 00:26:39,933
YOU'RE REAL BRIGHT TO
FIGURE THAT OUT FOR YOURSELF.

653
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:42,333
THANKS! THAT'S NICE
OF YOU-- HEY!

654
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:44,733
RELAX, OR YOU
WON'T BE ALIVE.

655
00:26:44,800 --> 00:26:47,000
UM, ANYONE FOR COFFEE?

656
00:26:49,267 --> 00:26:51,767
UH, I'LL JUST
WAIT HERE, THEN.

657
00:26:51,833 --> 00:26:53,767
PSST! BUDDY.

658
00:26:53,833 --> 00:26:55,367
HEY, CHECK THIS OUT,

659
00:26:55,433 --> 00:26:58,200
THERE'S A TON OF
COOL STUFF IN HERE!

660
00:26:58,267 --> 00:27:01,400
OH, COOL, YOU DON'T EVEN
HAVE TO PUSH ANY BUTTONS
TO GET IN.

661
00:27:01,467 --> 00:27:02,567
THIS IS-- OH, MAN,

662
00:27:02,633 --> 00:27:04,167
THIS IS WHERE THEY STORE
THEIR COSTUMES.

663
00:27:04,233 --> 00:27:07,533
IT'S FANTASTIC--
VCRs, NINTENDO, IT'S GREAT.

664
00:27:09,767 --> 00:27:10,700
FUDGE.

665
00:27:14,133 --> 00:27:16,667
OH, I'LL THROW THIS
CARAMELED APPLE AT HIM.

666
00:27:18,767 --> 00:27:21,467
♪ DOO-DOO-DOO, NOTHING
BEHIND MY BACK ♪

667
00:27:21,533 --> 00:27:23,733
- [HUMMING]
- HI.

668
00:27:27,533 --> 00:27:28,467
- [SCREAMS]
- OOH!

669
00:27:28,533 --> 00:27:29,800
♪ A LITTLE SONG,
A LITTLE GRACE ♪

670
00:27:29,867 --> 00:27:31,333
♪ A LITTLE SELTZER
IN YOUR FACE ♪

671
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:32,667
[CHUCKLING]

672
00:27:34,233 --> 00:27:35,467
TAKE THAT!

673
00:27:35,533 --> 00:27:37,933
HA HA! CASSA 7, LOVE IT
OR LEAVE IT, BUDDY.

674
00:27:39,333 --> 00:27:41,833
THEY'RE GONNA PLAY
LIMBO REAL LOW.

675
00:27:41,900 --> 00:27:44,167
OH, I THINK IT'S PLAYED
BY TRIP SHAKESPEARE.

676
00:27:48,300 --> 00:27:50,400
- VENA, YOUR SPACE GUN.
- BUT WHAT ABOUT IT?

677
00:27:50,467 --> 00:27:53,267
OH, OH, I SHOULD GET IT.
OKAY, ALL RIGHT.

678
00:27:53,333 --> 00:27:55,467
IF YOU HAVE TO, USE IT,
ASK QUESTIONS LATER.

679
00:27:55,533 --> 00:27:56,533
MM, MM-HMM.

680
00:27:56,600 --> 00:27:57,933
I'LL GET THROUGH TO CASSA 7

681
00:27:58,000 --> 00:27:59,600
ON THE ASTROPHONE
IN THEIR SHIP.

682
00:27:59,667 --> 00:28:01,800
BUT IF I SHOOT 'EM
I CAN'T ASK QUESTIONS.

683
00:28:01,867 --> 00:28:03,133
OH, YOU SEE, IT'S
A FIGURE OF SPEECH.

684
00:28:03,200 --> 00:28:04,467
AH-- OH.

685
00:28:06,667 --> 00:28:07,800
I KNOW
WHAT YOU'RE THINKING:

686
00:28:07,867 --> 00:28:10,267
DID I SHOOT SIX SHOTS
OF SELTZER OR SEVEN?

687
00:28:10,333 --> 00:28:11,267
[CHUCKLING]

688
00:28:15,433 --> 00:28:17,800
ALL RIGHT, HAND ME
THAT TERRARIUM NOW.

689
00:28:19,667 --> 00:28:22,100
- OOH.
- OUCH.

690
00:28:22,167 --> 00:28:24,900
[AS FRANK NELSON]
WELL, MRS. CARMICHAEL?

691
00:28:29,567 --> 00:28:30,567
GO OVER THERE.

692
00:28:30,633 --> 00:28:31,900
OKAY, NOW,
BARK LIKE A DOG

693
00:28:31,967 --> 00:28:34,767
AND YOU START CHEWING
THE OTHER ONE'S LEG.

694
00:28:38,233 --> 00:28:39,833
NOW, VENA,
YOU'LL DROP IT.

695
00:28:39,900 --> 00:28:42,067
HE'S DOING A GRAND JETÉ,
LOOK.

696
00:28:44,800 --> 00:28:46,200
GET OVER THERE.

697
00:28:48,267 --> 00:28:49,967
- NICE WORK.
- ♪ IF YOU CAN GET IT ♪

698
00:28:50,033 --> 00:28:51,967
- ♪ AND YOU CAN GET IT ♪
- YOU'RE A COUPLE OF
SMART OPERATORS.

699
00:28:52,033 --> 00:28:54,433
ONLY YOU DON'T
HAVE ANY BRAINS.

700
00:28:54,500 --> 00:28:56,700
NOW SEE IF YOU CAN GET
THEIR CARGO INTO OUR SHIP

701
00:28:56,767 --> 00:28:58,367
WITHOUT TRIPPING OVER IT.

702
00:28:58,433 --> 00:29:00,167
BUT YOU JUST SAID
WE WERE SMAR--

703
00:29:00,233 --> 00:29:01,900
OH, I GET IT.

704
00:29:03,900 --> 00:29:07,100
- AWKWARD.
- OOH HOO HOO.

705
00:29:07,167 --> 00:29:12,467
SO, RINKMAN, YOU'VE ENDED UP
AS A SPACE PIRATE.

706
00:29:12,533 --> 00:29:14,533
AT LEAST YOU
CAN'T SINK ANY LOWER.

707
00:29:14,600 --> 00:29:17,000
WELL, I COULD DATE YOU.

708
00:29:17,067 --> 00:29:19,700
DON'T YOU GET IT?
YOU DESTROY SPACESHIPS.

709
00:29:19,767 --> 00:29:21,900
OH, WELL IT-- HUH?

710
00:29:21,967 --> 00:29:23,667
HEY, IT'S
THE SUCKER BROTHERS.

711
00:29:23,733 --> 00:29:24,833
[LAUGHING]

712
00:29:24,900 --> 00:29:26,300
WELL, YOU KNOW,
I SAW A KID--

713
00:29:26,367 --> 00:29:28,533
A COLLEGE KID STICK HIS HEAD
IN A PARTY BALL ONE TIME.

714
00:29:28,600 --> 00:29:29,967
YOU WON'T BE HARMED.

715
00:29:30,033 --> 00:29:33,733
WE JUST NEUTRALIZED YOUR
SHIP'S ROCKETS AND EQUIPMENT.

716
00:29:33,800 --> 00:29:35,667
- AND YOUR STOMACH ACID.
- WHY ARE WE STILL
IN NORMAL FLIGHT?

717
00:29:35,733 --> 00:29:37,400
YOU'RE NOT.

718
00:29:37,467 --> 00:29:40,733
YOU'RE REVOLVING AROUND
CASSA 7 IN A FIXED ORBIT,

719
00:29:40,800 --> 00:29:43,733
JUST LIKE THE MOON REVOLVES
AROUND THE EARTH.

720
00:29:43,800 --> 00:29:45,733
- HOW?
- WE CUT YOUR POWER

721
00:29:45,800 --> 00:29:47,333
AND NEUTRALIZED
YOUR EQUIPMENT.

722
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:49,267
AND PASS THE SAVINGS
ON TO YOU.

723
00:29:49,333 --> 00:29:51,433
...BALANCED AGAINST
THE GRAVITY OF CASSA 7.

724
00:29:51,500 --> 00:29:54,400
THAT'S WHAT HAPPENED TO
THE OTHER SHIPS YOU'VE PIRATED.

725
00:29:54,467 --> 00:29:55,500
- THAT'S RIGHT.
- ARRR.

726
00:29:55,567 --> 00:29:57,867
YOU'LL BE REVOLVING
AROUND CASSA 7

727
00:29:57,933 --> 00:29:59,800
FOR THE NEXT MILLION YEARS,

728
00:29:59,867 --> 00:30:02,733
OR UNTIL A PIECE OF METEORIC
WASTE HITS THE SHIP.

729
00:30:02,800 --> 00:30:05,867
OR UNTIL I TURN
INTO ROBERT STACK.

730
00:30:05,933 --> 00:30:08,567
I'LL HAVE THE MARKINGS
REMOVED FROM YOUR SHIP.

731
00:30:08,633 --> 00:30:11,500
YOU HAVE FOUND A NEW WAY
TO COMMIT MURDER.

732
00:30:11,567 --> 00:30:13,800
- YOU NOTICED?
- DON'T GIVE ME
ANY CREDIT, VENA.

733
00:30:13,867 --> 00:30:15,467
DR. VANKO WORKED IT OUT.

734
00:30:15,533 --> 00:30:19,800
I JUST MAKE SURE THAT NO OTHER
SPACESHIP BOTHERS YOU.

735
00:30:19,867 --> 00:30:22,733
WHY, YOU, YOU PERSON, YOU!

736
00:30:24,067 --> 00:30:27,133
THERE GOES A NARWHAL!

737
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:31,367
OH, OUR AIR ISN'T GOOD
ENOUGH FOR THE JOHNSONS.

738
00:30:31,433 --> 00:30:33,033
THEY HAVE TO BRING
THEIR OWN.

739
00:30:34,500 --> 00:30:35,600
- RINKMAN...
- IT'S A BOY.

740
00:30:35,667 --> 00:30:37,467
THAT'S THE LAST OF IT.

741
00:30:37,533 --> 00:30:39,367
I'LL SEND YOUR PILOT BACK.

742
00:30:39,433 --> 00:30:41,500
YOU DON'T HAVE TO YELL,
I'M SITTING RIGHT NEXT TO YOU.

743
00:30:41,567 --> 00:30:44,367
- OH, I ALMOST FORGOT.
- YOUR DAD CALLED.

744
00:30:44,433 --> 00:30:47,133
IN CASE YOU'RE EXPECTING HELP
FROM ROCKY JONES, FORGET IT.

745
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:50,400
- HE'S OUT OF COMMISSION.
- I'VE GOT A DECOY SPACESHIP
WAITING FOR HIM.

746
00:30:50,467 --> 00:30:53,033
THE ORBIT JET
WILL BE BLOWN TO BITS.

747
00:30:53,100 --> 00:30:56,133
[LAUGHS] I CAN'T PRETEND
I'M NOT ENJOYING THIS.

748
00:30:57,300 --> 00:30:59,333
- [MIMICS GIGGLING]
- THE ORBIT JET...

749
00:30:59,400 --> 00:31:01,433
THE ORBIT JET IS GOING.

750
00:31:01,500 --> 00:31:07,100
- THE ORBIT JET IS GOING.
- IT'S BLOWING UP TO BITS.

751
00:31:07,167 --> 00:31:09,100
SO, UH,
WHICH SHIP IS THEIRS,

752
00:31:09,167 --> 00:31:10,500
THE PHALLIC ONE
OR THE PHALLIC ONE?

753
00:31:10,567 --> 00:31:11,833
OH, I THINK IT'S
THE PHALLIC ONE--

754
00:31:11,900 --> 00:31:13,033
OHH.

755
00:31:16,100 --> 00:31:18,100
WE'LL CALL YOU.
THANKS FOR BREAKFAST.

756
00:31:18,167 --> 00:31:19,600
BYE-BYE NOW.

757
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:22,667
WAY TO GO, BOB.

758
00:31:22,733 --> 00:31:24,400
DO WE HAVE A CHANCE?

759
00:31:25,867 --> 00:31:27,467
NO USE KIDDING
OURSELVES, VENA.

760
00:31:27,533 --> 00:31:29,433
- NOPE.
- IT'S LIKE A MILLION
TO ONE SHOT

761
00:31:29,500 --> 00:31:31,900
- THAT WE'LL EVER BE SEEN.
- OH, THEY'RE ON COMEDY CENTRAL.

762
00:31:31,967 --> 00:31:35,267
LIKE FINDING A TINY FRAGMENT
IN INFINITE SPACE.

763
00:31:35,333 --> 00:31:37,600
UNTIL OUR FOOD GIVES OUT

764
00:31:37,667 --> 00:31:39,833
OR A METEORITE
HITS US.

765
00:31:39,900 --> 00:31:41,400
THAT'S THE DEAL, VENA.

766
00:31:41,467 --> 00:31:44,200
VENA, WHEN I GO, I WANT YOU
TO ROAST ME AND EAT ME.

767
00:31:44,267 --> 00:31:46,067
- ALL OF IT. BRISKET, TOO.
- RIGHT NOW I'M HUNGRY.

768
00:31:46,133 --> 00:31:48,867
- I'LL GET LUNCH.
- HMM.

769
00:31:48,933 --> 00:31:50,967
HAZEL, WILL YOU COOK UP
SOMETHING FOR DINNER?

770
00:31:51,033 --> 00:31:52,800
OKAY, MR. B.

771
00:32:00,667 --> 00:32:02,233
WINKY,
WHAT'S OUR POSITION?

772
00:32:02,300 --> 00:32:04,367
LEANING TOWARDS PEROT.

773
00:32:07,200 --> 00:32:08,667
NOW LET ME SEE
IF I CAN READ IT.

774
00:32:08,733 --> 00:32:10,400
- AH, YOU HAVE TO BE 18, KID.
- WHAT ARE YOU TRYING TO DO,

775
00:32:10,467 --> 00:32:11,933
GET MY JOB AS NAVIGATOR?

776
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:13,533
OH, YOU KNOW I WOULDN'T
TAKE ANYTHING

777
00:32:13,600 --> 00:32:15,100
THAT'S YOURS OR ROCKY'S.

778
00:32:15,167 --> 00:32:17,433
- GO AHEAD AND READ IT, BOY.
- YEAH, READ IT, BOY, READ IT.

779
00:32:17,500 --> 00:32:20,567
- DO THE FUNNY VOICE.
- POSITION CELESTIAL MERIDIAN,

780
00:32:20,633 --> 00:32:24,167
LONGITUDE 219 DEGREES,
20 MINUTES.

781
00:32:24,233 --> 00:32:26,267
- WHAT IS THIS, RADIO OZ?
- CELESTIAL PARALLEL,

782
00:32:26,333 --> 00:32:29,633
LATITUDE 76 DEGREES,
FOUR MINUTES.

783
00:32:29,700 --> 00:32:31,633
[CHUCKLES]
GOOD WORK, BOBBY.

784
00:32:31,700 --> 00:32:33,300
- OH, WINKY...
- YEAH, ROCKY?

785
00:32:33,367 --> 00:32:35,033
JETTISON BOBBY.

786
00:32:35,100 --> 00:32:37,500
THEY STILL HAVE NO WORD
FROM VENA'S SPACESHIP.

787
00:32:37,567 --> 00:32:40,800
OH? WELL, MAYBE WE BETTER START
SCANNING THE RADAR VEX, HUH?

788
00:32:40,867 --> 00:32:42,133
- WHAT DO YOU THINK, BOBBY?
- GOOD IDEA.

789
00:32:42,200 --> 00:32:44,700
OUR FLIGHT WILL TAKE US
INTO CASSA'S ATMOSPHERE.

790
00:32:44,767 --> 00:32:47,567
HEY, WINKY, A SPACESHIP
AT FIVE O'CLOCK.

791
00:32:47,633 --> 00:32:50,700
- OH?
- MADE YOU LOOK.

792
00:32:52,500 --> 00:32:55,400
- CAN YOU IDENTIFY IT?
- YEAH, IT'S A SPACESHIP
AT FIVE O'CLOCK.

793
00:32:55,467 --> 00:32:56,933
YEAH, IT'S
A MARA SPACESHIP.

794
00:33:08,067 --> 00:33:09,967
I'LL ARC OVER THE SHIP
AT R-400.

795
00:33:10,033 --> 00:33:13,200
- DUH, OKAY.
- RELEASE ROCKET ON COUNT FIVE.

796
00:33:13,267 --> 00:33:15,367
OKAY.

797
00:33:15,433 --> 00:33:17,200
- STARTING RUN.
- OKAY.

798
00:33:17,267 --> 00:33:19,600
ONE, TWO...

799
00:33:20,900 --> 00:33:23,267
- WHAT COMES AFTER TWO?
- UH, UM...

800
00:33:23,333 --> 00:33:25,367
THREE... FOUR...

801
00:33:25,433 --> 00:33:28,000
- FIVE!
- HIKEEBA!

802
00:33:28,067 --> 00:33:29,633
OUCH.

803
00:33:29,700 --> 00:33:32,267
WELL, THE DOUBLE-M JUST
BECAME THE SCRAMBLED M.

804
00:33:32,333 --> 00:33:34,567
- [CHUCKLES]
- GET OUT, GET OUT!

805
00:33:34,633 --> 00:33:37,133
...SO THAT A FULL REPORT CAN BE
SENT TO MARS SPACE HEADQUARTERS.

806
00:33:37,200 --> 00:33:39,567
- ALL DONE!
- WHAT DID YOU HIT?

807
00:33:39,633 --> 00:33:41,800
SIGHTED ENEMY,
SMEARED SAME.

808
00:33:41,867 --> 00:33:43,800
AND WHY DO I HAVE TO MISS
ALL THE EXCITEMENT?

809
00:33:43,867 --> 00:33:46,667
'CAUSE WE DON'T LIKE YOU
AND YOU'RE A BAD PERSON.

810
00:33:46,733 --> 00:33:48,633
KEEP THE RADAR VEX
OPEN, WINKY.

811
00:33:48,700 --> 00:33:50,167
I'M SURE WE'RE IN AN AREA

812
00:33:50,233 --> 00:33:52,233
OUR UNKNOWN ENEMIES
DON'T WANT US TO SEARCH.

813
00:33:52,300 --> 00:33:54,600
- YES, SIR.
- YES, IT'S A DARK,
FORBIDDEN AREA,

814
00:33:54,667 --> 00:33:56,733
FULL OF SECRETS AND SHAME.

815
00:33:58,800 --> 00:34:01,233
[BEEPING]

816
00:34:01,300 --> 00:34:02,633
IF YOU'D LIKE
TO MAKE A CALL,

817
00:34:02,700 --> 00:34:03,900
PLEASE HANG UP
AND DIAL AGAIN.

818
00:34:03,967 --> 00:34:05,667
IF YOU'D LIKE TO MAKE
A CALL...

819
00:34:05,733 --> 00:34:09,267
- ROCKY, OBJECT AHEAD.
- COULD YOU BE MORE VAGUE,
WINKY?

820
00:34:12,100 --> 00:34:14,200
OBJECT ABOUT TWO SOLAR
MINUTES AHEAD OF US.

821
00:34:14,267 --> 00:34:15,700
YEAH, SHUT UP.
WHAT'S GOING ON, WINKY?

822
00:34:15,767 --> 00:34:16,767
ALL RIGHT, BOBBY.

823
00:34:16,833 --> 00:34:18,333
PROFESSOR NEWTON
CAN BE PROUD OF YOU.

824
00:34:18,400 --> 00:34:20,900
ELEMENTAL, MY DEAR ROCKY,
ELEMENTAL.

825
00:34:20,967 --> 00:34:21,967
- ELEMENTAL?
- DIPSTICK.

826
00:34:22,033 --> 00:34:23,700
HOLD ON, WINKY.
WHEN WE'RE HALFWAY THERE

827
00:34:23,767 --> 00:34:25,867
WE'LL BE ABLE TO TELL
IF IT'S A SPACESHIP.

828
00:34:27,300 --> 00:34:30,467
ROCKY, WHY'D YOU BRING THIS
ON THE ORBIT JET?

829
00:34:30,533 --> 00:34:32,267
OH, THAT?
THAT'S OUR RAUSCHENBERG.

830
00:34:32,333 --> 00:34:34,600
WELL, THAT'S SOMETHING
PROFESSOR NEWTON'S BEEN
WORKING ON FOR A LONG TIME.

831
00:34:34,667 --> 00:34:36,600
I KNOW, IT'S COLD LIGHT.

832
00:34:36,667 --> 00:34:37,733
- D'OH!
- OH?

833
00:34:37,800 --> 00:34:39,267
THEN HE'S TOLD YOU
ABOUT IT, HUH?

834
00:34:39,333 --> 00:34:42,733
YES, WE DISCUSSED IT,
AND I GAVE HIM MY OPINION.

835
00:34:42,800 --> 00:34:44,900
WELL, I KNOW HE
APPRECIATED THAT.

836
00:34:44,967 --> 00:34:47,833
COLD LIGHT SHOULD NEVER BE
USED INDISCRIMINATELY.

837
00:34:47,900 --> 00:34:50,433
THE GAMMA RAYS COULD BE
FATAL TO THOSE WHO USE IT.

838
00:34:50,500 --> 00:34:53,300
- REMEMBER THAT, KIDS.
- YES, UH, PROFESSOR NEWTON
WARNED ME.

839
00:34:53,367 --> 00:34:55,633
ROCKY,
IT'S A SPACESHIP AHEAD.

840
00:34:55,700 --> 00:34:59,533
HEY, HAS BOBBY BEEN GIVING YOU
THAT COLD LIGHT CRAP?

841
00:35:00,900 --> 00:35:02,767
HEY, THAT'S US
FIVE MINUTES AGO.

842
00:35:02,833 --> 00:35:05,267
- SAFETY BELTS.
- EXCEPT FOR YOU, BOBBY.

843
00:35:06,600 --> 00:35:07,867
BOBBY BEEN GETTING TO YOU?

844
00:35:07,933 --> 00:35:09,300
YOU THINKING
WHAT I'M THINKING?

845
00:35:09,367 --> 00:35:11,467
YEP, I GOT A HEADACHE
THIS BIG

846
00:35:11,533 --> 00:35:13,667
AND IT'S GOT BOBBY
WRITTEN ALL OVER IT.

847
00:35:15,400 --> 00:35:17,500
THIS IS THE XV-2
CALLING SPACESHIP

848
00:35:17,567 --> 00:35:22,000
AT APPROXIMATELY
CELESTIAL MERIDIAN 190 DEGREES,

849
00:35:22,067 --> 00:35:24,600
CELESTIAL PARALLEL
80 DEGREES.

850
00:35:24,667 --> 00:35:25,967
COME IN, IDENTIFY YOURSELF.

851
00:35:26,033 --> 00:35:27,167
I AM KIRA.

852
00:35:28,533 --> 00:35:30,100
THIS IS THE XV-2
CALLING SPACESHIP

853
00:35:30,167 --> 00:35:33,467
AT APPROXIMATELY CELESTIAL
MERIDIAN 180 DEGREES,

854
00:35:33,533 --> 00:35:36,700
CELESTIAL PARALLEL 90 DEGREES.

855
00:35:36,767 --> 00:35:38,033
COME IN, IDENTIFY YOURSELF.

856
00:35:38,100 --> 00:35:40,100
I HAVE NO IDEA
WHAT I'M SAYING, OVER.

857
00:35:43,733 --> 00:35:45,467
IT'S A SPACESHIP, REGGIE.

858
00:35:45,533 --> 00:35:48,233
- NO.
- YEAH, BOY, NOTHING
GETS PAST HER.

859
00:35:48,300 --> 00:35:50,167
WE HAVE TO GET
SOME SIGNAL TO HIM.

860
00:35:50,233 --> 00:35:51,667
WE'RE HELPLESS, VENA.

861
00:35:51,733 --> 00:35:53,533
THE ROCKET MISSILES.

862
00:35:53,600 --> 00:35:55,067
WE CAN'T OPERATE
THE TUBES.

863
00:35:55,133 --> 00:35:56,200
- I HAD 'EM TIED.
- EVEN IF WE COULD,

864
00:35:56,267 --> 00:35:57,533
FIRING THEM
WOULDN'T BE SAFE.

865
00:35:57,600 --> 00:35:59,500
I MEAN, FORCE THEM
THROUGH THE TUBES.

866
00:35:59,567 --> 00:36:00,967
DROP THEM OVER SIDE.

867
00:36:01,033 --> 00:36:03,567
THEY'D HAVE TO SEE THAT
AND NOT PASS US BY.

868
00:36:03,633 --> 00:36:04,900
- HEY, IT MIGHT WORK.
- WHO MADE YOU THE EXPERT?

869
00:36:04,967 --> 00:36:06,200
WE COULD GIVE IT A TRY.

870
00:36:06,267 --> 00:36:08,533
WE MAY HAVE ENOUGH AUXILIARY
POWER TO DROP THEM OFF.

871
00:36:08,600 --> 00:36:09,533
HEY.

872
00:36:13,067 --> 00:36:15,400
- REGGIE MUST DIE-- HUH?
- WINKY, BOBBY...

873
00:36:15,467 --> 00:36:18,033
LOOK AT THEIR
MISSILE TUBES STARBOARD.

874
00:36:18,100 --> 00:36:19,600
IT'S STARTING TO OPEN.

875
00:36:19,667 --> 00:36:21,867
WE'RE GONNA BE DUCKING
MISSILES IN A MINUTE.

876
00:36:21,933 --> 00:36:23,800
PORT ROCKET, WINKY.

877
00:36:23,867 --> 00:36:27,000
SAME RUN, FIRE MISSILE
ON COUNT FIVE.

878
00:36:27,067 --> 00:36:28,300
REPEAT, ON FIVE.

879
00:36:28,367 --> 00:36:30,900
REPEAT, ON FIVE.
REPEAT, ON FIVE.

880
00:36:30,967 --> 00:36:32,367
LOOK, SHUT UP!

881
00:36:35,567 --> 00:36:37,733
- STARTING RUN.
- OKAY.

882
00:36:37,800 --> 00:36:40,733
ONE... TWO... THREE...

883
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:43,300
FOUR--
HOLD IT, WINKY, HOLD FIRE!

884
00:36:44,767 --> 00:36:46,700
OH, COUGHED UP A FURBALL.

885
00:36:46,767 --> 00:36:48,933
- [MIMICS HACKING]
- THEY EJECTED THE ROCKET.

886
00:36:49,000 --> 00:36:50,467
THEY WEREN'T FIRING IT.

887
00:36:50,533 --> 00:36:52,400
THAT WAS MEANT
AS A SIGNAL TO US.

888
00:36:52,467 --> 00:36:54,633
MAYBE THE SHIP'S IN SOME
KIND OF TROUBLE, ROCKY.

889
00:36:54,700 --> 00:36:56,833
OH, GET OUT OF HERE, BOBBY!
CLEAR THE ROOM.

890
00:36:56,900 --> 00:36:58,933
- WE'RE GOING ALONGSIDE.
- AYE AYE, SIR.

891
00:37:04,267 --> 00:37:06,700
- THE ORBIT JET IS GONE.
- OHH.

892
00:37:06,767 --> 00:37:10,100
♪ STUPID CAR ♪

893
00:37:10,167 --> 00:37:11,333
[ALL]
STUPID CAR.

894
00:37:12,733 --> 00:37:14,367
OH, THIS IS KIND OF
LIKE "DIVER DOWN"

895
00:37:14,433 --> 00:37:17,400
ONLY WITHOUT ALL
THE MAJESTY AND GRANDEUR.

896
00:37:17,467 --> 00:37:19,300
OH, LOOK AT THAT EFFECT.

897
00:37:19,367 --> 00:37:21,967
INDUSTRIAL LIGHT & MAGIC,
YOU'VE DONE IT AGAIN.

898
00:37:22,033 --> 00:37:23,100
[CHUCKLING] YES.

899
00:37:23,167 --> 00:37:24,367
[RATTLING]

900
00:37:24,433 --> 00:37:25,567
IT'S COME ALONGSIDE.

901
00:37:25,633 --> 00:37:27,033
I'LL OPEN
THE AIR LOCK HATCH.

902
00:37:27,100 --> 00:37:29,633
OH, GREAT, IT REALLY WORKED
GOOD LAST TIME YOU DID THAT.

903
00:37:29,700 --> 00:37:31,867
YEAH, GET ON
YOUR MINI-GREENHOUSE.

904
00:37:33,200 --> 00:37:35,200
I'M TURNING THIS WHEEL.
REALLY, I'M TURNING IT.

905
00:37:35,267 --> 00:37:36,667
DOESN'T IT LOOK LIKE IT?

906
00:37:40,933 --> 00:37:42,667
- SHE WAITS.
- WHERE HAVE YOU BEEN?

907
00:37:42,733 --> 00:37:44,933
YOU COULD HAVE CALLED.

908
00:37:45,000 --> 00:37:46,333
OH, HI, BOBBY.
HI, WINKY.

909
00:37:46,400 --> 00:37:49,300
ROCKY, BOBBY.

910
00:37:49,367 --> 00:37:51,200
OH, YOU HAD US WORRIED.

911
00:37:51,267 --> 00:37:54,000
I WAS NEVER SO HAPPY
TO SEE ANYONE IN ALL MY LIFE.

912
00:37:54,067 --> 00:37:55,367
WHY DIDN'T YOU
ANSWER OUR SIGNAL?

913
00:37:55,433 --> 00:37:57,367
OUR POWER AND EQUIPMENT
WERE NEUTRALIZED.

914
00:37:57,433 --> 00:38:00,733
OUR SPACESHIP IS
A SATELLITE OF CASSA 7.

915
00:38:00,800 --> 00:38:02,033
HOW'D THAT HAPPEN?

916
00:38:02,100 --> 00:38:03,400
RINKMAN AND DR. VANKO,

917
00:38:03,467 --> 00:38:05,533
THE TWO RENEGADES
FROM EARTH ARRANGED IT.

918
00:38:05,600 --> 00:38:08,400
OH, SO THEY'RE THE CAUSE
OF ALL THE TROUBLE.

919
00:38:08,467 --> 00:38:10,133
THEY'VE TAKEN UP
SPACE PIRATING.

920
00:38:10,200 --> 00:38:12,200
THEY CAME ALONGSIDE AND
TOOK OFF ALL OUR CARGO.

921
00:38:12,267 --> 00:38:13,733
- AND YOUR ESCARGOT.
- I SEE.

922
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:14,767
WELL, YOU CAN GIVE ME
A COMPLETE RUNDOWN

923
00:38:14,833 --> 00:38:16,100
ON OUR WAY TO CASSA 7.

924
00:38:16,167 --> 00:38:17,867
WE CAN'T GET OUT
OF OUR ORBIT, ROCKY.

925
00:38:17,933 --> 00:38:19,633
OH, I THINK WE CAN.

926
00:38:19,700 --> 00:38:21,467
THE ORBIT JET
WILL TAKE YOU UP.

927
00:38:21,533 --> 00:38:23,167
WE'LL STAY IN
MAGNETIC LOCK,

928
00:38:23,233 --> 00:38:24,800
TANDEM PULL
WILL DO THE JOB.

929
00:38:24,867 --> 00:38:26,833
YOU BETTER STAY BY
THE CONTROLS HERE, REG.

930
00:38:26,900 --> 00:38:29,300
VENA, YOU COME IN
THE ORBIT JET WITH ME.

931
00:38:29,367 --> 00:38:31,367
- THAT'S LIKE GOING HOME, ROCKY.
- I KNOW.

932
00:38:31,433 --> 00:38:32,767
I TOLD HIM WE'D
FIND YOU, VENA.

933
00:38:32,833 --> 00:38:35,867
- DIDN'T I, ROCKY?
- SHUT UP, SHUT UP, SHUT UP!

934
00:38:37,233 --> 00:38:39,933
ONE DAY, ALL OF YOU
SPACE LOSERS

935
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:43,000
WILL BE WORKING FOR ME
AND I MEAN IT, TOO!

936
00:38:45,333 --> 00:38:47,867
[HEAVY BREATHING]

937
00:38:47,933 --> 00:38:49,533
- STOP.
- [EXHALES]

938
00:38:49,600 --> 00:38:51,467
DID THE UNIVERSE MOVE
FOR YOU, TOO?

939
00:38:51,533 --> 00:38:52,867
CROW, DON'T YOU START.

940
00:38:52,933 --> 00:38:54,667
- OHH.
- WELL, WE LIGHT UP.

941
00:38:57,867 --> 00:38:59,167
[MIMICS BUZZING]

942
00:38:59,233 --> 00:39:01,333
XV-2, CALLING CASSA 7.

943
00:39:01,400 --> 00:39:02,767
COME IN, CASSA 7.

944
00:39:02,833 --> 00:39:05,667
I'M SPEAKING TO YOU
OVER A JIMMY DEAN SAUSAGE.

945
00:39:05,733 --> 00:39:07,333
...TO XV-2.

946
00:39:07,400 --> 00:39:08,867
REQUESTING
LANDING CLEARANCE.

947
00:39:08,933 --> 00:39:11,033
- SAY PLEASE.
- BRINGING SPACESHIP CM-7 IN

948
00:39:11,100 --> 00:39:12,600
ON TANDEM PULL.

949
00:39:12,667 --> 00:39:14,500
LANDING PLATFORM
IN READINESS.

950
00:39:14,567 --> 00:39:16,833
PLEASE REPORT AT 10 MILES.

951
00:39:16,900 --> 00:39:19,667
WE'LL BRING YOU IN FOR
GROUND CONTROL APPROACH.

952
00:39:19,733 --> 00:39:21,267
- OUT.
- OUT.

953
00:39:21,333 --> 00:39:22,833
THAT WAS EASY.

954
00:39:28,533 --> 00:39:31,167
LOOKS LIKE THEY BAGGED
AN ALBINO FIVE-POINT BUCK.

955
00:39:31,233 --> 00:39:32,867
YOU HAVE TO LOOK AT IT
A CERTAIN WAY.

956
00:39:32,933 --> 00:39:33,900
YEAH, KIND OF SQUINT.

957
00:39:33,967 --> 00:39:36,100
- [BEEPING]
- IT'S BACKING UP.

958
00:39:40,733 --> 00:39:43,000
STAND BY
TWIN LANDING PLATFORMS.

959
00:39:43,067 --> 00:39:45,600
READY MAGNETIC LOCKS.

960
00:39:45,667 --> 00:39:47,000
IT'S ONLY A MATTER
OF SECONDS NOW.

961
00:39:47,067 --> 00:39:49,233
MY SISTER VENA CAN'T BE
ANY HAPPIER THAN I AM.

962
00:39:49,300 --> 00:39:51,200
YOU DON'T KNOW VENA.

963
00:39:51,267 --> 00:39:52,400
NOVENA.

964
00:39:52,467 --> 00:39:54,600
LOOK AT THIS, THIS IS US
AT THE GRAND CANYON.

965
00:39:56,767 --> 00:39:59,500
WHEN IN DULUTH,
VISIT THE LIFT BRIDGE.

966
00:40:02,933 --> 00:40:05,600
UH, SIR, YOU'RE IN AN
ASSIGNED PARKING SPACE.

967
00:40:05,667 --> 00:40:07,367
SIR, SIR?

968
00:40:07,433 --> 00:40:09,800
THE ORBIT JET AND CM-7

969
00:40:09,867 --> 00:40:11,600
IN MAGNETIC LOCK
ARE SAFELY LANDED, SIR.

970
00:40:11,667 --> 00:40:13,967
CAN I HAVE A COOKIE?

971
00:40:14,033 --> 00:40:16,600
- HE'S GOT A REALLY HIGH BUTT.
- HE SURE DOES.

972
00:40:18,500 --> 00:40:20,067
I'LL BET YOU
YOU'RE EXCITED, VENA.

973
00:40:20,133 --> 00:40:22,000
I'M EXCITED AND HAPPY,

974
00:40:22,067 --> 00:40:24,267
AND THANKFUL
I REACHED CASSA 7.

975
00:40:24,333 --> 00:40:26,267
YOUR BIG BROTHER'S PROBABLY
WAITING OUTSIDE NOW.

976
00:40:26,333 --> 00:40:27,800
- LET'S ROLL, BOYS.
- YES.

977
00:40:27,867 --> 00:40:29,633
VERY FUNNY, WINKY.

978
00:40:34,233 --> 00:40:35,567
PAUL!

979
00:40:42,033 --> 00:40:43,900
[CHUCKLES]
YOU KNOW, JOEL,

980
00:40:43,967 --> 00:40:45,500
I STAND AND CHUCKLE
AND WONDER

981
00:40:45,567 --> 00:40:47,833
AT THE SPACE DIALOG
IN THIS SO-CALLED SPACE MOVIE.

982
00:40:47,900 --> 00:40:50,067
I KNOW, MOVIES LIKE THIS
ARE ALWAYS TRYING TO SHOW

983
00:40:50,133 --> 00:40:51,333
HOW FUTURISTIC THEY ARE

984
00:40:51,400 --> 00:40:53,133
BY PUTTING THE WORD "SPACE"
IN FRONT OF EVERYTHING.

985
00:40:53,200 --> 00:40:54,900
WELL, IT'S A CLASSIC OVERUSE

986
00:40:54,967 --> 00:40:56,400
OF WHAT'S KNOWN
AS A MODIFIER,

987
00:40:56,467 --> 00:40:59,167
AND IN THIS MOVIE, OUR
GRAMMATICAL FRIEND THE MODIFIER

988
00:40:59,233 --> 00:41:00,733
PUTS IN TRIPLE OVERTIME.

989
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:02,400
YOU SEE, THEY EAT
THEIR SPACE LUNCH,

990
00:41:02,467 --> 00:41:03,867
THEY TAKE
THEIR SPACE PILLS.

991
00:41:03,933 --> 00:41:05,600
THERE WAS A SPACE GIRLFRIEND
ON THIS SHIP,

992
00:41:05,667 --> 00:41:07,333
THERE WAS A PESKY SPACE KID.

993
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:08,833
SPACE THIS, SPACE THAT.

994
00:41:08,900 --> 00:41:11,633
YEAH, WITH ALL THE MAN HOURS
SPENT ON INGENIOUS PLOT POINTS

995
00:41:11,700 --> 00:41:13,633
AND CAREFULLY CRAFTED
CHARACTER DEVELOPMENT,

996
00:41:13,700 --> 00:41:15,600
THERE WAS NO TIME
FOR HARD RESEARCH.

997
00:41:15,667 --> 00:41:17,867
AND, HEY, DID YOU GET A LOAD
OF THOSE REALLY CHEAP PROPS

998
00:41:17,933 --> 00:41:20,000
MADE TO LOOK LIKE
BONA FIDE SPACE EQUIPMENT?

999
00:41:20,067 --> 00:41:21,333
[CHUCKLING]

1000
00:41:21,400 --> 00:41:24,067
- UH... YEAH.
- AH, WELL, YOU KNOW,

1001
00:41:24,133 --> 00:41:26,000
IT MAKES YOU WONDER IF PEOPLE
DID THIS SORT OF THING

1002
00:41:26,067 --> 00:41:28,400
- IN EVERY ERA, DOESN'T IT?
- RIGHT. [GASPS]

1003
00:41:28,467 --> 00:41:30,267
LIKE IN THE OLD DAYS
OF THE OLD WEST.

1004
00:41:30,333 --> 00:41:32,233
MAYBE FRONTIER PEOPLE
ATE FRONTIER CHIPS

1005
00:41:32,300 --> 00:41:33,300
WITH FRONTIER ONION DIP

1006
00:41:33,367 --> 00:41:34,567
AND RODE THEIR
FRONTIER TRANSPORTATION

1007
00:41:34,633 --> 00:41:35,767
DOWN TO THE FRONTIER
MEETING PLACE

1008
00:41:35,833 --> 00:41:37,100
TO WATCH SOME
FRONTIER ENTERTAINMENT,

1009
00:41:37,167 --> 00:41:39,333
AND THEN SOME OF THEM USED
THEIR FRONTIER GUNS

1010
00:41:39,400 --> 00:41:41,200
AND FRONTIER RIFLES TO SETTLE
A GAME OF FRONTIER POKER

1011
00:41:41,267 --> 00:41:43,300
IN WHICH SOMEBODY FRONTIER
CHEATED ON FRONTIER FREMONT!

1012
00:41:43,367 --> 00:41:44,733
[GASPING]

1013
00:41:44,800 --> 00:41:46,267
THE IMPLICATIONS
ARE STAGGERING.

1014
00:41:46,333 --> 00:41:48,400
THE MOST TEMPORAL SOCIAL
INTERCOURSE WITH ONE'S PEERS

1015
00:41:48,467 --> 00:41:49,667
MIGHT ESCALATE TO THE DEGREE

1016
00:41:49,733 --> 00:41:51,933
THAT NEITHER PARTY KNOWS
WHAT OF THE OTHER SPEAKS,

1017
00:41:52,000 --> 00:41:54,400
THUS PROFOUNDLY AFFECTING
INTERPERSONAL RELATIONSHIPS

1018
00:41:54,467 --> 00:41:56,767
AND THE RESULTING IMPACT
COULD CHANGE THE ENTIRE
SOCIAL FABRIC

1019
00:41:56,833 --> 00:41:58,333
OF MODERN CIVILIZATION.

1020
00:41:58,400 --> 00:41:59,633
REALLY MAKES YOU THINK,
DOESN'T IT?

1021
00:41:59,700 --> 00:42:01,167
NO.

1022
00:42:01,233 --> 00:42:03,567
UH, HEY, SPACE JOEL,
SPACE SUGGESTION.

1023
00:42:03,633 --> 00:42:06,800
LET'S HAVE SPACE AU GRATIN
POTATOES FOR DINNER TONIGHT.

1024
00:42:06,867 --> 00:42:08,100
- SPACE DINNER!
- RIGHT, RIGHT.

1025
00:42:08,167 --> 00:42:09,933
GOOD IDEA, SPACEY.

1026
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:12,533
- I'LL GET MY SPACE RECIPE OUT.
- THE SPACE KITCHEN.

1027
00:42:12,600 --> 00:42:14,333
HEY, SPACE TOM,
LOOKS LIKE YOU'RE GETTING

1028
00:42:14,400 --> 00:42:16,667
A LITTLE SPACE PIMPLE ON
THE OLD SPACE NOODLE.

1029
00:42:16,733 --> 00:42:18,433
I'LL GO TO
THE SPACE MEDICINE SPACE

1030
00:42:18,500 --> 00:42:20,333
AND GET YOU SOME
SPACE ASTRINGENT.

1031
00:42:20,400 --> 00:42:22,400
[ALL LAUGHING]

1032
00:42:22,467 --> 00:42:24,333
- AHH...
- YOU KNOW WHAT, FOLKS?

1033
00:42:24,400 --> 00:42:26,633
MODIFIERS, THEY CAN BE
YOUR FRIEND

1034
00:42:26,700 --> 00:42:28,033
AND THEY
CAN BE YOUR ENEMY.

1035
00:42:28,100 --> 00:42:29,333
- MODIFIERS.
- [BUZZING]

1036
00:42:29,400 --> 00:42:31,533
♪ COME ON AND ZOOM ON,
ZOOM ON, ZOOM ON-- ♪

1037
00:42:31,600 --> 00:42:32,833
OH, WE GOT MOVIE!

1038
00:42:32,900 --> 00:42:34,633
WE GOT MOVIE
ZOOM, ZOOM!

1039
00:42:44,400 --> 00:42:46,600
- A SPACE DESK.
- YEAH.

1040
00:42:49,800 --> 00:42:52,100
I JUST CAN'T GET ENOUGH
OF BETTIE PAGE.

1041
00:42:52,167 --> 00:42:55,133
- WOW.
- EXCUSE YOU.

1042
00:42:56,933 --> 00:42:58,700
ONE NIGHT... MM...

1043
00:42:58,767 --> 00:43:01,400
OH, GAY NIGHTLIFE, MM,
YEAH, MMM...

1044
00:43:01,467 --> 00:43:03,667
HEY, WINKY'S DOING
HIS STRAITJACKET ROUTINE.

1045
00:43:03,733 --> 00:43:04,667
OOH.

1046
00:43:09,067 --> 00:43:11,367
OH, GREAT, ALL SHE CAN
MAKE IS POP TARTS.

1047
00:43:11,433 --> 00:43:12,500
THANKS, VENA.

1048
00:43:12,567 --> 00:43:13,933
CAN I GET YOU
ANYTHING ELSE?

1049
00:43:14,000 --> 00:43:15,267
NO, THIS IS JUST FINE.

1050
00:43:15,333 --> 00:43:16,733
OH, DID YOU GET
BOBBY TO BED?

1051
00:43:16,800 --> 00:43:18,633
YES, HE'S IN DREAMLAND.

1052
00:43:18,700 --> 00:43:20,033
SO'S WINKY.

1053
00:43:20,100 --> 00:43:22,100
AND YOU'RE NEXT, VENA.
TURN IN.

1054
00:43:22,167 --> 00:43:23,733
ARE WE GETTING
ANYWHERE, ROCKY?

1055
00:43:23,800 --> 00:43:25,767
OH, YOU KNOW I'M NOT READY
FOR COMMITMENT.

1056
00:43:25,833 --> 00:43:27,967
IF PAUL'S AROUND
I'D LIKE TO TALK WITH HIM.

1057
00:43:28,033 --> 00:43:30,933
- WE'LL BE RIGHT WITH YOU.
- OH, VENA, JUST PAUL.

1058
00:43:31,000 --> 00:43:32,600
YOU'LL LEARN ALL ABOUT IT
IN THE MORNING.

1059
00:43:32,667 --> 00:43:35,167
- THOSE ARE ORDERS.
- NOW RUN ALONG,
LITTLE ASTRONAUT.

1060
00:43:35,233 --> 00:43:36,333
ALL RIGHT.

1061
00:43:37,500 --> 00:43:39,233
VENA?

1062
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:43,767
OH, HOW ABOUT A LITTLE
SNACK FOR ME, HUH?

1063
00:43:43,833 --> 00:43:46,000
OH, WINKY, PLEASE,
I'M SAVING MYSELF.

1064
00:43:46,067 --> 00:43:47,767
I'LL GET YOU A SNACK,
YOU FAKER.

1065
00:43:47,833 --> 00:43:49,767
WINKY THINKS IT'S GOOD
TO BOSS AROUND WOMEN.

1066
00:43:49,833 --> 00:43:51,867
HE WANTS TO STAY
IN THE '50s FOREVER.

1067
00:43:51,933 --> 00:43:53,667
I THINK SHE LIKES ME.

1068
00:43:53,733 --> 00:43:56,467
UH, WELL, ROCK,
I'M RARIN' TO GO.

1069
00:43:56,533 --> 00:43:58,567
YOU SHOULD BE AFTER
EIGHT HOURS' SLEEP.

1070
00:43:58,633 --> 00:43:59,733
OH, IT'S THIS AIR.

1071
00:43:59,800 --> 00:44:01,333
IT'S LIKE PARIS IN SPRING.

1072
00:44:01,400 --> 00:44:04,200
YEAH, BUT PARIS WAS DESTROYED
IN THE APOCALYPSE, WINKY.

1073
00:44:04,267 --> 00:44:07,000
HMM, THERE GOES
MY SOCIAL LIFE ON CASSA 7.

1074
00:44:07,067 --> 00:44:08,733
YEAH, THAT'S RIGHT, WINKY,
YOU'RE REAL HOT.

1075
00:44:08,800 --> 00:44:11,800
I SAW YOUR LITTLE BLACK BOOK,
YOU HAD NANCY CULP'S
NUMBER IN THERE.

1076
00:44:13,267 --> 00:44:15,400
- IT WAS GHOSTLY.
- WINKY, VENA SENT THIS TO YOU.

1077
00:44:15,467 --> 00:44:17,000
SHE SAID TO PUT AWAY
THE SUN--

1078
00:44:17,067 --> 00:44:18,400
THAT'S ROCKY'S.

1079
00:44:20,000 --> 00:44:21,333
ROCKY, HAVE YOU COME UP
WITH ANYTHING YET?

1080
00:44:21,400 --> 00:44:22,667
MAYBE.

1081
00:44:22,733 --> 00:44:26,000
IF AN UNFRIENDLY PLANET IS
BEHIND THE ACTS OF PIRACY,

1082
00:44:26,067 --> 00:44:28,133
THEY WOULDN'T OPERATE
FROM THEIR HOME BASE.

1083
00:44:28,200 --> 00:44:29,533
THAT'D BE TOO EASY
TO TRACE.

1084
00:44:29,600 --> 00:44:32,300
AND THE UNITED WORLDS
MIGHT DECLARE OPEN WARFARE.

1085
00:44:32,367 --> 00:44:34,700
THERE ARE FOUR OR FIVE
PLANETOIDS FAR ENOUGH

1086
00:44:34,767 --> 00:44:37,433
- OFF OF REGULAR SPACE LANES.
- OOH, I HAD PLANETOIDS ONCE.

1087
00:44:37,500 --> 00:44:40,067
HAD TO SIT ON ONE OF
THOSE DONUT THINGS.

1088
00:44:40,133 --> 00:44:43,800
I'VE CHECKED THEM ALL,
AND THIS IS THE ONE I'D PICK.

1089
00:44:43,867 --> 00:44:45,267
- [GASPING]
- WHY, SHE'S NUDE.

1090
00:44:45,333 --> 00:44:47,333
- AND NAKED, TOO.
- [PURRS]

1091
00:44:47,400 --> 00:44:50,133
- KNOWN AS THE LONELY MOON.
- YOU SHOULD KNOW, WINKY.

1092
00:44:50,200 --> 00:44:53,300
PRAA IS 20 CELESTIAL DEGREES
FROM ANY LANE OF SPACE TRAVEL.

1093
00:44:53,367 --> 00:44:56,067
YES, BUT ROCKY,
YOU KNOW THE HISTORY OF PRAA.

1094
00:44:56,133 --> 00:44:57,900
NO SPACESHIP HAS EVER
LANDED THERE

1095
00:44:57,967 --> 00:44:59,600
BECAUSE OF SOME
UNKNOWN DEFENSE BARRIER.

1096
00:44:59,667 --> 00:45:01,467
- THAT'S THE HISTORY.
- THREE EARTH SPACESHIPS...

1097
00:45:01,533 --> 00:45:03,700
HEY, COULD I-- I'D REALLY
LIKE TO SAY SOMETHING,

1098
00:45:03,767 --> 00:45:05,667
IF YOU COULD-- OH,
EXCUSE ME A SECOND, I--

1099
00:45:05,733 --> 00:45:07,900
THE ONLY WAY WE WILL EVER
FIND OUT IF PRAA'S BEING USED

1100
00:45:07,967 --> 00:45:10,267
- IS TO GO THERE.
- WELL, HOW DO WE GET
THROUGH THE BARRIER?

1101
00:45:10,333 --> 00:45:12,767
- WE ASK NICE.
- I THINK IT CAN BE MANAGED.

1102
00:45:12,833 --> 00:45:14,367
ARE YOU SURE, ROCKY?

1103
00:45:14,433 --> 00:45:16,400
ALL RIGHT, SO WE
LAND ON PRAA, WHAT THEN?

1104
00:45:16,467 --> 00:45:19,267
YEAH, THEN YOUR GAY NIGHTLIFE
KICKS IN, HUH, WINKY?

1105
00:45:19,333 --> 00:45:21,933
THAT'S THAT. NOTHING
TO DO BUT BLAST OFF.

1106
00:45:22,000 --> 00:45:24,500
I'LL SEND ALONG A COUPLE OF
ARMED ESCORT SHIPS WITH YOU.

1107
00:45:24,567 --> 00:45:26,033
THANKS, PAUL,
BUT WE'RE NOT READY

1108
00:45:26,100 --> 00:45:27,400
FOR ANY FRONTAL ATTACK.

1109
00:45:27,467 --> 00:45:29,067
I DON'T LIKE IT,
ROCKY.

1110
00:45:29,133 --> 00:45:30,833
THERE IS
SOMETHING YOU CAN DO.

1111
00:45:30,900 --> 00:45:32,900
- SET THE TABLE.
- EXPLAIN TO VENA AND BOBBY

1112
00:45:32,967 --> 00:45:35,133
- WHY THEY CAN'T GO ALONG.
- MAKE IT PERSONAL.

1113
00:45:35,200 --> 00:45:37,000
HURT THEIR FEELINGS
IF YOU CAN.

1114
00:45:38,733 --> 00:45:41,267
THE TRICK IS,
WE'LL BE OFF OF CASSA 7

1115
00:45:41,333 --> 00:45:42,733
BEFORE THEY'RE UP
IN THE MORNING.

1116
00:45:42,800 --> 00:45:46,833
- HOW'S THAT FOR EVIL?
- [ALL CACKLING]

1117
00:45:50,067 --> 00:45:52,667
TONIGHT ON "FISHER-PRICE
MEDICAL CENTER."

1118
00:45:54,733 --> 00:45:57,233
[RADIO BUZZING]

1119
00:45:57,300 --> 00:46:01,700
OH, BROTHER, I AM WAY
OVERDRESSED FOR THIS
FIRST DAY AT WORK.

1120
00:46:01,767 --> 00:46:04,200
NO, MR. WINKY
ISN'T IN RIGHT NOW.

1121
00:46:04,267 --> 00:46:06,633
THIS IS RINKMAN
SPEAKING FROM PRAA.

1122
00:46:06,700 --> 00:46:08,867
CALLING CLEOLANTA
ON OPHESIUS.

1123
00:46:08,933 --> 00:46:10,467
THIS IS CLEOLANTA.

1124
00:46:10,533 --> 00:46:12,133
WHAT IS THERE TO REPORT?

1125
00:46:12,200 --> 00:46:16,300
I'VE GOT THE CARGO OF
EARTH'S SPACESHIP CM-7

1126
00:46:16,367 --> 00:46:18,800
- SAFELY STOWED AWAY.
- AND MR. MOONEY, TOO.

1127
00:46:18,867 --> 00:46:20,667
HOLD IT AT PRAA UNTIL
YOU RECEIVE DELIVERY ORDERS.

1128
00:46:20,733 --> 00:46:21,800
[WHISPERS] ASK HER
WHAT SHE'S WEARING.

1129
00:46:21,867 --> 00:46:23,367
IS THERE ANYTHING ELSE,
RINKMAN?

1130
00:46:23,433 --> 00:46:26,467
YES. BREAK DOWN
A LITTLE, CLEOLANTA.

1131
00:46:26,533 --> 00:46:27,967
FORGET YOU'RE THE BOSS
FOR FIVE MINUTES.

1132
00:46:28,033 --> 00:46:29,467
SHE'S GOT A TRIPLE
MENORAH ON HER HEAD.

1133
00:46:29,533 --> 00:46:31,400
- HANUKKAH 3-D.
- DO YOU HAVE ANYTHING
MORE TO REPORT?

1134
00:46:31,467 --> 00:46:34,267
A LITTLE BIT.
I THINK YOU'LL LIKE THIS.

1135
00:46:34,333 --> 00:46:37,600
AFTER WE LEFT THE CM-7
TO ITS LONELY TRAVELS,

1136
00:46:37,667 --> 00:46:40,400
WE PICKED UP ROCKY JONES
ON THE RADAR VEX.

1137
00:46:40,467 --> 00:46:42,767
- NICE GUY.
- AND YOU KEPT RIGHT ON
TO PRAA?

1138
00:46:42,833 --> 00:46:44,300
SURE, WHY NOT?

1139
00:46:44,367 --> 00:46:45,767
SO HE COULD FOLLOW YOU?

1140
00:46:45,833 --> 00:46:46,933
YOU KNOW, SHE SHOULD
PROBABLY FOLLOW

1141
00:46:47,000 --> 00:46:48,700
THE GLAMOUR
10-POINT ACCESSORY RULE.

1142
00:46:48,767 --> 00:46:50,100
I AGREE.

1143
00:46:50,167 --> 00:46:51,267
WHAT DO YOU THINK?

1144
00:46:51,333 --> 00:46:53,600
YES, YES, KEEP TALKING.

1145
00:46:53,667 --> 00:46:55,967
- YES, YES.
- ...ON A DECOY SPACESHIP

1146
00:46:56,033 --> 00:46:59,533
TO BLAST THE ORBIT JET
INTO THE NEXT GALAXY.

1147
00:46:59,600 --> 00:47:02,433
- YOU'VE DISOBEYED MY ORDERS.
- GOOD JOB.

1148
00:47:02,500 --> 00:47:05,067
I WAS THINKING MAINLY
OF SAVING MY OWN NECK.

1149
00:47:05,133 --> 00:47:07,800
REMAIN ON PRAA
FOR FURTHER ORDERS.

1150
00:47:07,867 --> 00:47:09,333
OUT.

1151
00:47:09,400 --> 00:47:11,467
INSUBORDINATES.
[SCOFFS]

1152
00:47:11,533 --> 00:47:13,900
- YOU KNOW SOMETHING, DOC?
- I THINK SHE'S HOT.

1153
00:47:13,967 --> 00:47:16,300
SOMETIMES I THINK
SHE'D RATHER SEE US DEAD
THAN ROCKY JONES.

1154
00:47:16,367 --> 00:47:19,300
[LAUGHING]
OH, IT WASN'T A JOKE.

1155
00:47:19,367 --> 00:47:21,033
ATLASAN.

1156
00:47:21,100 --> 00:47:22,933
- AMPERSAND?
- ATLASAN!

1157
00:47:23,000 --> 00:47:26,067
- DID YOU CALL ME, CLEOLANTA?
- AAH! DON'T DO THAT, RADAR!

1158
00:47:26,133 --> 00:47:28,500
RINKMAN AND DR. VANKO
ARE ON PRAA.

1159
00:47:28,567 --> 00:47:31,167
EXCELLENT. THEN WE'LL HAVE
MORE VALUABLE MERCHANDISE

1160
00:47:31,233 --> 00:47:33,267
TO SELL
TO OUR ALLY PLANETS.

1161
00:47:33,333 --> 00:47:35,600
RINKMAN AND DR. VANKO

1162
00:47:35,667 --> 00:47:37,167
ARE TO BE EXECUTED.

1163
00:47:37,233 --> 00:47:39,933
EXECUTED?
WHAT HAVE THEY DONE?

1164
00:47:40,000 --> 00:47:41,933
THEY'VE DISOBEYED
MY ORDERS.

1165
00:47:42,000 --> 00:47:43,067
OH, WELL, THAT-- HMM?

1166
00:47:43,133 --> 00:47:45,500
I SHALL SEE THAT
YOUR ORDERS ARE CARRIED OUT.

1167
00:47:45,567 --> 00:47:47,300
THEN DO IT.

1168
00:47:47,367 --> 00:47:49,667
- JUST DO IT.
- CLEOLANTA...

1169
00:47:49,733 --> 00:47:52,467
IT'S TOO BAD THAT
WE CAN'T GET ROCKY JONES
TO TAKE THEIR PLACE.

1170
00:47:52,533 --> 00:47:54,200
WELL, IT'S TOO BAD YOU'RE
NOT IN A GOPHER SUIT.

1171
00:47:54,267 --> 00:47:57,367
- WHAT'S YOUR POINT?
- GET OUT.

1172
00:47:57,433 --> 00:47:58,600
GET OUT!

1173
00:47:58,667 --> 00:48:01,067
OH, SHE THREW WINKY'S
BLACK BOOK AT HIM.

1174
00:48:04,933 --> 00:48:06,933
OH, SHE'S ANGRY
WHEN SHE'S BEAUTIFUL.

1175
00:48:07,000 --> 00:48:09,800
- MM-HMM.
- I SHOULDN'T LET
MY EXECUTIONERS GET TO ME.

1176
00:48:12,800 --> 00:48:17,400
♪ I KEEP WORKING MY WAY
BACK TO YOU, BABE ♪

1177
00:48:20,067 --> 00:48:21,867
HEY, FOLKS, IT'S
THE BREAKFAST FLAKES

1178
00:48:21,933 --> 00:48:23,933
WITH YOU IN THE A.M.
AND TODAY'S CRAZY CALL'S

1179
00:48:24,000 --> 00:48:25,467
GOING OUT TO MARS.

1180
00:48:29,267 --> 00:48:31,400
HEY, DON'T USE THAT
INDISCRIMINATELY!

1181
00:48:31,467 --> 00:48:33,133
[HUMMING]

1182
00:48:34,767 --> 00:48:36,133
OH, WINKY.

1183
00:48:39,000 --> 00:48:40,900
WE'RE APPROACHING PRAA'S
GRAVITY FIELD, ROCK.

1184
00:48:40,967 --> 00:48:43,000
YES, YOU CAN SEE
PRAA NOW ON VISIOGRAPH.

1185
00:48:43,067 --> 00:48:45,200
WELL, WHAT ARE WE GONNA DO
ABOUT THAT DEFENSE BARRIER?

1186
00:48:45,267 --> 00:48:46,200
YOU KNOW, WINKY,

1187
00:48:46,267 --> 00:48:47,867
WHAT YOU CAN'T SEE
YOU CAN'T HIT.

1188
00:48:47,933 --> 00:48:49,500
DOES THAT MEAN
YOU'RE GONNA HIT ME?

1189
00:48:49,567 --> 00:48:51,500
BUT WHAT ARE WE GONNA DO
ABOUT THAT DEFENSE BARRIER?

1190
00:48:51,567 --> 00:48:53,000
- OH, UH, HAD THAT COMING.
- I'VE BEEN HOLDING OUT ON YOU

1191
00:48:53,067 --> 00:48:55,300
UNTIL NOW, WINKY, BECAUSE
I PROMISED PROFESSOR NEWTON.

1192
00:48:55,367 --> 00:48:57,100
I KNOW WHAT YOU MEAN,
THE COLD LIGHT.

1193
00:48:57,167 --> 00:48:59,200
I NEVER COULD
GET YOU TO TALK ABOUT IT.

1194
00:48:59,267 --> 00:49:02,300
PROFESSOR NEWTON ASKED ME
NOT TO USE IT UNTIL WE HAD TO.

1195
00:49:02,367 --> 00:49:03,733
HE'S KEPT IT SO HUSH-HUSH

1196
00:49:03,800 --> 00:49:06,100
THAT MOST PEOPLE DON'T
EVEN KNOW IT EXISTS.

1197
00:49:06,167 --> 00:49:07,300
I'LL HAVE TO
BRIEF YOU ON IT.

1198
00:49:07,367 --> 00:49:08,700
- RIGHT.
- IT'S CALLED A SNUGGIE.

1199
00:49:08,767 --> 00:49:10,600
- TURN AROUND.
- IT'S ACTIVATED BY THIS SWITCH.

1200
00:49:10,667 --> 00:49:12,167
THE FILAMENT
IN THE VACUUM TUBE

1201
00:49:12,233 --> 00:49:13,667
IS QUICKLY BROUGHT
TO A TEMPERATURE

1202
00:49:13,733 --> 00:49:16,933
OF ABOUT -243 DEGREES
CENTIGRADE.

1203
00:49:17,000 --> 00:49:18,800
UH, WHAT WAS
THE MIDDLE PART AGAIN?

1204
00:49:18,867 --> 00:49:20,000
...BY ALL THAT COLD.

1205
00:49:20,067 --> 00:49:22,233
WELL, PROFESSOR NEWTON
EXPLAINED IT THIS WAY:

1206
00:49:22,300 --> 00:49:24,300
- HEAT CAN AFFECT LIGHT WAVES...
- BLAH-BLAH BLAH-BLAH

1207
00:49:24,367 --> 00:49:26,900
BLAH-BLAH-BLAH, THAT
ARE IMAGES, BLAH-BLAH-BLAH.

1208
00:49:26,967 --> 00:49:28,067
...CAN BE SEEN BY
THE HUMAN EYE.

1209
00:49:28,133 --> 00:49:30,267
SEEN BY BLAH-BLAH-BLAH,
BLAH-BLAH-BLAH MIRAGE,

1210
00:49:30,333 --> 00:49:32,733
- BLAH-BLAH-BLAH BLAH-BLAH.
- SURE, I'VE SEEN THEM
ON THE SAHARA.

1211
00:49:32,800 --> 00:49:35,433
- NOW INTENSE COLD CAN
HAVE THE OPPOSITE EFFECT.
- BLAH-BLAH COLD BLAH-BLAH.

1212
00:49:35,500 --> 00:49:37,800
BLOT OUT IMAGES THAT ARE
ACTUALLY THERE.

1213
00:49:37,867 --> 00:49:40,067
I'M SORRY,
I WASN'T LISTENING.

1214
00:49:40,133 --> 00:49:42,433
THE RAYS SENT OUT BY
THE TERRIFICALLY COLD LIGHT

1215
00:49:42,500 --> 00:49:44,733
WILL MAKE THE ORBIT JET
INVISIBLE.

1216
00:49:44,800 --> 00:49:47,267
WELL, HOW CAN WE FLY
A SHIP WE CAN'T SEE?

1217
00:49:47,333 --> 00:49:49,867
THE COLD LIGHT
WILL SURROUND THE SHIP.

1218
00:49:49,933 --> 00:49:51,333
- [SCOFFS] YOU IDIOT.
- WE'LL BE ABLE TO SEE

1219
00:49:51,400 --> 00:49:53,000
EVERYTHING NORMALLY
HERE IN THE CABINS,

1220
00:49:53,067 --> 00:49:55,300
BUT NO ONE WILL BE
ABLE TO SEE US.

1221
00:49:55,367 --> 00:49:57,867
WELL, IF THAT CAN'T GET US
THROUGH ANY DEFENSE BARRIER,

1222
00:49:57,933 --> 00:49:59,267
NOTHING CAN.

1223
00:49:59,333 --> 00:50:00,733
OH, JUST ONE POINT, WINKY.

1224
00:50:00,800 --> 00:50:02,600
- SHUT UP.
- WE HAVE TO FIGHT TIME.

1225
00:50:02,667 --> 00:50:04,900
WE DON'T KNOW HOW LONG
THE COLD LAMP WILL OPERATE,

1226
00:50:04,967 --> 00:50:06,900
SO STAND BY
TO SWITCH IT OFF, HUH?

1227
00:50:06,967 --> 00:50:08,267
- RIGHT, SIR.
- OKAY.

1228
00:50:15,367 --> 00:50:18,500
HEY, IT'S A UNIVERSAL FILM.

1229
00:50:18,567 --> 00:50:20,167
WE'RE ENTERING PRAA'S
GRAVITY FIELD.

1230
00:50:20,233 --> 00:50:21,900
SWITCH IT ON, WINKY.

1231
00:50:21,967 --> 00:50:23,200
OKAY.

1232
00:50:23,267 --> 00:50:25,167
- [BEEPING]
- THERE, YOU SEE?
I DID IT, ROCKY.

1233
00:50:25,233 --> 00:50:26,533
I DID IT, I SWITCHED IT ON,
HOW DID I DO?

1234
00:50:26,600 --> 00:50:27,833
DID I DO WELL?
I SWITCHED IT ON, I DID IT.

1235
00:50:27,900 --> 00:50:29,700
I DID IT. DID YOU SEE THAT?
I SWITCHED IT ON.

1236
00:50:29,767 --> 00:50:31,300
I CAN DO IT,
I CAN DO IT, AND I DID IT.

1237
00:50:36,633 --> 00:50:38,800
- COOL.
- HOW DO YOU KNOW IF
THE SHIP'S INVISIBLE?

1238
00:50:38,867 --> 00:50:40,833
WILL I FEEL INVISIBLE?

1239
00:50:40,900 --> 00:50:42,167
BUT IF SOMETHING HITS US,

1240
00:50:42,233 --> 00:50:44,600
WE'LL KNOW THE COLD LIGHT
DIDN'T WORK.

1241
00:50:44,667 --> 00:50:46,567
[CHUCKLES] THAT'S
FINDING OUT THE HARD WAY.

1242
00:50:46,633 --> 00:50:48,200
YOU DON'T KNOW THE HALF
OF IT, LITTLE GUY.

1243
00:50:48,267 --> 00:50:51,200
BOY, THAT'S A RUGGED PLACE.

1244
00:50:51,267 --> 00:50:54,200
- IT'S A VAN GOGH.
- VAN GAAH.

1245
00:50:54,267 --> 00:50:55,667
ACTIVATE THE GYRO.

1246
00:50:55,733 --> 00:50:58,400
NO, IT'S PRONOUNCED "EE-RO".

1247
00:50:58,467 --> 00:51:00,467
- ACTIVATED, SIR.
- SECURE FOR LANDING.

1248
00:51:00,533 --> 00:51:03,000
PLEASE PUT YOUR SEATS IN THEIR
LOCKED, UPRIGHT POSITION.

1249
00:51:03,067 --> 00:51:05,333
BUT EVEN IF WE CAN SPOT
A PLACE IN THAT ROCKY TERRAIN

1250
00:51:05,400 --> 00:51:06,933
THE ORBIT JET WON'T
STAND ON ITS TAIL.

1251
00:51:07,000 --> 00:51:08,567
- DON'T START WITH ME, WINKY.
- WE'RE GOING TO GO

1252
00:51:08,633 --> 00:51:10,933
RIGHT INTO ONE OF
THEIR LANDING PLATFORMS.

1253
00:51:12,567 --> 00:51:14,400
WELL, SOMEBODY'S
GONNA BE SURPRISED.

1254
00:51:14,467 --> 00:51:16,400
- [GOOFY CHUCKLE]
- I HOPE IT ISN'T US.

1255
00:51:16,467 --> 00:51:17,567
D'OH!

1256
00:51:17,633 --> 00:51:20,300
YOU HEAR AN INVISIBLE
SHIP JUST NOW?

1257
00:51:20,367 --> 00:51:21,567
DID THEY HAVE
A SIGNAL FOR A LANDING?

1258
00:51:21,633 --> 00:51:24,333
WHO COULD POSSIBLY
LAND ON PRAA?

1259
00:51:24,400 --> 00:51:26,033
- MARKOV! MARKOV!
- POLO. POLO!

1260
00:51:26,100 --> 00:51:28,767
- MARKOV HERE.
- WHO'S MAKING A LANDING?

1261
00:51:28,833 --> 00:51:31,333
NOTHING'S COMING INTO
THE LANDING PLATFORMS.

1262
00:51:31,400 --> 00:51:33,667
- ARE YOU BLIND?
- YES, SIR, WHY DO YOU ASK?

1263
00:51:33,733 --> 00:51:35,000
LET'S HAVE A LOOK, DOC.

1264
00:51:36,400 --> 00:51:38,333
SOUNDS LIKE A BLIMP.

1265
00:51:38,400 --> 00:51:39,933
[BEEPING]

1266
00:51:40,000 --> 00:51:41,533
KEEP
THE VISIOGRAPH ON, WINKY.

1267
00:51:41,600 --> 00:51:42,867
YOU'LL HAVE TO COVER ME.

1268
00:51:42,933 --> 00:51:44,633
IF THEY START ANYTHING,
BLAST 'EM.

1269
00:51:44,700 --> 00:51:46,633
I'LL KEEP MY
TRIGGER FINGER READY.

1270
00:51:46,700 --> 00:51:48,400
YOU'LL BE ABLE TO
SEE ME MATERIALIZE

1271
00:51:48,467 --> 00:51:50,067
OUT OF THE SHIP'S
INVISIBILITY BLANKET.

1272
00:51:50,133 --> 00:51:51,467
- I'LL BE BUCK NAKED.
- BOY, THEY'RE GONNA BE

1273
00:51:51,533 --> 00:51:53,200
EVEN MORE SURPRISED
THAN THEY ARE NOW.

1274
00:51:53,267 --> 00:51:56,100
UNDERNEATH THOSE CLOTHES
HE'S AS SMOOTH AS A KEN DOLL.

1275
00:51:56,167 --> 00:51:57,133
RIGHT.

1276
00:51:59,867 --> 00:52:01,933
OH, GOOD,
NOW I CAN SCREW OFF.

1277
00:52:03,433 --> 00:52:05,733
THE LAVISH NEW ORCHESTRA.

1278
00:52:05,800 --> 00:52:08,333
YOU COULD SEE NO SPACESHIP
HAS LANDED HERE.

1279
00:52:08,400 --> 00:52:11,267
IT MUST HAVE LANDED,
WE HEARD THE ROCKETS.

1280
00:52:11,333 --> 00:52:12,733
MAYBE WE'RE ALL BLIND.

1281
00:52:12,800 --> 00:52:14,267
WHAT DO YOU THINK, DOC?
YOU HEARD IT.

1282
00:52:14,333 --> 00:52:16,133
I DON'T WANT TO GET INVOLVED.

1283
00:52:16,200 --> 00:52:18,533
I DON'T KNOW,
IT'S FANTASTIC.

1284
00:52:18,600 --> 00:52:20,900
[BEEPING]

1285
00:52:22,333 --> 00:52:24,733
WE'RE BEING PAID TO KNOW
ABOUT THESE THINGS, VANKO.

1286
00:52:24,800 --> 00:52:26,600
DID A SPACESHIP LAND
OR DIDN'T IT?

1287
00:52:26,667 --> 00:52:30,033
- THIS THING IS ALL BEYOND--
- [STAMMERING] UH,
SORT OF, I THINK.

1288
00:52:30,100 --> 00:52:31,467
YOU'RE GONNA HAVE
TO KEEP UP TO DATE, DOC...

1289
00:52:31,533 --> 00:52:33,067
- UM, MAYBE.
- OR YOU'LL BE DROPPED
BACK TO EARTH

1290
00:52:33,133 --> 00:52:34,833
AND WIND UP ON
THE EXILE PLANET.

1291
00:52:34,900 --> 00:52:37,633
LOOK,
THERE IS YOUR ANSWER.

1292
00:52:37,700 --> 00:52:39,700
HI, I'M YOUR ANSWER.

1293
00:52:39,767 --> 00:52:41,633
YOU EXPECTING SOMEONE,
RINKMAN?

1294
00:52:41,700 --> 00:52:43,667
NOBODY EXPECTS
THE SPANISH INQUISITION!

1295
00:52:43,733 --> 00:52:46,800
YOU HAVE DISCOVERED THE LIGHT
VIBRATION OF INVISIBILITY.

1296
00:52:46,867 --> 00:52:49,700
IT'S FRIENDLY OF YOU TO BRING
THIS NEW DISCOVERY TO US.

1297
00:52:49,767 --> 00:52:52,467
HE'S GOT YUMMY ICING
ON HIS COLLAR. MMM!

1298
00:52:52,533 --> 00:52:54,233
I'M HERE WITH A WARNING.

1299
00:52:54,300 --> 00:52:57,133
DON'T EAT REFROZEN
ICE CREAM.

1300
00:52:58,533 --> 00:53:00,700
THERE'S THE ORBIT JET,
TAKE MY WORD FOR IT.

1301
00:53:00,767 --> 00:53:02,467
THERE'S A GUN ON IT
READY TO BLAST YOU

1302
00:53:02,533 --> 00:53:04,100
IF YOU MAKE ONE FALSE MOVE.

1303
00:53:04,167 --> 00:53:07,267
- I LIKE PANCAKES-- HUH?
- I'LL MAKE IT BRIEF, RINKMAN.

1304
00:53:07,333 --> 00:53:10,067
STOP PIRATING THE SPACESHIPS
OF THE UNITED WORLDS,

1305
00:53:10,133 --> 00:53:12,333
OR PRAA WILL BE
BLOWN OUT OF EXISTENCE.

1306
00:53:13,767 --> 00:53:16,033
THAT'S BIG TALK, ROCKY.

1307
00:53:16,100 --> 00:53:17,433
MANNIX, NO!

1308
00:53:17,500 --> 00:53:20,500
[HUMMING "MANNIX"
FIGHT MUSIC]

1309
00:53:20,567 --> 00:53:22,367
UH, WINKY, WINKY!

1310
00:53:22,433 --> 00:53:24,500
OH, FOR CRYING OUT LOUD,
WINKY, I COULD USE
A LITTLE HELP!

1311
00:53:24,567 --> 00:53:26,767
HELP HERE, WINKY--
OH, WINKY!

1312
00:53:26,833 --> 00:53:29,033
HEY, WINK--
[GROANING] WINKY.

1313
00:53:30,667 --> 00:53:31,600
WINKY?

1314
00:53:31,667 --> 00:53:32,900
I DIDN'T THINK
THE ORBIT JET

1315
00:53:32,967 --> 00:53:34,433
WOULD FIRE ON YOU
TO GET OUT.

1316
00:53:34,500 --> 00:53:36,733
HE'S GOT SOME
SMOOTH PANTS ON.

1317
00:53:36,800 --> 00:53:38,033
WE'LL TAKE THAT CHANCE.

1318
00:53:38,100 --> 00:53:40,033
GET HIM TO THE CAVES.

1319
00:53:40,100 --> 00:53:42,367
♪ FOR HE'S A JOLLY
GOOD FELLOW ♪

1320
00:53:42,433 --> 00:53:44,000
♪ FOR HE'S
A JOLLY GOOD FELLOW ♪

1321
00:53:44,067 --> 00:53:45,667
♪ FOR HE'S A JOLLY
GOOD FELLOW... ♪

1322
00:53:45,733 --> 00:53:47,900
OH, I KNOW THIS IS
COMING UP IN MY REVIEW.

1323
00:53:47,967 --> 00:53:50,033
[GROANS]

1324
00:53:50,100 --> 00:53:51,500
YOU KNOW, THEY REALLY
DIDN'T THINK THROUGH

1325
00:53:51,567 --> 00:53:53,600
THE INVASION OF THIS PLANET
TOO WELL, DID THEY?

1326
00:53:55,367 --> 00:53:57,167
- CLEOLANTA...
- YES?

1327
00:53:57,233 --> 00:53:58,967
THIS IS RINKMAN
ON PRAA...

1328
00:53:59,033 --> 00:54:00,333
I'M UNDER
YOUR DESK, ACTUALLY.

1329
00:54:00,400 --> 00:54:02,033
PROCEED WITH YOUR REPORT.

1330
00:54:02,100 --> 00:54:04,233
THERE'S BEEN A SLIGHT
CHANGE IN OUR PLANS...

1331
00:54:04,300 --> 00:54:06,100
HE'S HOLDING A BOTTLE
OF PIERRE CARDIN.

1332
00:54:06,167 --> 00:54:07,500
HMM, AND
HIS KNEE'S ON FIRE.

1333
00:54:07,567 --> 00:54:09,300
WHY WASN'T IT
REPORTED EARLIER?

1334
00:54:09,367 --> 00:54:11,100
BECAUSE I DIDN'T
DISCOVER THE CHANGE

1335
00:54:11,167 --> 00:54:14,000
- UNTIL ROCKY JONES
LANDED ON PRAA.
- [COUGHING]

1336
00:54:14,067 --> 00:54:15,633
- THANK YOU.
- THAT'S IMPOSSIBLE.

1337
00:54:15,700 --> 00:54:18,333
NO SPACESHIP CAN GET THROUGH
THE DEFENSE BARRIER.

1338
00:54:18,400 --> 00:54:20,933
ROCKY JONES HAS
DISCOVERED A NEW TRICK.

1339
00:54:21,000 --> 00:54:22,300
HE'S HERE.

1340
00:54:22,367 --> 00:54:24,467
- WHAT IS HE UP TO?
- WELL, PUT HIM ON.

1341
00:54:24,533 --> 00:54:26,733
NOTHING MUCH, AS LONG
AS I HAVE HIM LOCKED UP

1342
00:54:26,800 --> 00:54:28,467
IN ONE OF THE CAVES.

1343
00:54:28,533 --> 00:54:29,833
KEEP HIM UNDER GUARD.

1344
00:54:29,900 --> 00:54:32,400
YOU'LL GET FURTHER ORDERS.
OUT.

1345
00:54:32,467 --> 00:54:35,300
MMM, LET'S SEE, I CAN WEAR
A CAMISOLE AND A BLAZER.

1346
00:54:35,367 --> 00:54:36,833
NO, THAT WOULDN'T
BE RIGHT EITHER.

1347
00:54:36,900 --> 00:54:39,267
- UH...
- UM, HELLO.

1348
00:54:39,333 --> 00:54:40,767
NO, HI. HI.

1349
00:54:40,833 --> 00:54:42,400
I'M MYLANTA--
NO, NO.

1350
00:54:42,467 --> 00:54:43,633
MR. JONES, I PRESUME.

1351
00:54:43,700 --> 00:54:45,400
- NO, HOW ABOUT--
- WELL, ATLASAN?

1352
00:54:45,467 --> 00:54:47,567
YES, EXCLAMATION?

1353
00:54:47,633 --> 00:54:50,100
...TO HANDLE THE EXECUTION
OF RINKMAN AND DR. VANKO.

1354
00:54:50,167 --> 00:54:52,200
- ROSENCRANTZ AND GUILDENSTERN.
- CANCEL YOUR ORDERS.

1355
00:54:52,267 --> 00:54:53,667
BUT CLEOLANTA,
THAT WAS YOUR COMMAND.

1356
00:54:53,733 --> 00:54:56,333
- I WENT TO A LOT OF TROUBLE.
- I SAID CANCEL YOUR ORDERS.

1357
00:54:56,400 --> 00:54:58,200
WHAT'S THE MATTER,
DID THEY REDEEM THEMSELVES?

1358
00:54:58,267 --> 00:54:59,900
- FOR VALUABLE PRIZES?
- I WILL GO TO PRAA

1359
00:54:59,967 --> 00:55:01,667
AND DECIDE IF THEY
ARE TO BE PARDONED.

1360
00:55:01,733 --> 00:55:03,100
PRAA IS A BARREN PLANET,

1361
00:55:03,167 --> 00:55:04,833
A LAND OF ROCK
AND GRANITE MOUNTAINS.

1362
00:55:04,900 --> 00:55:05,900
IT'S NO PLACE
FOR A WOMAN.

1363
00:55:05,967 --> 00:55:06,933
DON'T SAY BARREN TO ME.

1364
00:55:07,000 --> 00:55:08,533
HAVE MY SPACESHIP
MADE READY.

1365
00:55:08,600 --> 00:55:10,267
YOU WILL SERVE AS PILOT.

1366
00:55:10,333 --> 00:55:12,400
IF THAT IS
WHAT YOU WISH.

1367
00:55:12,467 --> 00:55:14,067
IT IS WHAT I COMMAND.

1368
00:55:14,133 --> 00:55:16,300
AND WE KNOW WHAT KIND
OF WEIGHT THAT CARRIES.

1369
00:55:18,400 --> 00:55:21,333
OH, NOW MY TUMMY'S
UPSET. [GROANS]

1370
00:55:21,400 --> 00:55:23,000
OH, WELL,
I'LL HAVE TO WEAR FLATS

1371
00:55:23,067 --> 00:55:24,600
IF I'M GONNA DRIVE
A SPACESHIP.

1372
00:55:24,667 --> 00:55:26,033
I'LL PROBABLY GET
HIS NAME WRONG,

1373
00:55:26,100 --> 00:55:28,800
I'LL CALL HIM SANDY JONES
OR RUSTY JONES.

1374
00:55:30,433 --> 00:55:31,633
UH, YOU KNOW WHAT?

1375
00:55:31,700 --> 00:55:33,867
I SHOULD HAVE KNOWN WITH
A GUY LIKE WINKY, YOU KNOW?

1376
00:55:33,933 --> 00:55:36,100
YEAH, THE GUY'S NOT EVEN
GOOD FOR BALLAST,

1377
00:55:36,167 --> 00:55:39,333
YOU KNOW, LOOKING AT BOBBY
ALL FUNNY, ALL...

1378
00:55:41,200 --> 00:55:42,267
WHO WANTS GUM ANYWAY?

1379
00:55:42,333 --> 00:55:44,867
OH, I LOVE TO
DO THAT TO MYSELF.

1380
00:55:44,933 --> 00:55:46,867
GOOD THING THEY DIDN'T
FRISK HIM.

1381
00:55:46,933 --> 00:55:48,267
WINKY?

1382
00:55:48,333 --> 00:55:50,100
WINKY, AM I
GETTING THROUGH?

1383
00:55:50,167 --> 00:55:52,367
YOU'RE COMING IN CLEAR,
ROCKY.

1384
00:55:52,433 --> 00:55:54,700
I'M BEING HELD IN A CAVE
IN ONE OF THE MOUNTAINS.

1385
00:55:54,767 --> 00:55:56,300
- I'LL FIND IT.
- [BEEPING]

1386
00:55:56,367 --> 00:55:58,333
- I CAN'T FIND IT.
- I DON'T KNOW HOW MUCH
COLD LIGHT WE HAVE LEFT.

1387
00:55:58,400 --> 00:56:00,067
YOU ARE NOT TO LEAVE
THE ORBIT JET.

1388
00:56:00,133 --> 00:56:01,667
I'LL HAVE TO FIND
A WAY TO GET CLEAR,

1389
00:56:01,733 --> 00:56:04,567
SO KEEP THE SHIP READY
FOR BLASTOFF AT ANY TIME.

1390
00:56:04,633 --> 00:56:07,767
WILL DO, BUT I FEEL LIKE
A LUNKHEAD JUST SITTING HERE.

1391
00:56:07,833 --> 00:56:10,067
- HOLD THAT THOUGHT, WINKY.
- YOUR JOB IS TO KEEP
THE ORBIT JET INVISIBLE

1392
00:56:10,133 --> 00:56:12,833
JUST AS LONG AS
THE COLD LIGHT HOLDS OUT.

1393
00:56:12,900 --> 00:56:14,167
- [FOOTSTEPS]
- STAND BY.

1394
00:56:17,200 --> 00:56:18,667
OH, HI, YOU MUST BE ROCKY.

1395
00:56:18,733 --> 00:56:20,733
I'M SUPPOSED TO TAKE
YOUR DINNER ORDER.

1396
00:56:22,100 --> 00:56:24,300
RODIN'S "THE THINKER."

1397
00:56:24,367 --> 00:56:25,533
TWO OF THEM.

1398
00:56:25,600 --> 00:56:28,000
ROCKY, SUPPOSE
WE MAKE A DEAL.

1399
00:56:28,067 --> 00:56:30,633
I'LL GIVE YOU $50 IF YOU HAVE
A HARD-BOILED EGG IN YOUR PURSE.

1400
00:56:30,700 --> 00:56:33,600
YOU'VE GOT SOMETHING GOOD IN
THAT SECRET OF INVISIBILITY.

1401
00:56:33,667 --> 00:56:36,100
- RALPH ELLISON WANTS YOU.
- I THINK SO.

1402
00:56:36,167 --> 00:56:38,233
I COULD GET YOU
OFF PRAA ALIVE...

1403
00:56:38,300 --> 00:56:40,267
- PRAA...
- ...IN EXCHANGE
FOR THAT SECRET.

1404
00:56:40,333 --> 00:56:43,467
YOU'RE WASTING YOUR TIME.

1405
00:56:43,533 --> 00:56:45,967
I'LL PUT IT THIS WAY:
COME IN WITH ME.

1406
00:56:46,033 --> 00:56:48,100
JOIN ME, ROCKY,
WE CAN RULE THE WORLD.

1407
00:56:48,167 --> 00:56:51,067
YOU MEAN
AS A SPACE PIRATE?

1408
00:56:51,133 --> 00:56:53,633
- IT PAYS OFF.
- PLUS BENEFITS.

1409
00:56:53,700 --> 00:56:54,967
WORKING OUT OF
AN INVISIBLE SPACESHIP,

1410
00:56:55,033 --> 00:56:57,267
WE'D HAVE THE SOLAR SYSTEM
BY THE TAIL.

1411
00:56:57,333 --> 00:56:58,900
OH, GREAT-- HUH?

1412
00:56:58,967 --> 00:57:01,167
HOW ABOUT THE PEOPLE
YOU'RE TAKING ORDERS FROM?

1413
00:57:01,233 --> 00:57:02,800
WE WON'T BE NEEDING THEM.

1414
00:57:02,867 --> 00:57:05,100
- WE CAN BRUSH THEM OFF.
- LIKE DANDRUFF.

1415
00:57:05,167 --> 00:57:07,067
YES, BUT I DON'T KNOW
WHO YOU'RE WORKING FOR.

1416
00:57:07,133 --> 00:57:09,600
- YOU'D LIKE TO KNOW...
- WINKY, QUIT EAVESDROPPING.

1417
00:57:09,667 --> 00:57:11,200
GET OFF THE LINE!

1418
00:57:11,267 --> 00:57:12,500
[ROCKY]
ALL RIGHT.

1419
00:57:12,567 --> 00:57:14,767
WELL, ROCKY, IS IT A DEAL,

1420
00:57:14,833 --> 00:57:17,033
OR DO YOU ROT IT OUT
IN THIS CAVE?

1421
00:57:17,100 --> 00:57:19,500
- OH, THAT'S THE OPTION?
- MMM.

1422
00:57:21,733 --> 00:57:23,133
WHAT'LL IT BE, ROCKY?

1423
00:57:23,200 --> 00:57:24,800
UH, I'LL TAKE
THE SURF AND TURF.

1424
00:57:24,867 --> 00:57:26,900
- I'M ON VACATION.
- KEEP HIM COVERED, WINKY.

1425
00:57:26,967 --> 00:57:28,900
[WINKY]
I GOT HIM COVERED, ROCKY.

1426
00:57:28,967 --> 00:57:31,233
YOU LET A GUY NAMED WINKY
FOOL YOU?

1427
00:57:35,567 --> 00:57:36,500
OOH!

1428
00:57:41,800 --> 00:57:43,133
WENDY, HONEY,

1429
00:57:43,200 --> 00:57:45,433
I THINK YOU HURT ME
REAL BAD.

1430
00:57:45,500 --> 00:57:48,033
OH, UH, HI, MY GUN,
AND, UH-- OH.

1431
00:57:48,100 --> 00:57:49,033
HUH?

1432
00:57:55,200 --> 00:57:56,600
[IMITATES POPEYE]
WHAT A REVOLTIN' DEVELOPMENT.

1433
00:57:56,667 --> 00:57:58,800
LIKE A HOUSE OF ILL REPUTE.
[CHUCKLES]

1434
00:57:58,867 --> 00:58:00,900
HEY, HE MOVED
THE ENTIRE CAVE WALL.

1435
00:58:00,967 --> 00:58:01,900
WOW.

1436
00:58:03,567 --> 00:58:06,100
COME IN. COME IN!

1437
00:58:06,167 --> 00:58:07,100
[GROANS]

1438
00:58:10,333 --> 00:58:11,467
THANK YOU.

1439
00:58:13,467 --> 00:58:14,933
RINKMAN'S BEEN GONE
A LONG TIME.

1440
00:58:15,000 --> 00:58:17,633
- NICE BOOGER COLLECTION.
- AH.

1441
00:58:17,700 --> 00:58:19,833
- AH, YEAH.
- MM-HMM.

1442
00:58:19,900 --> 00:58:23,767
- ROCKY'S A SHARP CHARACTER.
- HE INSISTED.

1443
00:58:23,833 --> 00:58:25,300
I'M GOING TO SEE
WHAT'S GOING ON.

1444
00:58:25,367 --> 00:58:27,400
OKAY.

1445
00:58:27,467 --> 00:58:29,333
BACK UP!
DON'T TRY ANYTHING.

1446
00:58:29,400 --> 00:58:30,833
GO ON.
DR. VANKO...

1447
00:58:30,900 --> 00:58:32,600
PUT YOUR HANDS IN THE AIR
AND KEEP 'EM THERE.

1448
00:58:32,667 --> 00:58:33,733
NOW DANCE.

1449
00:58:33,800 --> 00:58:35,733
GO ON, GET OVER TO
THE SIDE OF DR. VANKO.

1450
00:58:35,800 --> 00:58:37,600
NOW, YOU, GIVE HIM
A BACK RUB.

1451
00:58:37,667 --> 00:58:39,467
OOH.

1452
00:58:39,533 --> 00:58:43,133
NOW DON'T EITHER ONE OF YOU
TRY A THING.

1453
00:58:43,200 --> 00:58:45,367
WINKY. COME IN, WINKY.

1454
00:58:45,433 --> 00:58:48,067
GO AHEAD, ROCKY.
NOT MUCH TIME LEFT.

1455
00:58:48,133 --> 00:58:49,800
OPEN THE AIR LOCK HATCH.

1456
00:58:49,867 --> 00:58:52,367
SORRY, I'M AFRAID
I CAN'T DO THAT, DAVE.

1457
00:58:52,433 --> 00:58:54,600
- I'M ON MY WAY.
- ROCKETS WILL BE ROARIN'.

1458
00:58:54,667 --> 00:58:56,400
AND THE SPACESHIP
WILL BE READY, TOO.

1459
00:59:04,333 --> 00:59:06,900
WELL, I HAD A GREAT TIME
AND ENJOYED THE CANAPÉS.

1460
00:59:06,967 --> 00:59:08,133
UH, SAY HELLO TO THE WIFE.

1461
00:59:08,200 --> 00:59:10,467
HOPE YOU DON'T MIND IF
I JUST KIND OF... LEAVE!

1462
00:59:11,700 --> 00:59:14,067
OH, THEY GOT FLINTSTONE
FURNITURE, CHECK IT OUT.

1463
00:59:18,633 --> 00:59:20,933
AH, ROCKY
BLEW IT AGAIN.

1464
00:59:21,000 --> 00:59:22,367
YEAH, WHAT WAS HIS MISSION?

1465
00:59:22,433 --> 00:59:23,667
GO IN THERE, GET CAUGHT
AND ESCAPE?

1466
00:59:23,733 --> 00:59:25,467
[CHUCKLES]

1467
00:59:27,267 --> 00:59:28,800
OOH-- OH.

1468
00:59:28,867 --> 00:59:32,333
[ROCKETS WHOOSHING]

1469
00:59:32,400 --> 00:59:33,733
LOOK AT HER GO.

1470
00:59:37,200 --> 00:59:39,200
WELL, HI, ROCKY,
WHERE HAVE YOU BEEN?

1471
00:59:39,267 --> 00:59:41,267
BLASTOFF PERFECT, WINKY.

1472
00:59:41,333 --> 00:59:43,100
YOU HAD YOURSELF
QUITE A TIME.

1473
00:59:43,167 --> 00:59:45,633
YES, BUT I DIDN'T
QUITE COMPLETE THE JOB.

1474
00:59:45,700 --> 00:59:47,800
WE KNOW WHERE THE SPACE
PIRATES OPERATE FROM...

1475
00:59:47,867 --> 00:59:49,067
AND WHO THEY ARE.

1476
00:59:49,133 --> 00:59:51,133
...BUT WE STILL DON'T KNOW
WHO'S BEHIND RINKMAN.

1477
00:59:51,200 --> 00:59:53,333
I THOUGHT WE WERE, SIR.

1478
00:59:53,400 --> 00:59:55,067
WE'LL KEEP
THE COLD LIGHT ON

1479
00:59:55,133 --> 00:59:57,067
UNTIL WE'RE OUT OF PRAA'S
GRAVITY FIELD.

1480
00:59:57,133 --> 01:00:00,133
I SURE HOPE THERE'S ENOUGH
ENERGY LEFT IN THE LAMP.

1481
01:00:00,200 --> 01:00:01,433
- WINKY, LOOK!
- THAT'S US.

1482
01:00:01,500 --> 01:00:03,400
A STRANGE SPACESHIP
HEADED FOR PRAA.

1483
01:00:03,467 --> 01:00:05,867
WOW, WE JUST
BLASTED OFF IN TIME.

1484
01:00:05,933 --> 01:00:07,867
RINKMAN'S BOSS IS PROBABLY
ON THAT SHIP,

1485
01:00:07,933 --> 01:00:10,033
AND I'D SURE LIKE
TO HAVE A LOOK INSIDE.

1486
01:00:10,100 --> 01:00:13,000
INSIDE THE BOSS?
THAT'S DISGUSTING!

1487
01:00:13,067 --> 01:00:16,533
THUNDERBIRDS ARE GO!

1488
01:00:18,500 --> 01:00:21,433
THIS YEAR'S WINTER CARNIVAL
KING AND QUEEN.

1489
01:00:21,500 --> 01:00:24,167
I'M CURIOUS, CLEOLANTA,
ABOUT THIS JOURNEY TO PRAA.

1490
01:00:24,233 --> 01:00:25,433
DO WE HAVE ENOUGH GAS?

1491
01:00:25,500 --> 01:00:28,033
THE TRUTH IS, ROCKY JONES
HAS BEEN TAKEN PRISONER

1492
01:00:28,100 --> 01:00:29,833
AND IS BEING HELD ON PRAA.

1493
01:00:29,900 --> 01:00:32,533
OH, SO THAT'S THE REASON
YOU'RE GIVING THIS YOUR
PERSONAL ATTENTION.

1494
01:00:32,600 --> 01:00:33,800
RAWRR!

1495
01:00:33,867 --> 01:00:36,167
IF YOU WERE AS SMART AS
MY CHIEF OFFICER SHOULD BE--

1496
01:00:36,233 --> 01:00:38,167
YOU'D BE HALF
AS SMART AS ME.

1497
01:00:38,233 --> 01:00:40,800
ROCKY JONES HAS CAUSED US
MORE DIFFICULTIES

1498
01:00:40,867 --> 01:00:43,033
THAN ANY OTHER PERSON
IN THE UNITED WORLDS.

1499
01:00:43,100 --> 01:00:44,333
I WANT HIM
TO WORK THE COUNTER.

1500
01:00:44,400 --> 01:00:46,067
I WANT HIM ON OUR SIDE.

1501
01:00:46,133 --> 01:00:49,267
YOU'VE FAILED BEFORE,
CLEOLANTA.

1502
01:00:49,333 --> 01:00:52,400
THIS TIME,
I'M NOT GOING TO FAIL.

1503
01:00:52,467 --> 01:00:54,800
I BOUGHT SOME JOVAN.

1504
01:00:57,133 --> 01:00:58,867
- UH...
- UH-OH.

1505
01:01:02,133 --> 01:01:03,700
AH, THE COLD RAY THING.

1506
01:01:03,767 --> 01:01:05,700
I THINK THEY WERE JUST
GOING ALONG WITH IT

1507
01:01:05,767 --> 01:01:09,867
- BECAUSE HE CAN SEE US.
- THIS IS THE XV-2
CALLING CASSA 7.

1508
01:01:09,933 --> 01:01:13,100
THIS IS CASSA 7.
GO AHEAD, XV-2.

1509
01:01:13,167 --> 01:01:15,867
- MESSAGE TO PAUL RAY...
- BITE ME.

1510
01:01:15,933 --> 01:01:17,633
WE ARE PROCEEDING
TO CASSA 7.

1511
01:01:17,700 --> 01:01:21,933
ANTICIPATE ARRIVAL
AT, UH, 400 SOLAR TIME.

1512
01:01:22,000 --> 01:01:24,600
TELL PAUL TO SAY HELLO
TO VENA AND BOBBY.

1513
01:01:24,667 --> 01:01:26,633
MESSAGE WILL BE
DELIVERED TO PAUL RAY.

1514
01:01:26,700 --> 01:01:29,633
- HE BOUGHT IT.
- THANK YOU, CASSA 7. OUT.

1515
01:01:29,700 --> 01:01:33,133
WELL, THERE'S THE PERIOD
ON THIS MISSION.

1516
01:01:33,200 --> 01:01:36,267
NO, WINKY, I THINK
THERE'S STILL A LOT MORE TO COME

1517
01:01:36,333 --> 01:01:38,200
BEFORE WE SEE THE END
OF THE SPACE PIRATES.

1518
01:01:38,267 --> 01:01:39,533
[GROANS]

1519
01:01:39,600 --> 01:01:42,233
WELL, I ONLY HOPE THAT
BETTY DOESN'T GET TIRED.

1520
01:01:42,300 --> 01:01:46,967
I TOLD HER TO WAIT FOR ME AT
THE BANDSTAND IN CENTRAL PARK.

1521
01:01:47,033 --> 01:01:50,733
YEAH, RIGHT, WINKY,
YOU LOSER.

1522
01:01:50,800 --> 01:01:52,733
WELL, THAT WAS SHORTER
THAN I THOUGHT IT WOULD BE.

1523
01:01:52,800 --> 01:01:54,100
- OH!
- [ROBOTS GROAN]

1524
01:01:54,167 --> 01:01:55,433
OH, GEE.

1525
01:01:59,933 --> 01:02:01,100
GRAND HOTEL, HOLD, PLEASE.

1526
01:02:01,167 --> 01:02:02,500
GRAND HOTEL,
GRAND HOTEL.

1527
01:02:02,567 --> 01:02:04,700
THIS IS CASSA 7
CENTRAL STATION. COME IN.

1528
01:02:04,767 --> 01:02:07,767
THIS IS THE XV-2 APPROACHING
GRAVITY FIELD.

1529
01:02:07,833 --> 01:02:10,067
WHAT IS YOUR
ESTIMATED TIME OF ARRIVAL?

1530
01:02:10,133 --> 01:02:12,433
UH, 2:00, 2:30-ISH.

1531
01:02:12,500 --> 01:02:14,200
WE'LL PREPARE
LANDING CLEARANCE.

1532
01:02:14,267 --> 01:02:18,133
PLEASE CONTACT CENTRAL
STATION WHEN YOU REACH
ALTITUDE 50 MILES.

1533
01:02:18,200 --> 01:02:20,633
HOLD ON, WINKY
WANTS TO SAY HI.

1534
01:02:22,500 --> 01:02:25,900
JEEZ, I BETTER GET
THIS PLACE CLEANED UP.

1535
01:02:25,967 --> 01:02:29,133
HEY, I'M IN HERE,
OCUPADO!

1536
01:02:29,200 --> 01:02:30,267
SORRY.

1537
01:02:38,133 --> 01:02:39,700
[BUZZING]

1538
01:02:39,767 --> 01:02:41,267
JANET, ANSWER!

1539
01:02:42,600 --> 01:02:44,700
THIS IS CASSA 7,
KEN SPEAKING.

1540
01:02:44,767 --> 01:02:47,267
I'D LIKE TO MAKE
A RESERVATION FOR TWO, PLEASE.

1541
01:02:47,333 --> 01:02:49,633
THE ORBIT JET
JUST REPORTED.

1542
01:02:49,700 --> 01:02:52,133
APPROACHING CASSA 7.

1543
01:02:52,200 --> 01:02:53,467
HE'S AN ODD DUCK.

1544
01:02:53,533 --> 01:02:56,200
- DO YOU HEAR ME?
- NO.

1545
01:02:56,267 --> 01:02:58,233
TELL HIM TO CONTACT YOU
FOR INSTRUCTIONS

1546
01:02:58,300 --> 01:03:00,400
AFTER
THE ORBIT JET LANDS.

1547
01:03:00,467 --> 01:03:03,000
CONTACT ME FOR INSTRUCTIONS
AFTER THE ORBIT JET LANDS.

1548
01:03:03,067 --> 01:03:04,700
OH, WELL, HERE,
YOU JUST TALK.

1549
01:03:04,767 --> 01:03:06,667
IS EVERYTHING GOING
AS PLANNED?

1550
01:03:06,733 --> 01:03:08,767
EVERYTHING'S
JUST FINE. OUT.

1551
01:03:08,833 --> 01:03:11,067
YOU MEAN EVERYTHING'S RUINED
BY YOUR STUPIDITY.

1552
01:03:11,133 --> 01:03:13,333
- D'OH!
- YEAH, THAT'S WHAT I MEANT.

1553
01:03:13,400 --> 01:03:15,400
I ARRIVE ON PRAA AND FIND
ROCKY JONES

1554
01:03:15,467 --> 01:03:17,200
HAS MADE FOOLS
OF THE WHOLE LOT OF YOU.

1555
01:03:17,267 --> 01:03:19,033
HE JUST VANISHED RIGHT
IN FRONT OF OUR EYES.

1556
01:03:19,100 --> 01:03:21,200
WHAT CAN YOU DO AGAINST
A SECRET LIKE THAT?

1557
01:03:21,267 --> 01:03:22,467
[ALL]
PUNT!

1558
01:03:22,533 --> 01:03:24,333
YOU CAN FIND OUT WHAT THE SECRET
IT AND USE IT YOURSELF,

1559
01:03:24,400 --> 01:03:26,033
BUT YOU LET HIM SLIP
RIGHT THROUGH YOUR FINGERS.

1560
01:03:26,100 --> 01:03:28,867
LET'S NOT MAKE A BIG ARGUMENT
OUT OF IT, ATLASAN.

1561
01:03:28,933 --> 01:03:30,667
- ROCKY'S GONE.
- OHH.

1562
01:03:30,733 --> 01:03:33,600
WHAT WE HAVE TO FIND OUT
IS HOW DO WE GET HIM BACK?

1563
01:03:33,667 --> 01:03:35,433
UNTIL WE DISPOSE OF HIM,

1564
01:03:35,500 --> 01:03:38,233
OUR VERY PROFITABLE TRAFFIC
IN UNITED PLANET SPACESHIPS

1565
01:03:38,300 --> 01:03:40,033
AND THEIR VALUABLE CARGOS
IS FINISHED.

1566
01:03:40,100 --> 01:03:41,533
LOOK, WE'RE NOT
GETTING ANYWHERE!

1567
01:03:41,600 --> 01:03:43,133
JARED PALMER.

1568
01:03:43,200 --> 01:03:44,600
MY ORDERS STAND.

1569
01:03:44,667 --> 01:03:47,033
I WANT ROCKY JONES ALIVE.

1570
01:03:47,100 --> 01:03:48,467
WHY, CLEOLANTA?

1571
01:03:48,533 --> 01:03:50,500
I JUST DON'T UNDERSTAND.

1572
01:03:50,567 --> 01:03:52,933
YOU DON'T HAVE TO
UNDERSTAND, RINKMAN.

1573
01:03:53,000 --> 01:03:54,933
NOW CONCENTRATE
ON THESE ORDERS.

1574
01:03:55,000 --> 01:03:57,633
- BITE ME.
- I WANT CASSA 7 TAKEN.

1575
01:03:57,700 --> 01:03:59,433
[AS FRANK NELSON]
YES?

1576
01:03:59,500 --> 01:04:01,033
OH, THAT'S NOT A BAD IDEA.

1577
01:04:01,100 --> 01:04:03,367
AND NOT TOO DIFFICULT
TO ACCOMPLISH.

1578
01:04:03,433 --> 01:04:06,700
INSTRUCT OUR AGENT KEN TO
IMMOBILIZE THEIR DEFENSES.

1579
01:04:06,767 --> 01:04:09,200
CASSA 7 SHOULD BE
A SITTING DUCK.

1580
01:04:09,267 --> 01:04:10,367
[QUACKING]

1581
01:04:10,433 --> 01:04:12,400
WE TAKE IT OVER AND ALL
THE VALUABLE EQUIPMENT

1582
01:04:12,467 --> 01:04:13,600
AND MATERIALS.

1583
01:04:13,667 --> 01:04:15,600
DON'T FAIL THIS TIME.

1584
01:04:15,667 --> 01:04:17,600
WE'RE RETURNING TO OPHESIUS.

1585
01:04:17,667 --> 01:04:19,433
WELL, TAKE THESE GIANT
BOOGERS WITH YOU.

1586
01:04:19,500 --> 01:04:20,767
ONE THING MORE...

1587
01:04:20,833 --> 01:04:23,267
YOU'LL NOT BE
WELCOME ON OPHESIUS

1588
01:04:23,333 --> 01:04:26,167
UNTIL YOU BRING ROCKY JONES
AS A PRISONER.

1589
01:04:26,233 --> 01:04:28,767
AND YOU'RE NOT INVITED
TO MY POOL PARTY EITHER.

1590
01:04:32,967 --> 01:04:36,467
[AS FRANK NELSON]
OH, SHE'S IN A FOUL MOOD.

1591
01:04:36,533 --> 01:04:39,667
WELL, WHY WASTE WORDS?

1592
01:04:39,733 --> 01:04:42,633
- THEY WON'T EVER BE HEARD.
- WE ARE IN THE UNFORTUNATE
POSITION

1593
01:04:42,700 --> 01:04:45,200
OF BEING OBLIGED TO DO
CLEOLANTA'S DIRTY WORK.

1594
01:04:45,267 --> 01:04:47,633
[AS CLOUSEAU]
MY FAKE ACCENT HELPS ME
DEAL WITH IT.

1595
01:04:47,700 --> 01:04:51,900
IF WE TAKE OVER CASSA 7
AND LAY HANDS ON ROCKY JONES,

1596
01:04:51,967 --> 01:04:53,367
WE'LL DO THE DICTATING.

1597
01:04:53,433 --> 01:04:55,067
I COULD BE THE SECRETARY.

1598
01:04:55,133 --> 01:04:57,567
RIGHT NOW WE HAVE TO WAIT
FOR WORD FROM KEN.

1599
01:04:57,633 --> 01:04:59,133
KEN'S A GOOD FRIEND.

1600
01:05:03,800 --> 01:05:08,433
STURGEON IN SPACE.

1601
01:05:08,500 --> 01:05:10,033
NOW ROCKY'S GONNA SHOW US

1602
01:05:10,100 --> 01:05:12,600
HOW TO EXECUTE A Y-TURN
IN THE FREE FALL.

1603
01:05:18,500 --> 01:05:20,500
PAUL, THIS IS KEN
AT LANDING CONTROLS.

1604
01:05:20,567 --> 01:05:22,433
YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHERE
I'M CALLING FROM.

1605
01:05:22,500 --> 01:05:23,967
THE ORBIT JET IS IN
THE PROCESS OF LANDING.

1606
01:05:24,033 --> 01:05:25,233
- KNOW WHAT I MEAN?
- GOOD.

1607
01:05:25,300 --> 01:05:26,667
I'LL BE THERE
IN A FEW MINUTES.

1608
01:05:26,733 --> 01:05:29,467
HAVE ROCKY WAIT FOR ME
THERE. OUT.

1609
01:05:31,167 --> 01:05:32,200
THAT WAS THE BAD GUYS.

1610
01:05:32,267 --> 01:05:33,800
HEY, IT'S 72 HERE
IN THE METRO AREA

1611
01:05:33,867 --> 01:05:36,367
AND THE ORBIT JET
IS IN THE PROCESS OF LANDING.

1612
01:05:39,200 --> 01:05:41,833
UH, I'M LANDING
ON BURNER NUMBER 3.

1613
01:05:41,900 --> 01:05:43,433
HEY, HE HIT MY BIG WHEEL.

1614
01:05:44,600 --> 01:05:45,967
HERE WE GO.

1615
01:05:46,033 --> 01:05:48,767
BUSY, BUSY, LOOK BUSY.

1616
01:05:48,833 --> 01:05:51,067
WELL, ALL SAFE
AND SHIP-SHAPE,

1617
01:05:51,133 --> 01:05:52,867
THANKS TO PROFESSOR NEWTON'S
COLD LIGHT.

1618
01:05:52,933 --> 01:05:55,267
NOW CAN WE GO
AFTER THE LADIES?

1619
01:05:55,333 --> 01:05:57,900
GET VENA ALL THE DETAILS ON
THE OPERATION OF THE COLD LIGHT

1620
01:05:57,967 --> 01:05:59,500
FOR HER REPORT TO
PROFESSOR NEWTON.

1621
01:05:59,567 --> 01:06:01,133
- WILL DO.
- WHEN I GET TO IT.

1622
01:06:01,200 --> 01:06:03,467
I'LL BET THOSE SPACE BUZZARDS
ON PRAA ARE STILL BUSY

1623
01:06:03,533 --> 01:06:05,833
TRYING TO FIGURE OUT WHAT
MADE THE ORBIT JET INVISIBLE.

1624
01:06:05,900 --> 01:06:09,000
I THINK WE CAN DEPEND ON
THEM TRYING TO FIND OUT.

1625
01:06:09,067 --> 01:06:12,500
- THAT'S WHAT I LIKE ABOUT YOU.
- HIT HIM, HIT HIM!

1626
01:06:12,567 --> 01:06:15,133
COME ON, WINKY, PAUL'S
PROBABLY WAITING FOR US.

1627
01:06:24,400 --> 01:06:26,833
JOEL, THIS MOVIE HURTS,
QUITE BAD, ACTUALLY.

1628
01:06:26,900 --> 01:06:28,000
YEAH, THERE ARE SOME THINGS

1629
01:06:28,067 --> 01:06:30,333
I'D PROBABLY CHANGE
IF I HAD MY WAY.

1630
01:06:30,400 --> 01:06:32,700
I DON'T GET WHY KEN AND
TAMMY AND CAPTAIN JOE

1631
01:06:32,767 --> 01:06:34,967
ARE FLYING TO THE PLANET
WITH THE GUY IN THE MIME GETUP

1632
01:06:35,033 --> 01:06:38,067
AND ALL THAT
♪ TRIED TO KILL HIM
WITH A FORKLIFT ♪

1633
01:06:38,133 --> 01:06:41,967
UH, CROW, LISTEN, THAT WAS,
LIKE, 20 EXPERIMENTS AGO, OKAY?

1634
01:06:42,033 --> 01:06:43,933
- IT WAS?
- OH, WE'RE GETTING
A TRANSMISSION

1635
01:06:44,000 --> 01:06:46,167
AND IT'S COMING FROM OUTSIDE
THE SHIP AND IT'S NOT THE MADS.

1636
01:06:46,233 --> 01:06:49,967
CAMBOT, PUT IT UP ON
THE HEXFIELD VIEW SCREEN PRONTO!

1637
01:06:50,033 --> 01:06:51,500
[ALL]
WINKY?

1638
01:06:51,567 --> 01:06:54,233
NO, ACTUALLY, MY NAME IS
WINCHESTER P. THORANDULER,

1639
01:06:54,300 --> 01:06:55,567
BUT YOU CAN CALL ME WINKY.

1640
01:06:55,633 --> 01:06:57,333
AH, WE'D CALL YOU THAT
EVEN IF YOU DIDN'T WANT US TO.

1641
01:06:57,400 --> 01:06:58,700
[JOEL]
CROW, COME ON.

1642
01:06:58,767 --> 01:07:01,100
HEY, WINKY, I THOUGHT YOU
WERE A FICTIONAL CHARACTER.

1643
01:07:01,167 --> 01:07:02,767
I DIDN'T KNOW YOU WERE
A REAL LIVE KID.

1644
01:07:02,833 --> 01:07:04,133
NO, I GET THAT A LOT, SEE,

1645
01:07:04,200 --> 01:07:05,633
'CAUSE I WAS A FRIEND
OF THE DIRECTOR'S

1646
01:07:05,700 --> 01:07:07,433
AND SO HE
CAST ME AS MYSELF.

1647
01:07:07,500 --> 01:07:09,333
THE DEAL IS WE USED TO
GO TO LUNCH A LOT,

1648
01:07:09,400 --> 01:07:11,467
AND WE'D GO TO THIS LITTLE
ITALIAN PLACE UP THE STREET

1649
01:07:11,533 --> 01:07:13,567
AND THEN USUALLY
I'D GET, LIKE, THE SALAD

1650
01:07:13,633 --> 01:07:16,333
AND THEN, LIKE, A PASTA DISH,
YOU KNOW, AS MY MAIN DISH

1651
01:07:16,400 --> 01:07:17,600
AND STILL GET A BEVERAGE

1652
01:07:17,667 --> 01:07:19,267
AND THEN I'D GET OUT FOR
UNDER SIX BUCKS, WHICH IS--

1653
01:07:19,333 --> 01:07:20,833
[TOM]
IS THERE A POINT
TO THIS, WINKY?

1654
01:07:20,900 --> 01:07:23,700
OH, YEAH. WELL, THE POINT IS
I FLEW MY INVISIBLE SPACESHIP

1655
01:07:23,767 --> 01:07:27,067
UP HERE AND TOOK TIME
OUT OF MY HOT AND SAVAGE
DATING LIFE,

1656
01:07:27,133 --> 01:07:29,200
WHAT WITH THE BEAUTIFUL,
INTENSE GIRLFRIENDS--

1657
01:07:29,267 --> 01:07:31,733
[JOEL]
OH, UH, WINKY,
YOU GO OUT WITH GIRLS

1658
01:07:31,800 --> 01:07:33,433
ON DATES AND STUFF, HUH?

1659
01:07:33,500 --> 01:07:34,733
SURE, YEAH.

1660
01:07:34,800 --> 01:07:36,167
[TOM]
I BET YOU MAKE TIME
WITH THE HONEYS

1661
01:07:36,233 --> 01:07:39,100
- REAL GOOD, HUH, WINKY?
- SURE.

1662
01:07:39,167 --> 01:07:41,433
[CROW]
WINKY, YOU'VE NEVER EVEN
TOUCHED A WOMAN, HAVE YOU?

1663
01:07:41,500 --> 01:07:43,700
YES, I HAVE!
UH, I'M A REAL SWINGER

1664
01:07:43,767 --> 01:07:46,233
AND YOU CAN SEE I'M UP HERE
IN MY INVISIBLE SPACESHIP.

1665
01:07:46,300 --> 01:07:48,533
UH, WINKY, UH,
OUR INSTRUMENTS SAY

1666
01:07:48,600 --> 01:07:51,567
THAT YOU'RE CALLING FROM
LADYSMITH, WISCONSIN.

1667
01:07:51,633 --> 01:07:53,500
WELL, WELL, THEN
YOUR INSTRUMENTS ARE WRONG

1668
01:07:53,567 --> 01:07:55,067
'CAUSE I'M ON MY
INVISIBLE SPACESHIP.

1669
01:07:55,133 --> 01:07:56,433
BUT LOOK AT ME,
I'M A REAL SWINGER.

1670
01:07:56,500 --> 01:07:57,967
WINKY, YOU'RE NOT A SWINGER.

1671
01:07:58,033 --> 01:07:59,367
YOU LOOK LIKE
HARDWARE HANK.

1672
01:07:59,433 --> 01:08:01,300
OH, YOU'RE REAL FUNNY,
RED BOY.

1673
01:08:01,367 --> 01:08:03,367
OH, WELL, MAYBE I'LL JUST
FLY BACK DOWN TO EARTH

1674
01:08:03,433 --> 01:08:05,267
TO PICK UP CLARISSA
AND TAWNY AND SUE

1675
01:08:05,333 --> 01:08:06,967
AND COME BACK UP HERE
AND PROVE TO YOU GUYS

1676
01:08:07,033 --> 01:08:08,533
THAT I DATE HOT,
SAVAGE WOMEN.

1677
01:08:08,600 --> 01:08:10,300
WINKY, WHY DON'T WE JUST
CALL YOUR MOTHER

1678
01:08:10,367 --> 01:08:11,567
AND GET THIS WHOLE
THING STRAIGHTENED OUT?

1679
01:08:11,633 --> 01:08:12,800
YOU GO RIGHT AHEAD,
I DON'T CARE.

1680
01:08:12,867 --> 01:08:14,367
- OKAY, WE WILL.
- OKAY, I DON'T CARE.

1681
01:08:14,433 --> 01:08:16,033
- YEAH, WE'RE DOING IT.
- LADYSMITH, WISCONSIN.

1682
01:08:16,100 --> 01:08:17,300
[WOMAN]
HELLO?

1683
01:08:17,367 --> 01:08:19,367
OH, HI, IS WINKY THERE?

1684
01:08:19,433 --> 01:08:21,933
HE'S IN THE BASEMENT.
HOLD ON A SECOND.

1685
01:08:22,000 --> 01:08:24,600
- THANK YOU.
- [DOOR CREAKING]

1686
01:08:24,667 --> 01:08:26,433
WINKY, TELEPHONE.

1687
01:08:26,500 --> 01:08:30,033
YEAH, CLARISSA, WHY DON'T YOU
START THE HOT OILS WARMING UP

1688
01:08:30,100 --> 01:08:31,333
AND I'LL BE
RIGHT UP, OKAY?

1689
01:08:31,400 --> 01:08:33,400
- WHAT?
- OH, MY-- WINKY,
THAT'S YOUR MOTHER!

1690
01:08:33,467 --> 01:08:35,367
IT IS NOT MY MOTHER,
IT'S CLARISSA--

1691
01:08:35,433 --> 01:08:36,833
NO, THAT'S YOUR MOTHER!
WINKY, HOW COULD YOU?

1692
01:08:36,900 --> 01:08:37,833
IT'S CLARISSA,
MY GIRLFRIEND,

1693
01:08:37,900 --> 01:08:39,000
AND SHE'S REAL PRETTY

1694
01:08:39,067 --> 01:08:40,500
AND MY GUESS IS YOU CAN
NEVER GET A GIRLFRIEND

1695
01:08:40,567 --> 01:08:42,500
EVEN HALF THAT GOOD
BECAUSE I'M A SWINGER

1696
01:08:42,567 --> 01:08:43,700
AND YOU'RE NOTHING,
YOU'RE NOTHING!

1697
01:08:43,767 --> 01:08:46,333
SHUT UP, SHUT UP,
SHUT UP, SHUT UP!

1698
01:08:47,567 --> 01:08:48,733
LOOK, I GOTTA GO.

1699
01:08:48,800 --> 01:08:50,233
CLARISSA'S A REAL TIGRESS
WHEN SHE'S ANGRY.

1700
01:08:50,300 --> 01:08:51,933
I'LL SEE YOU GUYS LATER.

1701
01:08:53,100 --> 01:08:54,167
[EXHALES]

1702
01:08:54,233 --> 01:08:55,600
YOU THINK WE WERE
A LITTLE HARD ON HIM?

1703
01:08:55,667 --> 01:08:58,900
UH, GUYS, I DON'T EVEN THINK
WE GOT THROUGH,

1704
01:08:58,967 --> 01:09:01,733
AND FOR WINKY'S SAKE
I HOPE WE NEVER DO.

1705
01:09:01,800 --> 01:09:02,867
WE'LL BE RIGHT BACK.

1706
01:09:02,933 --> 01:09:04,900
LET'S HAVE A LITTLE
QUIET TIME NOW.

1707
01:09:11,200 --> 01:09:13,433
THE IMPORTANT THING NOW IS
WE DISCOVERED RINKMAN'S...

1708
01:09:13,500 --> 01:09:15,800
- THERE HE IS AGAIN.
- [GROANS]

1709
01:09:15,867 --> 01:09:17,400
OH, WHEN I ASKED YOU
TO WAIT HERE FOR ME

1710
01:09:17,467 --> 01:09:18,733
I HAD A REASON.

1711
01:09:18,800 --> 01:09:21,100
I HAD TO SQUARE UP
MY BUTT, YOU SEE.

1712
01:09:21,167 --> 01:09:23,200
- KEN...
- I'M NOT A TRAITOR!

1713
01:09:23,267 --> 01:09:24,200
OH, YES.

1714
01:09:26,133 --> 01:09:27,467
THERE WAS SOMETHING
ABOUT THE DISAPPEARANCE

1715
01:09:27,533 --> 01:09:29,833
OF OUR CARGO SPACESHIPS
THAT BOTHERED ME.

1716
01:09:29,900 --> 01:09:32,600
HOW DID THE PIRATES
KNOW THE EXACT SCHEDULE?

1717
01:09:32,667 --> 01:09:35,000
- SO I CHECKED THE RECORDS.
- PURE GIBBERISH.

1718
01:09:35,067 --> 01:09:36,533
I FOUND THAT EACH
SPACESHIP REPORTED

1719
01:09:36,600 --> 01:09:38,333
FROM JUST OUTSIDE
OUR GRAVITY FIELD

1720
01:09:38,400 --> 01:09:40,300
- AND THEN VANISHED.
- YOUR LINE.

1721
01:09:40,367 --> 01:09:41,500
I SEE.

1722
01:09:41,567 --> 01:09:42,833
MAKING IT LOOK
AS IF RINKMAN

1723
01:09:42,900 --> 01:09:45,033
GOT HIS INFORMATION
FROM HERE.

1724
01:09:45,100 --> 01:09:46,767
WHY, IT SHOULD BE
EASY TO CHECK ON.

1725
01:09:46,833 --> 01:09:48,500
UNFORTUNATELY IT ISN'T.

1726
01:09:48,567 --> 01:09:51,600
THAT'S WHAT I MEANT:
NOT EASY TO CHECK.

1727
01:09:51,667 --> 01:09:52,800
- KEN HAD AN ASSISTANT
NAMED HAGARNEW.
- SAMMY HAGAR NEW?

1728
01:09:52,867 --> 01:09:54,100
HE WAS AN APPRENTICE
FROM MARS.

1729
01:09:54,167 --> 01:09:57,033
THE DAY VENA'S SHIP
DISAPPEARED, HE VANISHED.

1730
01:09:57,100 --> 01:09:58,567
ROCKY, YOUR LINE AGAIN.

1731
01:09:58,633 --> 01:10:00,433
I THINK YOU'LL EVENTUALLY
FIND YOUR TRAITOR, PAUL.

1732
01:10:00,500 --> 01:10:02,200
HAVE YOU LOOKED
IN THE GARAGE?

1733
01:10:02,267 --> 01:10:04,167
KEN, CONTINUE A CLOSE
GUARD AROUND HERE.

1734
01:10:04,233 --> 01:10:05,867
OF COURSE.

1735
01:10:05,933 --> 01:10:08,933
FOLLOW ME, MEN,
AND NO COMMENTS ABOUT
THE SQUARE BUTT, OKAY?

1736
01:10:10,867 --> 01:10:12,733
MMM, THE TRAITOR'S NOT ME,
I'M JUST SITTING HERE

1737
01:10:12,800 --> 01:10:15,400
AND I'M NOT BEING A TRAITOR,
MM-HMM.

1738
01:10:15,467 --> 01:10:17,100
♪ AND NOW TO EDEN ♪

1739
01:10:17,167 --> 01:10:21,133
♪ SLEEPY LITTLE FELLA
NODDIN' IN THE... ♪

1740
01:10:21,200 --> 01:10:23,667
- WINKY UNPLUGGED.
- SLEEPY LITTLE FELON?

1741
01:10:23,733 --> 01:10:26,100
♪ COULDN'T KEEP YOUR HEAD UP
IF YOU... ♪

1742
01:10:26,167 --> 01:10:29,300
LOOKS LIKE HE'S
STRUMMING PALISADES PARK.

1743
01:10:29,367 --> 01:10:32,100
♪ TAKE YOUR SHIP OF SLUMBER ♪

1744
01:10:32,167 --> 01:10:34,700
♪ WHERE NOTHING HARMS ♪

1745
01:10:34,767 --> 01:10:37,067
WINKY NEEDS
PROFESSIONAL HELP.

1746
01:10:37,133 --> 01:10:40,067
- ♪ ...WAS NOT A STAR... ♪
- JUST KILL ME, PLEASE KILL ME.

1747
01:10:40,133 --> 01:10:41,433
[SOBS]

1748
01:10:41,500 --> 01:10:44,600
HI, WELL, THINGS WENT--
OH, SORRY.

1749
01:10:47,633 --> 01:10:49,967
♪ IS WISHING AND BLINKING
A SLEEPY LITTLE ♪

1750
01:10:50,033 --> 01:10:51,367
[WHISPERS]
HEY, WINKY, COME BACK.

1751
01:10:51,433 --> 01:10:52,667
- EARTH TO WINKY.
- ♪ LITTLE LULLABY ♪

1752
01:10:52,733 --> 01:10:55,633
♪ AS DEEPER STILL WE... ♪

1753
01:10:55,700 --> 01:10:58,833
[ALL HOWLING]

1754
01:10:58,900 --> 01:11:02,400
♪ IN YOUR PALATIAL,
EXTRA SPACIAL ♪

1755
01:11:02,467 --> 01:11:05,667
♪ OUTBOUND DREAMER ♪

1756
01:11:05,733 --> 01:11:07,767
♪ TO THE STARS TOMORROW ♪

1757
01:11:07,833 --> 01:11:09,633
AHEM, HI, HON, I'M HOME.

1758
01:11:09,700 --> 01:11:11,067
[WHISPERS]
LET'S GO, COME ON.

1759
01:11:11,133 --> 01:11:15,300
♪ THE TRAIL WE BLAZE TONIGHT
WILL BE MY GUIDE ♪

1760
01:11:15,367 --> 01:11:16,733
[GROWLS]

1761
01:11:16,800 --> 01:11:20,300
- ♪ I'LL BET THE STARS... ♪
- I THINK IT'S DUMB.

1762
01:11:20,367 --> 01:11:22,167
♪ ...FRIENDLY LIGHT ♪

1763
01:11:22,233 --> 01:11:25,433
♪ AND SMILE 'CAUSE
THEY'RE REMEMBERIN' ♪

1764
01:11:25,500 --> 01:11:27,500
♪ A LITTLE TYKE ♪

1765
01:11:27,567 --> 01:11:31,667
THAT KID'S GONNA HAVE
THE DARKEST DREAMS
HE'S EVER HAD.

1766
01:11:31,733 --> 01:11:33,533
♪ ...LIGHTNING STRIKE ♪

1767
01:11:33,600 --> 01:11:37,100
♪ THE NIGHT HE MADE
THE STAR FIELD RISE ♪

1768
01:11:37,167 --> 01:11:38,233
YEAH, THAT'S NICE,
THANK YOU.

1769
01:11:38,300 --> 01:11:39,733
STINKY, IS IT?
OH, YEAH, WE'LL CALL YOU.

1770
01:11:39,800 --> 01:11:42,700
- OKAY, THANKS.
- ONE MORE TIME.

1771
01:11:42,767 --> 01:11:46,567
♪ AND THAT'S
THE STAR FIELD RAG ♪

1772
01:11:46,633 --> 01:11:48,467
DON'T YOU
EVER DO THAT AGAIN.

1773
01:11:48,533 --> 01:11:50,733
OH, VENA, WHEN YOU HAVE
THAT REPORT FINISHED,

1774
01:11:50,800 --> 01:11:53,067
WILL YOU SEND IT TO SECRETARY
DRAKE ON THE MESSAGE SCRAMBLER?

1775
01:11:53,133 --> 01:11:55,533
- IN A PIG'S EYE.
- WINKY, I'M GOING TO CHECK
OVER THE ORBIT JET.

1776
01:11:55,600 --> 01:11:57,533
- YOU WANT ME TO GO WITH YOU?
- NO, YOU STAY HERE.

1777
01:11:57,600 --> 01:11:59,267
- AND PRACTICE.
- I'LL BE BACK
BEFORE YOU TURN IN.

1778
01:12:01,267 --> 01:12:03,067
BOBBY'S SLEEPING,
AND IT'S FUNNY.

1779
01:12:03,133 --> 01:12:05,767
WE'LL BE BACK AFTER THIS WORD
FOR OXFORD DISHES.

1780
01:12:05,833 --> 01:12:07,200
- RINKMAN...
- OOH, BIG THUMB.

1781
01:12:07,267 --> 01:12:09,467
I ALSO CUT POWER
ON ALL DEFENSE UNITS.

1782
01:12:09,533 --> 01:12:11,567
CAN WE COME IN
FOR A LANDING?

1783
01:12:11,633 --> 01:12:13,600
I'LL STAND BY
AT CENTRAL STATION.

1784
01:12:13,667 --> 01:12:15,267
I'LL BRING YOU IN
BY GROUND CONTROL.

1785
01:12:15,333 --> 01:12:16,933
- TO MAJOR TOM.
- DON'T LET ROCKY JONES

1786
01:12:17,000 --> 01:12:18,967
BLAST OFF BEFORE WE ARRIVE.

1787
01:12:19,033 --> 01:12:20,733
HE WON'T FIND
THE ORBIT JET.

1788
01:12:20,800 --> 01:12:22,867
I SWITCHED ON
THE INVISIBILITY EQUIPMENT.

1789
01:12:22,933 --> 01:12:25,400
- YOU SCAMP!
- THAT'S THE EQUIPMENT WE WANT.

1790
01:12:25,467 --> 01:12:27,067
IT'S HERE, READY
TO BE TAKEN.

1791
01:12:27,133 --> 01:12:29,467
- OH, YES, OH, YES.
- [FOOTSTEPS]

1792
01:12:29,533 --> 01:12:31,300
SOMEBODY'S COMING. OUT.

1793
01:12:31,367 --> 01:12:32,667
SO I'LL PICK YOU UP
AT 7:00, THEN.

1794
01:12:32,733 --> 01:12:34,267
REALLY NOTHING
GOING ON HERE.

1795
01:12:34,333 --> 01:12:37,367
- JUST KIND OF--
- ♪ MAKE YOUR SHIP OF
SLUMBER OR NOTHING ♪

1796
01:12:37,433 --> 01:12:39,367
SO, MAKING A TORTILLA, HUH?

1797
01:12:39,433 --> 01:12:42,333
- AH, YOU'RE WORKING LATE.
- UH-- NO-NO-NOTHING, NOTHING.

1798
01:12:42,400 --> 01:12:44,533
I'LL DO IT OUT ON
24-HOUR DUTY.

1799
01:12:44,600 --> 01:12:47,100
I USE THE CHARTING ROOM
FOR LIVING QUARTERS.

1800
01:12:47,167 --> 01:12:49,167
I CAME TO CHECK
ON THE ORBIT JET.

1801
01:12:49,233 --> 01:12:51,067
IT ISN'T AT
THE LANDING PLATFORM.

1802
01:12:51,133 --> 01:12:53,067
[WHISPERS]
JOEL, LET'S LEAVE.

1803
01:12:53,133 --> 01:12:54,200
- WE CAN'T.
- PLEASE.

1804
01:12:54,267 --> 01:12:55,933
I WONDER WHERE IT
COULD HAVE BEEN TAKEN.

1805
01:12:56,000 --> 01:12:58,400
THE ONLY PLACE
SPACESHIPS CAN BE KEPT IS
AT ONE OF THE PLATFORMS.

1806
01:12:58,467 --> 01:13:00,200
- AT A COOL TEMPERATURE.
- AH, I SEE.

1807
01:13:00,267 --> 01:13:02,867
OH, HAVE YOU SEEN
ANYTHING OF HAGERNEW?

1808
01:13:02,933 --> 01:13:05,533
- NOT A SIGN.
- STOP ACCUSING ME!

1809
01:13:05,600 --> 01:13:07,333
I'LL CHECK THE PLATFORM
AGAIN JUST TO BE SURE.

1810
01:13:07,400 --> 01:13:09,133
SHOES FOR INDUSTRY,
COMRADE.

1811
01:13:10,833 --> 01:13:12,600
OH, WAIT, I FORGOT TO
VALIDATE YOUR PARKING.

1812
01:13:12,667 --> 01:13:13,867
[CACKLES]

1813
01:13:13,933 --> 01:13:16,600
KEN IS THAT CLOSE
TO A WRITTEN WARNING.

1814
01:13:19,233 --> 01:13:21,367
OH, HE'S GONNA DO
THE LETTERMAN THING.

1815
01:13:24,000 --> 01:13:25,933
TOP OF THE COUNTRY, MA!

1816
01:13:27,167 --> 01:13:28,800
AND THEY'RE GONE,
HUZZAH!

1817
01:13:28,867 --> 01:13:31,233
THEY'RE REALLY PROUD OF
THAT PROCESS, AREN'T THEY?

1818
01:13:31,300 --> 01:13:32,567
YEP, YEP.

1819
01:13:34,300 --> 01:13:37,967
MOM, I FOUND A SPACEMAN,
CAN I KEEP HIM?

1820
01:13:38,033 --> 01:13:40,400
OKAY, NOW YOU TWO
PLAY NICE TOGETHER.

1821
01:13:43,500 --> 01:13:44,667
I THINK YOU TWO
WILL GET ALONG.

1822
01:13:44,733 --> 01:13:46,467
ROCKY'S INTO SCIENCE, TOO.

1823
01:13:51,533 --> 01:13:53,667
- GOOD MORNING, SUNSHINE.
- TROTSKY?

1824
01:13:56,367 --> 01:14:00,167
DID YOU ALSO CATCH UP
WITH THE TRAITOR KEN?

1825
01:14:00,233 --> 01:14:03,133
- UH, UM, YEAH, SURE.
- HUH, SO IT WAS KEN.

1826
01:14:03,200 --> 01:14:04,467
JEEZ, I HATE
THAT GUY KEN.

1827
01:14:04,533 --> 01:14:06,533
I GUESS BOTH OF US
FOUND OUT TOO LATE.

1828
01:14:06,600 --> 01:14:08,567
YOU ARE AN EARTH MAN.

1829
01:14:08,633 --> 01:14:10,833
YES, ROCKY JONES.
I COMMAND THE ORBIT JET.

1830
01:14:10,900 --> 01:14:14,233
I AM HAGERNEW,
A MARTIAN.

1831
01:14:14,300 --> 01:14:16,433
THEY'RE LOOKING
FOR YOU AS THE TRAITOR.

1832
01:14:16,500 --> 01:14:18,867
KEN ARRANGED THAT
CLEVERLY,

1833
01:14:18,933 --> 01:14:22,367
AFTER I CAUGHT HIM GIVING
INFORMATION TO THE PIRATES.

1834
01:14:22,433 --> 01:14:24,600
HE HAD TO SILENCE ME.

1835
01:14:24,667 --> 01:14:26,833
YES, HE'S QUITE A HAND
AT THAT.

1836
01:14:26,900 --> 01:14:29,767
FOR TWO DAYS, I WAS
BOUND AND HELPLESS

1837
01:14:29,833 --> 01:14:32,133
IN THE CHARTING ROOM
AT CENTRAL STATION.

1838
01:14:32,200 --> 01:14:33,967
IT WASN'T THAT BAD, REALLY.

1839
01:14:34,033 --> 01:14:36,300
YESTERDAY I WAS PUT
INTO A DEEP SLEEP.

1840
01:14:36,367 --> 01:14:37,933
FOUND MYSELF HERE.

1841
01:14:38,000 --> 01:14:39,800
OH, YEAH, WINKY
SANG TO YOU, TOO, HUH?

1842
01:14:39,867 --> 01:14:41,000
WE'RE ON MY SHIP
THE ORBIT JET.

1843
01:14:41,067 --> 01:14:43,133
THAT'S WHERE KEN
MADE HIS MISTAKE.

1844
01:14:43,200 --> 01:14:44,900
I KNOW THE SHIP TOO WELL.

1845
01:14:44,967 --> 01:14:47,667
KEN IS AN EVIL MAN.

1846
01:14:47,733 --> 01:14:51,033
- HE'LL NOT STOP AT MURDER.
- KEN IS SICK, JUST ASK BARBIE.

1847
01:14:51,100 --> 01:14:53,500
- YEP.
- IF WE CAN GET OUT
OF THESE BONDS,

1848
01:14:53,567 --> 01:14:55,067
HE'LL HAVE
MISSED HIS CHANCE.

1849
01:14:55,133 --> 01:14:57,933
BUY BONDS WHERE
YOU WORK OR BANK.

1850
01:14:58,000 --> 01:14:59,167
WELL, ALLEY-OOP!

1851
01:14:59,233 --> 01:15:01,267
IN THE MEANTIME
THERE'S SOME EXERCISES

1852
01:15:01,333 --> 01:15:02,400
YOU CAN DO IN YOUR
OFFICE OR HOME

1853
01:15:02,467 --> 01:15:03,867
AND THEY'RE REALLY
GOOD FOR YOUR BACK.

1854
01:15:03,933 --> 01:15:06,300
OKAY, ONE, TWO, THREE.

1855
01:15:06,367 --> 01:15:08,033
NOW YOU TRY, COME ON.
ONE--

1856
01:15:11,500 --> 01:15:14,167
COME ON, LAY BACK DOWN.

1857
01:15:14,233 --> 01:15:15,767
IF I CAN STRETCH
THESE BONDS,

1858
01:15:15,833 --> 01:15:18,567
I MAY BE ABLE TO
SLIP 'EM OVER MY WRISTS.

1859
01:15:18,633 --> 01:15:21,967
LET'S SEE, IF I CAN
STRETCH THE BONDS.

1860
01:15:22,033 --> 01:15:23,300
[GRUNTS]

1861
01:15:25,200 --> 01:15:28,500
♪ SPACE GHOST ♪

1862
01:15:28,567 --> 01:15:30,433
I THINK
THEY'RE LOSING ALTITUDE.

1863
01:15:32,467 --> 01:15:34,933
THIS IS WALTER CRONKITE
WITH ROGER MAUDE

1864
01:15:35,000 --> 01:15:37,333
AND WE'RE SPACE PIRATES.
[CHUCKLING]

1865
01:15:37,400 --> 01:15:39,867
- THAT'S THE WAY IT WAS.
- [BUZZING]

1866
01:15:39,933 --> 01:15:42,733
THIS IS CASSA 7
CENTRAL STATION, COME IN.

1867
01:15:42,800 --> 01:15:45,267
RINKMAN HERE MAKING
APPROACH FOR LANDING.

1868
01:15:45,333 --> 01:15:47,867
NEUTRALIZE ALL CIRCUITS,
ACTIVATE GYROS.

1869
01:15:47,933 --> 01:15:50,367
- AND BRING ME ONE.
- WE'LL HANDLE CIRCUITS
AND GYROS.

1870
01:15:50,433 --> 01:15:53,600
- WITH FRIES.
- GROUND CONTROL WILL BRING
YOU IN FOR LANDING. OUT.

1871
01:15:55,300 --> 01:15:58,067
OH, LET'S SEE, A COUPLE
OF THESE, COUPLE OF THOSE.

1872
01:15:58,133 --> 01:16:00,600
HIT THAT ONE,
THERE WE GO.

1873
01:16:00,667 --> 01:16:02,500
OH, IF IT'S NOT ONE THING
IT'S ANOTHER.

1874
01:16:02,567 --> 01:16:04,300
OH, BROTHER.

1875
01:16:06,033 --> 01:16:10,600
♪ I SAW THE HARBOR LIGHTS ♪

1876
01:16:10,667 --> 01:16:12,200
HEY, CHECK IT OUT,
THEY'RE LANDING

1877
01:16:12,267 --> 01:16:14,833
ON THE COVER OF
A "POPULAR SCIENCE" MAGAZINE.

1878
01:16:14,900 --> 01:16:15,967
COOL.

1879
01:16:22,700 --> 01:16:24,833
- KILL THE PROPS.
- WELL, WE MADE IT, DOC.

1880
01:16:24,900 --> 01:16:27,133
NOW WE HAVE TO TAKE OVER
CASSA 7.

1881
01:16:27,200 --> 01:16:29,567
AND DO IT FAST.
GET MARKOV AND LINK IN HERE.

1882
01:16:29,633 --> 01:16:31,967
OH, WHY DON'T YOU TAKE
LINKOFF AND MARK IN THERE?

1883
01:16:34,833 --> 01:16:36,500
AVON CALLING?

1884
01:16:37,667 --> 01:16:40,000
HI, RAN UP HERE
ALL THE WAY TO MEET YOU.

1885
01:16:41,733 --> 01:16:44,833
- GENE KELLY, LOOK!
- FIRST THERE'S PAUL RAY,
TAKE HIM PRISONER.

1886
01:16:44,900 --> 01:16:47,000
HE'S HEAD OF THE ENTIRE
PROJECT AT CASSA 7.

1887
01:16:47,067 --> 01:16:48,867
- THEN WHAT?
- AFTER THAT IT WILL BE EASY.

1888
01:16:48,933 --> 01:16:50,467
WHERE DO WE FIND
THIS PAUL RAY?

1889
01:16:50,533 --> 01:16:51,533
I'LL SHOW YOU.

1890
01:16:51,600 --> 01:16:52,767
HERE, LET ME
SHOW YOU AROUND.

1891
01:16:52,833 --> 01:16:55,333
WE'LL TAKE OVER, THEN
WE'LL GRAB A BEER.

1892
01:16:55,400 --> 01:16:57,967
OKAY, NOW I WANT YOU
TO DO YOUR SPACE MATH.

1893
01:16:58,033 --> 01:17:00,800
SPACE TWO PLUS SPACE TWO
EQUALS SPACE FOUR.

1894
01:17:00,867 --> 01:17:04,500
- RINKMAN.
- JUST MAKING A LITTLE
SURPRISE VISIT.

1895
01:17:04,567 --> 01:17:07,167
WHAT ARE YOU DOING IN
ALAN BRADY'S OFFICE?

1896
01:17:07,233 --> 01:17:09,933
WE'VE COVERED THE AREA
AT LEAST A DOZEN TIMES, WINKY.

1897
01:17:10,000 --> 01:17:11,067
JOE PESCI.

1898
01:17:12,400 --> 01:17:14,433
- YEAH, GET WINKY!
- YEAH, THAT'S RIGHT.

1899
01:17:14,500 --> 01:17:16,000
- HIT HIM HARD.
- GO FOR WINKY.

1900
01:17:16,067 --> 01:17:17,300
REALLY HARD.

1901
01:17:17,367 --> 01:17:19,633
ARE YOU GUYS HUNGRY
FOR DINNER? [MUFFLED]

1902
01:17:19,700 --> 01:17:22,100
HEY, IT'S THE NELSONS
PULL IN HALF.

1903
01:17:22,167 --> 01:17:23,733
HOLD IT,
OR I'LL USE THIS.

1904
01:17:23,800 --> 01:17:25,900
- NOW DO BOBBY.
- YEAH!

1905
01:17:25,967 --> 01:17:28,367
- I SAID TO HOLD IT!
- TICKLE ME. [GIGGLES]

1906
01:17:28,433 --> 01:17:29,767
WE'RE TAKING CHARGE HERE,
AND IF YOU DON'T THINK SO

1907
01:17:29,833 --> 01:17:30,967
I'LL GIVE YOU
A TASTE OF THIS.

1908
01:17:31,033 --> 01:17:32,533
IT'S CHOCOLATE.

1909
01:17:32,600 --> 01:17:33,933
I THINK
IT'S SLIPPING LOOSE.

1910
01:17:34,000 --> 01:17:35,933
YEAH, RIGHT, WOULD YOU
LIKE TO HEAR MY PLAN?

1911
01:17:36,000 --> 01:17:37,600
[GRUNTING]

1912
01:17:39,467 --> 01:17:41,033
THERE, SEE, TOLD YA!

1913
01:17:42,167 --> 01:17:44,100
UH, DON'T START
WALKING YET, ROCKY.

1914
01:17:44,167 --> 01:17:45,700
NOW IT'S TIME
FOR A GRANOLA BAR.

1915
01:17:45,767 --> 01:17:47,100
I NEED QUICK ENERGY.

1916
01:17:50,800 --> 01:17:52,100
OOH, MY WRIST! OW.

1917
01:17:52,167 --> 01:17:54,467
HEY, WHY IS THAT LADDER
GOING SIDEWAYS?

1918
01:17:54,533 --> 01:17:56,033
'CAUSE IT'S SPACE, GET IT?

1919
01:17:56,100 --> 01:17:58,867
- SEE, IT'S SPACE.
- OH, SORRY, SORRY.

1920
01:18:00,367 --> 01:18:03,567
- AH, IT'S OKAY.
- KEN KEEPS ON
THE AUTOMATIC LOCK.

1921
01:18:03,633 --> 01:18:05,933
HE DIDN'T KNOW THERE'S
A WAY TO HANDLE THAT.

1922
01:18:06,000 --> 01:18:08,400
- WITH A HANDLE.
- THERE'S AN EMERGENCY
CIRCUIT BREAKER HERE.

1923
01:18:14,700 --> 01:18:16,600
IT'S THE SIGN OF PIZZA.

1924
01:18:16,667 --> 01:18:18,400
WHOA, WATCH THAT
LAST STEP.

1925
01:18:20,600 --> 01:18:22,867
OH, NO,
THE ANARCHISTS ARE HERE.

1926
01:18:26,933 --> 01:18:29,867
GOOD THING I HAPPENED TO HAVE
SOME SANDPAPER IN MY POCKET.

1927
01:18:31,600 --> 01:18:34,200
[CHUCKLES]
I ALWAYS CARRY CHALK.

1928
01:18:36,533 --> 01:18:37,700
LET'S SEE.

1929
01:18:37,767 --> 01:18:41,367
MOOKIE IS A DOPE.

1930
01:18:42,767 --> 01:18:44,633
OH, THAT'S IN
"BREAKFAST OF CHAMPIONS."

1931
01:18:44,700 --> 01:18:45,800
- YEAH.
- OH, I REMEMBER.

1932
01:18:45,867 --> 01:18:47,167
MM-HMM.

1933
01:18:47,233 --> 01:18:49,567
[BEEPING]

1934
01:18:52,533 --> 01:18:54,300
WHOA, ALMOST FOOLED MYSELF.

1935
01:18:54,367 --> 01:18:55,467
BOY, I'M GOOD.

1936
01:18:59,000 --> 01:19:00,367
IT'S COLD FILTERED.

1937
01:19:00,433 --> 01:19:03,200
- HMM, LET'S SEE, THE-- OH?
- [DOOR OPENS]

1938
01:19:03,267 --> 01:19:06,233
- HANDS OFF, GREEN MAN.
- THE ORBIT JET IS INVISIBLE.

1939
01:19:06,300 --> 01:19:08,333
I DON'T THINK KEN WILL BE
ABLE TO FIND IT AGAIN.

1940
01:19:08,400 --> 01:19:11,400
I AM FRANK TO SAY
I AM PUZZLED.

1941
01:19:11,467 --> 01:19:13,367
- WELL SAID, MARTIAN.
- KEN HAD THE PLATFORM MARKED

1942
01:19:13,433 --> 01:19:15,800
SO HE'D KNOW WHERE
THE INVISIBLE SHIP WAS LOCATED.

1943
01:19:15,867 --> 01:19:18,400
I ERASED THE MARKS AND PUT
THEM ON ANOTHER PLATFORM.

1944
01:19:18,467 --> 01:19:20,867
- AREN'T I SNEAKY? [GIGGLES]
- I'D LIKE TO SEE KEN'S FACE

1945
01:19:20,933 --> 01:19:22,333
WHEN HE LOOKS
FOR THE ORBIT JET.

1946
01:19:22,400 --> 01:19:24,200
OH, YOU KOOKY--
IMAGINE HIS SURPRISE

1947
01:19:24,267 --> 01:19:27,000
WHEN HIS SKULL HITS
THE PAVEMENT, YOU'RE SO NUTS.

1948
01:19:28,733 --> 01:19:30,233
THE ORBIT JET'S INVISIBLE.

1949
01:19:30,300 --> 01:19:32,267
I MARKED THE PLATFORM.
COME ON.

1950
01:19:32,333 --> 01:19:33,967
NOW LET'S TUNE IN
TO KEN'S FACE

1951
01:19:34,033 --> 01:19:36,900
AS HE TRIES TO FIND
THE ORBIT JET. [CHUCKLES]

1952
01:19:38,467 --> 01:19:40,733
WE'LL WALK RIGHT INTO
THE INVISIBLE VAN.

1953
01:19:40,800 --> 01:19:42,533
NOW WATCH MY FACE
HERE WHEN I TRY TO--

1954
01:19:42,600 --> 01:19:43,967
WHERE IS
THIS INVISIBLE VAN?

1955
01:19:44,033 --> 01:19:45,500
I DON'T UNDERSTAND IT.

1956
01:19:45,567 --> 01:19:47,067
YOU SURE YOU KNOW
WHAT YOU'RE DOING?

1957
01:19:47,133 --> 01:19:48,467
I LEFT THE SHIP RIGHT HERE.

1958
01:19:48,533 --> 01:19:51,367
MAYBE AN INVISIBLE
TOW TRUCK CAME AND, NO...

1959
01:19:51,433 --> 01:19:53,200
THERE'S NOTHING HERE,
REAL OR INVISIBLE.

1960
01:19:53,267 --> 01:19:55,367
ROCKY JONES AND THE MARTIAN
ARE ON THE SHIP TIED UP.

1961
01:19:55,433 --> 01:19:57,833
- I SAID IT AND I'M GLAD.
- IF I KNOW ROCKY JONES,

1962
01:19:57,900 --> 01:19:59,267
HE DIDN'T STAY
TIED UP LONG.

1963
01:19:59,333 --> 01:20:00,567
BUT HE COULDN'T GET AWAY.

1964
01:20:00,633 --> 01:20:02,467
IF HE DID, HE'S GOT
THE ORBIT JET

1965
01:20:02,533 --> 01:20:04,267
AND CLEOLANTA
WILL HAVE YOUR NECK.

1966
01:20:04,333 --> 01:20:05,767
I'LL FIND THE SHIP.

1967
01:20:05,833 --> 01:20:08,200
IF I HAVE TO SEARCH
ALL THREE PADS.

1968
01:20:08,267 --> 01:20:10,100
I'LL GET ROCKY'S CREW
INTO MY SHIP

1969
01:20:10,167 --> 01:20:11,733
AND SEND THEM
ALONG TO OPHESIUS.

1970
01:20:11,800 --> 01:20:13,267
WITH HIS FRIENDS IN DANGER,

1971
01:20:13,333 --> 01:20:15,767
ROCKY JONES WILL SOON
SHOW HIS HAND.

1972
01:20:15,833 --> 01:20:17,933
YES, YOU TOOK THE WORDS
RIGHT OUT OF MY MIND.

1973
01:20:18,000 --> 01:20:19,633
WHAT DO YOU DO, OLD MAN?

1974
01:20:19,700 --> 01:20:22,500
IF THE ORBIT JET IS LOST,
SO ARE YOU.

1975
01:20:22,567 --> 01:20:24,533
OH, I'M SORRY,
YOUR MAJESTY.

1976
01:20:24,600 --> 01:20:26,567
UH, WHERE DID THE ROCKET--
OH HO!

1977
01:20:26,633 --> 01:20:28,200
NO STEPPING, OH.

1978
01:20:28,267 --> 01:20:30,267
"AN AMERICAN IN PARIS."

1979
01:20:34,933 --> 01:20:36,467
WERE YOU LOOKING
FOR ME, KEN?

1980
01:20:36,533 --> 01:20:39,567
- [GASPS]
- NO, I WAS LOOKING FOR...

1981
01:20:39,633 --> 01:20:41,433
THIS CHAIR!
THAT'S IT! HUH!

1982
01:20:42,933 --> 01:20:44,733
OH, I CAN'T BELIEVE
I FELL FOR THAT.

1983
01:20:46,700 --> 01:20:48,100
LOOK, JUST ANSWER
MY QUESTION--

1984
01:20:48,167 --> 01:20:50,133
OOF! WHO ARE YOU
LOOKING FOR? [GRUNTS]

1985
01:20:53,833 --> 01:20:55,867
- OH.
- ALL RIGHT, I'VE GOT
A NICE PLACE FOR YOU.

1986
01:20:55,933 --> 01:20:58,933
IT'S A DAYS INN, IT'S NOT
ELABORATE BUT IT'S CLEAN.

1987
01:20:59,000 --> 01:21:01,333
- MOVE!
- I'M A GRIMALD WARRIOR.

1988
01:21:01,400 --> 01:21:02,967
[FAKE SOBBING]

1989
01:21:04,667 --> 01:21:06,867
OKAY, OKAY,
THAT'S PERFECT, STEVE.

1990
01:21:06,933 --> 01:21:09,000
YEAH, GOOD SPECIAL EFFECT,
REALLY TRICKS THE EYE.

1991
01:21:09,067 --> 01:21:11,200
- IT'S EDITH ANNE.
- OH.

1992
01:21:11,267 --> 01:21:12,633
[EXHALES THROUGH LIPS]

1993
01:21:15,000 --> 01:21:17,133
JUST A LITTLE PAINT,
COVER THE RUST.

1994
01:21:19,000 --> 01:21:21,767
BUT, SILLY PUTTY? WHY?

1995
01:21:27,033 --> 01:21:29,500
OH, MAN, HE'S WIPING
BOOGERS ON THE ROCKET.

1996
01:21:29,567 --> 01:21:31,700
THOSE ARE SOME BIG BOOGERS,
LET ME TELL YOU.

1997
01:21:31,767 --> 01:21:34,567
NOW I GOTTA GO CHANGE
THE SAND IN THE ASHTRAYS.

1998
01:21:36,667 --> 01:21:38,000
FUNNY HOW THINGS CHANGE, HUH?

1999
01:21:38,067 --> 01:21:39,500
FUNNY HOW THE HUNTER
BECOMES THE HUNTED.

2000
01:21:39,567 --> 01:21:40,833
HOLD IT!

2001
01:21:44,400 --> 01:21:46,033
WHOSE SHIP IS THAT
ON THE NEXT PLATFORM?

2002
01:21:46,100 --> 01:21:47,767
IT'S THE GOOD SHIP LOLLIPOP.

2003
01:21:47,833 --> 01:21:50,133
WHOSE SHIP IS IT?

2004
01:21:50,200 --> 01:21:51,633
GO AHEAD ON THREE!

2005
01:21:51,700 --> 01:21:54,700
- ON THE SHIP.
- SOUNDS LIKE KEN'S IN TROUBLE.

2006
01:21:54,767 --> 01:21:56,067
HOLD THEM HERE.

2007
01:21:59,333 --> 01:22:00,333
GO ON.

2008
01:22:02,200 --> 01:22:04,167
THAT'S SO COOL, IT'S LIKE
ROMULAN CLOAKING DEVICE.

2009
01:22:04,233 --> 01:22:05,967
THE KLINGONS HAD ONE, TOO.

2010
01:22:06,033 --> 01:22:08,700
OH, JEEZ,
I REALLY HAD TO GO.

2011
01:22:08,767 --> 01:22:11,133
I FEEL TEN POUNDS LIGHTER.
[CHUCKLES]

2012
01:22:13,600 --> 01:22:16,300
LET'S SEE, IS THAT NOT IT
OR IS IT DOWN THERE NOT IT?

2013
01:22:16,367 --> 01:22:18,100
YOUR POCKETS
ARE SPEAKING TO YOU.

2014
01:22:18,167 --> 01:22:19,667
THEY'RE TRYING TO
TELL YOU SOMETHING.

2015
01:22:19,733 --> 01:22:21,600
- [WHISPERS] KEN, KEN.
- WAIT A MINUTE.

2016
01:22:21,667 --> 01:22:24,167
- I'M A YOUNG BUDDY EBSEN.
- THAT'S IMPOSSIBLE.

2017
01:22:25,700 --> 01:22:26,900
NOBODY'S INSIDE.

2018
01:22:26,967 --> 01:22:28,667
LOCK THEM
IN THE REAR SECTION.

2019
01:22:28,733 --> 01:22:29,833
THEY'VE GOT A LONG
JOURNEY AHEAD.

2020
01:22:29,900 --> 01:22:32,167
- RIGHT, LET'S GO.
- LINK.

2021
01:22:32,233 --> 01:22:35,100
[GASPS] WE'RE GONNA HAVE
THE INTERROGATION OUTSIDE.

2022
01:22:35,167 --> 01:22:36,800
DOC WILL GO ALONG
AS NAVIGATOR.

2023
01:22:36,867 --> 01:22:38,000
WHEN WILL WE BLAST OFF?

2024
01:22:38,067 --> 01:22:40,000
AS SOON AS I CONTACT
CLEOLANTA AND EXPLAIN...

2025
01:22:40,067 --> 01:22:42,033
- CLEO LAINE?
- I'LL GIVE YOU THE WORD.

2026
01:22:42,100 --> 01:22:44,967
MARKOV AND I WILL BE
USING PAUL RAY'S QUARTERS.

2027
01:22:45,033 --> 01:22:46,833
GENE, YOU KEEP SINGING
AND DANCING.

2028
01:22:46,900 --> 01:22:48,367
♪ GOTTA DANCE ♪

2029
01:22:48,433 --> 01:22:49,467
UH, MAKE IT TIGHT.

2030
01:22:49,533 --> 01:22:51,133
UH, TIGHTER,
I CAN GET OUT OF THIS.

2031
01:22:51,200 --> 01:22:53,400
- MAKE IT TIGHTER.
- KEN WON'T GIVE US
ANY MORE TROUBLE.

2032
01:22:53,467 --> 01:22:54,967
THANKS FOR THE UPDATE,
QUISP.

2033
01:22:55,033 --> 01:22:56,367
OUR NEXT JOB
IS TO TAKE RINKMAN.

2034
01:22:56,433 --> 01:22:58,700
HE'S WANTED BACK ON EARTH
TO ANSWER FOR HIS CRIMES.

2035
01:22:58,767 --> 01:23:01,167
PERHAPS HE'LL ANSWER
FOR THEM SOONER THAN THAT.

2036
01:23:01,233 --> 01:23:02,467
WHAT DO YOU MEAN,
HAGERNEW?

2037
01:23:02,533 --> 01:23:05,100
I WANTED TO BE CERTAIN
THE TRAITORS ARE DESTROYED.

2038
01:23:05,167 --> 01:23:08,433
I INSERTED TONIDE ALPHA
INTO THE ROCKET TUBES

2039
01:23:08,500 --> 01:23:10,200
OF RINKMAN'S SPACESHIP.

2040
01:23:10,267 --> 01:23:11,933
THAT'LL BLOW 'EM TO BITS
WHEN THEY BLAST OFF.

2041
01:23:12,000 --> 01:23:14,600
YES, THE TRAITORS
WILL BE DESTROYED.

2042
01:23:14,667 --> 01:23:16,167
AND IT WILL LEAVE
A HUGE STAIN.

2043
01:23:16,233 --> 01:23:17,600
I WANT THEM
ALIVE, HAGERNEW.

2044
01:23:17,667 --> 01:23:19,867
I DON'T GET EARTH PEOPLE.

2045
01:23:25,433 --> 01:23:26,867
WINKY? PAUL?

2046
01:23:26,933 --> 01:23:28,333
- SCOOTER?
- DIANE?

2047
01:23:28,400 --> 01:23:29,333
- CHOPPER?
- CHIEF?

2048
01:23:29,400 --> 01:23:30,667
McCLOUD.

2049
01:23:30,733 --> 01:23:31,900
[MIMICS GROWL]

2050
01:23:35,833 --> 01:23:37,900
OH, NOW
IT'S A PHAEDO FARCE.

2051
01:23:40,200 --> 01:23:41,367
"THE JACK BENNY PROGRAM."

2052
01:23:41,433 --> 01:23:43,500
DR. VANKO, LINK,
COME IN.

2053
01:23:43,567 --> 01:23:45,033
[AS FRANK NELSON]
I'LL GET IT.

2054
01:23:45,100 --> 01:23:46,367
YES, RINKMAN?

2055
01:23:46,433 --> 01:23:48,700
YOU CAN BLAST OFF
ANY TIME, DOC.

2056
01:23:48,767 --> 01:23:50,933
WHAT DID YOU ARRANGE
WITH CLEOLANTA?

2057
01:23:51,000 --> 01:23:53,067
SHE'S SENDING
TWO SPACESHIPS WITH TROOPS

2058
01:23:53,133 --> 01:23:54,567
TO POLICE THIS PROJECT.

2059
01:23:54,633 --> 01:23:57,067
CAN YOU HOLD ON
UNTIL THEY ARRIVE?

2060
01:23:57,133 --> 01:23:58,500
THE TROOPS WILL BE
TAKING OVER

2061
01:23:58,567 --> 01:24:01,167
BEFORE THE PEOPLE HERE
KNOW THAT PAUL RAY'S MISSING.

2062
01:24:01,233 --> 01:24:03,133
COME BACK AS SOON
AS YOU CAN, DOC.

2063
01:24:03,200 --> 01:24:04,500
- WE'LL NEED YOU HERE.
- I MISS YA, MISS YA A LOT.

2064
01:24:04,567 --> 01:24:06,833
- GOOD FLYING.
- AND FOR YOU GOOD HUNTING.

2065
01:24:06,900 --> 01:24:08,433
YOU'LL HAVE TO FIND
ROCKY JONES.

2066
01:24:08,500 --> 01:24:10,533
GOOD FISHING,
GOOD CAMPING, GOOD EATING.

2067
01:24:10,600 --> 01:24:13,800
- RINKMAN!
- I FOUND ROCKY JONES!

2068
01:24:15,800 --> 01:24:17,400
WHERE ARE PAUL RAY
AND MY CREW?

2069
01:24:17,467 --> 01:24:19,767
- YOU'RE A LITTLE LATE, ROCKY.
- WHERE ARE THEY?

2070
01:24:19,833 --> 01:24:23,000
THEY ARE DUE TO BLAST OFF
CASSA 7 AT ANY MOMENT.

2071
01:24:23,067 --> 01:24:26,967
- ON WHICH SHIP?
- THERE'S ONLY
TWO SHIPS OUT THERE!

2072
01:24:27,033 --> 01:24:28,933
DON'T LET THEM
BLAST OFF, RINKMAN.

2073
01:24:29,000 --> 01:24:32,167
STOP BLUFFING, ROCKY,
YOU TRY TO HOLD THE SHIP.

2074
01:24:32,233 --> 01:24:33,400
YOU'VE GOT TO STOP 'EM.

2075
01:24:33,467 --> 01:24:35,233
THE SHIP'S IN DANGER
OF BLOWING UP

2076
01:24:35,300 --> 01:24:37,133
FOLKS, THOUGHT WE'D RELIVE
THE SCENE WE JUST DID

2077
01:24:37,200 --> 01:24:38,967
- ONLY THIS TIME...
- BINGO.

2078
01:24:42,133 --> 01:24:43,533
[CHUCKLES] SHUT MYSELF UP.

2079
01:24:43,600 --> 01:24:45,567
NEVER REALLY
DID THAT BEFORE.

2080
01:24:45,633 --> 01:24:47,533
WILL THE PERSON WITH
THE SHINY ROCKET

2081
01:24:47,600 --> 01:24:49,100
PLEASE MOVE IT?
IT'S GLARING.

2082
01:24:49,167 --> 01:24:50,800
[CLICKING]

2083
01:24:50,867 --> 01:24:51,833
STARBOARD ROCKET.

2084
01:24:51,900 --> 01:24:53,300
I'M WEARING MY STRIP
OF BACON TODAY.

2085
01:24:53,367 --> 01:24:55,067
[SPUTTERING]

2086
01:24:55,133 --> 01:24:58,533
[COUGHING]

2087
01:24:58,600 --> 01:25:01,333
AH, SOMEBODY JAMMED
A POTATO IN THE EXHAUST PIPE.

2088
01:25:01,400 --> 01:25:03,367
YEAH, IT REGISTERED.

2089
01:25:03,433 --> 01:25:06,067
FIRE THE STARBOARD
ROCKET AGAIN.

2090
01:25:06,133 --> 01:25:08,267
- [SPUTTERS]
- JEEZ, I WAS JUST
TALKING TO MY ANALYST

2091
01:25:08,333 --> 01:25:10,867
AND THINGS GOT WEIRD.

2092
01:25:10,933 --> 01:25:14,000
DR. VANKO, LINK,
COME IN, URGENT.

2093
01:25:14,067 --> 01:25:15,433
[BUZZING]

2094
01:25:15,500 --> 01:25:17,967
THAT'S THE SIGNAL, DOC,
TAKE IT.

2095
01:25:18,033 --> 01:25:19,567
- YO.
- DR. VANKO.

2096
01:25:19,633 --> 01:25:21,033
DOC, TROUBLE.

2097
01:25:21,100 --> 01:25:22,833
ROCKY JONES ON HIS WAY
TO THE SHIP.

2098
01:25:22,900 --> 01:25:23,933
HOLD BLASTOFF.

2099
01:25:24,000 --> 01:25:25,967
- TAKE HIM.
- WE'LL HANDLE HIM.

2100
01:25:26,033 --> 01:25:27,900
YES, IT'S DR. SMITH
AND MR. MOONEY

2101
01:25:27,967 --> 01:25:30,300
AS YOU'VE NEVER
SEEN THEM BEFORE.

2102
01:25:30,367 --> 01:25:32,267
- [GASPS] ROMEO, ROMEO...
- ROCKY'S HERE.

2103
01:25:32,333 --> 01:25:34,267
OPEN THE HATCH
THEN KEEP ME COVERED.

2104
01:25:38,000 --> 01:25:39,733
OKAY, NOW, WE'LL TURN OUT
THE LIGHTS

2105
01:25:39,800 --> 01:25:42,400
AND WHEN HE COMES IN--
OH, THIS IS GONNA BE SO GOOD.

2106
01:25:46,367 --> 01:25:48,533
[HUMMING "STAR TREK"
FIGHT MUSIC]

2107
01:25:48,600 --> 01:25:50,067
FORGET IT.

2108
01:25:53,100 --> 01:25:55,800
- I WILL SEE-- HUH?
- TAKE VANKO. THIS ONE'S MINE.

2109
01:25:55,867 --> 01:25:57,333
AND AWAY!

2110
01:25:58,700 --> 01:26:00,367
GOOD JOB, WINKY.

2111
01:26:03,733 --> 01:26:05,600
OOH, RIGHT IN THE WINKY.
OWW!

2112
01:26:05,667 --> 01:26:09,033
THAT'S FOR BETTY
AND FOR TAWNY.

2113
01:26:13,367 --> 01:26:16,200
- [GRUNTS]
- WHOA, WHOA, WINKY!

2114
01:26:17,800 --> 01:26:19,733
OH, JUST IN TIME,
SQUARE BUTT.

2115
01:26:23,833 --> 01:26:25,567
I KNEW ROCKY WAS
ALL RIGHT, VENA.

2116
01:26:25,633 --> 01:26:26,667
YOU DON'T KNOW NOTHING,
YOU LITTLE PUNK.

2117
01:26:26,733 --> 01:26:27,933
OF COURSE, BOBBY.

2118
01:26:28,000 --> 01:26:29,900
OH, PAUL,
YOU DON'T KNOW HOW CLOSE

2119
01:26:29,967 --> 01:26:31,933
- YOU CAME TO OBLIVION.
- OH, PAUL?

2120
01:26:32,000 --> 01:26:34,200
HAGARNEW LOADED THE ROCKETS
WITH TONIDE ALPHA.

2121
01:26:34,267 --> 01:26:36,867
WOW, HE WAS LUCKY
I THOUGHT OF KNOCKING OUT

2122
01:26:36,933 --> 01:26:38,200
THOSE FUEL PUMPS,
WASN'T HE?

2123
01:26:38,267 --> 01:26:39,867
I KNEW WE COULD
DEPEND ON YOU, WINKY.

2124
01:26:39,933 --> 01:26:42,233
BOBBY SHOWED US A NEW TRICK
WITH HIS PEN KNIFE.

2125
01:26:42,300 --> 01:26:44,567
- A TRACHEOTOMY.
- ...OPEN THE DOOR CONTROLS.

2126
01:26:44,633 --> 01:26:47,067
WELL, I HAD TO DO SOMETHING,
DIDN'T I, ROCKY?

2127
01:26:47,133 --> 01:26:49,267
WELL, THAT'S WHY
YOU TOOK ME ALONG.

2128
01:26:49,333 --> 01:26:51,267
- [DRY LAUGH]
- BOBBY, YOU'RE WONDERFUL.

2129
01:26:51,333 --> 01:26:53,333
OH, PAUL, THERE ARE
A COUPLE MORE PRISONERS

2130
01:26:53,400 --> 01:26:55,533
AT YOUR QUARTERS WE HAVE TO
PICK UP TO ADD TO THESE.

2131
01:26:55,600 --> 01:26:57,800
- AND THROW BOBBY IN THERE.
- AND WE'VE GOT TO TAKE THEM
BACK TO EARTH TO TURN THEM IN.

2132
01:26:57,867 --> 01:26:59,167
OH, DID YOU FIND
THE ORBIT JET?

2133
01:26:59,233 --> 01:27:00,800
YES, AND SHE'S READY
FOR BLASTOFF.

2134
01:27:00,867 --> 01:27:02,833
- AND SO AM I.
- PAUL, ONE MORE DETAIL.

2135
01:27:02,900 --> 01:27:05,300
- BITE ME.
- THERE ARE TWO SPACESHIPS
HEADED HERE FROM OPHESIUS.

2136
01:27:05,367 --> 01:27:07,633
I'LL KNOW WHAT TO DO
WITH 'EM: BLAST 'EM.

2137
01:27:11,033 --> 01:27:12,633
OH, HAPPINESS FADES.

2138
01:27:12,700 --> 01:27:15,433
BACK TO THE DARK RECESSES
OF MY HIDEOUS LIFE.

2139
01:27:16,700 --> 01:27:19,833
[SINGING "GAMERA"
SONG IN JAPANESE]

2140
01:27:24,167 --> 01:27:26,500
LOOKS LIKE YOU GOT
THE WORST OF IT, NED.

2141
01:27:26,567 --> 01:27:28,600
HEY, ROCKY, WHAT TIME
DO WE LAND ON EARTH

2142
01:27:28,667 --> 01:27:32,800
- WITH OUR CARGO OF TRAITORS?
- YEAH, WHY, IS BETTY
WAITING FOR YOU?

2143
01:27:32,867 --> 01:27:34,133
OH, WONDERFUL.

2144
01:27:34,200 --> 01:27:35,767
HEY, HOW ABOUT USING
THE ASTRO PHONE?

2145
01:27:35,833 --> 01:27:37,633
I'VE ALREADY REPORTED
TO SECRETARY DRAKE.

2146
01:27:37,700 --> 01:27:38,933
AND THAT'S
AN EGGPLANT, WINKY.

2147
01:27:39,000 --> 01:27:41,800
YEAH, WELL, UH, YOU SEE,
I WANTED TO CALL BETTY.

2148
01:27:41,867 --> 01:27:43,467
I WANT TO SEE IF SHE'S
STILL WAITING FOR ME

2149
01:27:43,533 --> 01:27:45,000
AT THE BANDSTAND
IN CENTRAL PARK.

2150
01:27:45,067 --> 01:27:47,233
- OHH...
- DO IT! SPACE WHACK HIM!

2151
01:27:47,300 --> 01:27:49,167
I'LL ASK HER IF SHE HAS
A FRIEND FOR YOU.

2152
01:27:52,400 --> 01:27:54,867
IS THIS IT? IS THIS IT?
I'M HOLDING MY BREATH.

2153
01:27:54,933 --> 01:27:56,167
- IS THIS IT?
- WHOO-HOO!

2154
01:27:56,233 --> 01:27:57,700
- YAY!
- YAY!

2155
01:27:57,767 --> 01:27:59,100
WHOO!

2156
01:28:13,267 --> 01:28:14,767
HELLO, EARTH!

2157
01:28:14,833 --> 01:28:16,433
[MIMICS GUITAR FUZZ]

2158
01:28:16,500 --> 01:28:18,000
NO, YOU SEE, JOEL,
THE THING IS THAT I CAN'T--

2159
01:28:18,067 --> 01:28:20,067
[MIMICS GUITAR FUZZ]

2160
01:28:20,133 --> 01:28:21,633
NOW, I WOULD FEEL LIKE IT
IF SOMEBODY CAME UP AND--

2161
01:28:21,700 --> 01:28:25,500
[MIMICS GUITAR FUZZ
AND FINGER TAPPING]

2162
01:28:30,300 --> 01:28:31,433
NOW, JOEL, COME ON,

2163
01:28:31,500 --> 01:28:33,100
BEING AN AMPLIFIER
MAKES MY INNARDS VIBRATE

2164
01:28:33,167 --> 01:28:34,967
AND YOU KNOW WHAT, JUST
MAKES ME FEEL ALL FUNNY.

2165
01:28:35,033 --> 01:28:37,300
OH, COME ON, TOM,
CROW'S HAVING A GOOD TIME.

2166
01:28:37,367 --> 01:28:39,000
- AREN'T YOU?
- I WOULDN'T GO THAT FAR, JOEL.

2167
01:28:39,067 --> 01:28:41,033
AND WATCH OUT FOR MY EYES,
THEY'RE BRAND NEW.

2168
01:28:41,100 --> 01:28:42,800
HERE, YOU GUYS,
I'LL SING A SONG

2169
01:28:42,867 --> 01:28:44,467
AND THAT'LL PROBABLY
MAKE YOU FEEL BETTER.

2170
01:28:44,533 --> 01:28:46,333
SHADOW ME, OKAY,
MR. AMPLIFIER?

2171
01:28:46,400 --> 01:28:49,267
OKAY.
[MIMICS GUITAR CHORDS]

2172
01:28:52,100 --> 01:28:54,433
♪ SLEEPY LITTLE FELLA ♪

2173
01:28:54,500 --> 01:28:56,933
♪ NODDIN' IN MY ARMS ♪

2174
01:28:57,000 --> 01:29:00,267
♪ COULDN'T KEEP YOUR HEAD UP
IF YOU TRIED ♪

2175
01:29:00,333 --> 01:29:01,833
OH, I FEEL SO MUCH
BETTER NOW.

2176
01:29:01,900 --> 01:29:04,567
- [MIMICS GUITAR CHORDS]
- ♪ TAKE YOUR SHIP OF SLUMBER ♪

2177
01:29:04,633 --> 01:29:07,033
♪ WHERE NOTHING HARMS ♪

2178
01:29:07,100 --> 01:29:11,900
♪ AN ASTRO BOY WHO'S ON
A STAR FIELD RIDE ♪

2179
01:29:11,967 --> 01:29:15,300
OH, JOEL, FOR GOD'S SAKE,
I'M NOT A STRATOCASTER!

2180
01:29:15,367 --> 01:29:17,967
- OHH!
- [MIMICS GUITAR NOODLING]

2181
01:29:19,233 --> 01:29:22,600
[MIMICS SUSTAINED NOTE]

2182
01:29:22,667 --> 01:29:25,033
- [CARTOON HEAD SHAKE]
- OH, I'M SORRY, YOU GUYS.

2183
01:29:25,100 --> 01:29:26,633
- [PANTING]
- LISTEN, I GOT A, UH,

2184
01:29:26,700 --> 01:29:28,500
I GOT A LETTER HERE,

2185
01:29:28,567 --> 01:29:30,700
AND PUT THAT UP ON
STILL STORE, CAMBOT.

2186
01:29:30,767 --> 01:29:32,233
THIS IS FROM TY RICKMAN,

2187
01:29:32,300 --> 01:29:34,267
AND HE'S GOT SOME PICTURES,
THEY'RE COOL.

2188
01:29:34,333 --> 01:29:35,533
THEY'RE PRETTY NEAT,
AREN'T THEY?

2189
01:29:35,600 --> 01:29:36,800
COULD YOU HURRY IT UP A BIT?

2190
01:29:36,867 --> 01:29:38,267
I'M NOT SURE HOW LONG
I CAN HOLD THIS POSITION.

2191
01:29:38,333 --> 01:29:39,633
- OKAY, ALL RIGHT.
- PLEASE. NO.

2192
01:29:39,700 --> 01:29:43,333
I'M GONNA READ TY'S LETTER
BY USING THE GOLDEN THROAT.

2193
01:29:43,400 --> 01:29:45,200
OH, NO, NO, JOEL,
NOT THE GOLDEN THROAT.

2194
01:29:45,267 --> 01:29:47,867
I MUST PRO--
[MIMICS TALK BOX EFFECT]

2195
01:29:47,933 --> 01:29:49,967
♪ I REALLY LOVE YOU ♪

2196
01:29:50,033 --> 01:29:52,433
♪ I REALLY DIG
YOUR WAY HIP SHOW ♪

2197
01:29:52,500 --> 01:29:54,433
♪ I TAPE YOU ON
FRIDAY NIGHTS ♪

2198
01:29:54,500 --> 01:29:57,867
♪ WATCH YOU AS YOU HAPPEN
ON SAT MORNING ♪

2199
01:29:57,933 --> 01:30:01,000
♪ AND WATCH THE ONE
ON TAPE AFTERWARDS ♪

2200
01:30:01,067 --> 01:30:03,000
[MIMICS GUITAR FUZZ]

2201
01:30:03,067 --> 01:30:04,267
♪ UH, BACK-TO-BACK ♪

2202
01:30:04,333 --> 01:30:06,233
♪ IT'S THE ONLY WAY
TO GO ♪

2203
01:30:06,300 --> 01:30:08,767
♪ TOM SERVO REALLY
NEEDS A WOMAN ♪

2204
01:30:08,833 --> 01:30:10,633
♪ KEEP UP THE GOOD WORK ♪

2205
01:30:10,700 --> 01:30:13,267
♪ I REALLY WANT TO-- ♪♪
NOW, NOW, COME ON, JOEL!

2206
01:30:13,333 --> 01:30:15,000
ON TOP OF EVERYTHING,
I'VE GOT TO PUT UP

2207
01:30:15,067 --> 01:30:16,300
WITH THESE
GRATUITOUS INSULTS,

2208
01:30:16,367 --> 01:30:18,833
AND TO THINK OF ALL I DO
FOR THE SHIP AROUND HERE.

2209
01:30:18,900 --> 01:30:20,333
WELL, I'VE SIMPLY HAD IT,
MY FRIEND.

2210
01:30:20,400 --> 01:30:21,567
HEY, YOU KNOW WHAT?

2211
01:30:21,633 --> 01:30:23,300
LET'S SEE WHAT THE SYSTEM
CAN REALLY DO, OKAY?

2212
01:30:23,367 --> 01:30:25,267
HERE COMES
A PETE TOWNSHEND WINDMILL.

2213
01:30:25,333 --> 01:30:26,967
- HERE WE GO.
- PLEASE-- JOEL, JOEL,
HEY, HEY!

2214
01:30:27,033 --> 01:30:28,800
I'M NOT A
RICKENBACKER 330 SEMI!

2215
01:30:28,867 --> 01:30:32,333
- I'M YOUR FRIEND CROW!
- [MIMICS GUITAR NOODLING]

2216
01:30:32,400 --> 01:30:35,267
WHAT DO YOU THINK, SIRS?

2217
01:30:35,333 --> 01:30:38,467
SO ANYWAY, READING
JEAN-PAUL SARTRE

2218
01:30:38,533 --> 01:30:40,667
OPENED UP
A WHOLE NEW WORLD FOR ME.

2219
01:30:40,733 --> 01:30:43,300
SUDDENLY BEING A SHIFT
SUPERVISOR AT ARBY'S

2220
01:30:43,367 --> 01:30:44,700
WASN'T ENOUGH ANYMORE.

2221
01:30:44,767 --> 01:30:46,667
I HAD TO SAY TO MYSELF,

2222
01:30:46,733 --> 01:30:49,067
I HAVE TO DO
WHAT'S RIGHT FOR FRANK.

2223
01:30:49,133 --> 01:30:51,367
I HAVE TO DO WHAT'S GONNA
MAKE FRANK FEEL GOOD

2224
01:30:51,433 --> 01:30:53,900
IN THIS COLD,
HEARTLESS MODERN WORLD.

2225
01:30:53,967 --> 01:30:56,433
FRANK, WHEN I GET OUT OF THIS,
I'M GOING TO KILL YOU.

2226
01:30:56,500 --> 01:30:58,933
AH, THE EXISTENCE
OF VAGUE THREATS

2227
01:30:59,000 --> 01:31:00,933
THAT NO ONE CAN
DO ANYTHING ABOUT.

2228
01:31:01,000 --> 01:31:02,267
IT'S NOT A VAGUE
THREAT, FRANK.

2229
01:31:02,333 --> 01:31:03,700
I'M GOING TO KILL YOU.

2230
01:31:05,267 --> 01:31:09,200
♪♪
